oid#插件与-tdlibabi-v1","content":"| 字段            | 说明            |\n| ------------- | ------------- |\n| `abi_version` | 插件编进去的 ABI 版本 |","table":"table-6"},"197":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-83","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v1","content":"| 字段      | 说明                                                         |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `state` | `active` / `pending` / `activating` / `failed` / `unknown` |","table":"table-6"},"198":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-84","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v1","content":"| 字段                       | 说明                         |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------------- |\n| `inject` / `soft_inject` | 硬 / 软依赖（manifest 优先，配置段兜底） |","table":"table-6"},"199":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-85","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v1","content":"| 字段              | 说明       |\n| --------------- | -------- |\n| `path` / `file` | 插件文件与文件名 |","table":"table-6"},"200":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-86","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v1","content":"| 字段                   | 说明                                                    |\n| -------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `missing` / `reason` | 仅 `pending` 有 `missing`（还缺哪些能力），仅 `failed` 有 `reason` |","table":"table-6"},"201":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-87","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v1","content":"状态是**现算**的（内核的插件报告），不是装插件那一刻的快照。装完插件、登录**之前**就\n能查，登录窗口期间也可以。运行时不在跑时返回**同一份形状**的空表（计数全 0、两个数组\n为空），不是 `null`，也不是错误。"},"202":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-88","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v1","content":"`nativeTdRequest` 的规矩："},"203":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-89","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v1","content":"发出去的是**原始 td_api JSON**，响应原样回来：`{\"@type\":\"user\",…}`；\nTDLib 的业务错误也是**正常响应**（`{\"@type\":\"error\",\"code\":…,\"message\":…}`），不是 `null`。"},"204":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-90","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v1","content":"`null` 只表示**没拿到响应**：运行时没起来、JSON 非法、发不出去、超时。原因读\n`nativeLastError()`（**线程局部**：要在同一个线程上紧接着读）。"},"205":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-91","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v1","content":"`timeoutMs <= 0` → 默认 30 秒，上限 600 秒。"},"206":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-92","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v1","content":"**阻塞**：放到 `Dispatchers.IO` 之类的线程上。"},"207":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-93","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v1","content":"⚠️ 别在 `onState` / `onAsk` 回调里调它：那些回调就跑在库的工作线程上，等响应等于\n自己等自己——库会认出这条线程并立刻返回 `null`。"},"208":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-94","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#c-符号逃生门","content":"不走 JNI 也能直接用这 9 个 C 符号（头文件在包里）："},"209":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-95","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#c-符号逃生门","content":"返回码：`0` 成功、`1` 参数错、`2` 已在运行、`3` 超时、`4` 内部 panic（已兜住）、`5` 内部错\n（细节看 `fuyubot_last_error()`）。三个返回字符串的函数同一套纪律：**线程局部缓冲**，\n下次在同一线程调本库前有效，别 free、别存、别跨线程传。\n纯 C 宿主没有回调通道：登录请在 options 里提供 `bot_token`。"},"210":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-96","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#与命令行的关系","content":"同一个 bot 两种跑法，session 互相通用："},"211":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-97","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#与命令行的关系","content":"两者都走 `fuyubot-app` 的同一套顺序（装插件 → 登录 → 分发 → 收摊），区别只在宿主：\n一个把提问打到控制台，一个抛成 Java 回调；`data/` 里的 TDLib session 两边是同一份格式。"},"212":{"id":