[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                                                | 允许吗       |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | --------- |\n| `event` / `service` / `tool` / `middleware` 互相依赖 | 禁止（彼此不依赖） |","table":"table-0"},"233":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                                   | 允许吗       |\n| ----------------------------------- | --------- |\n| `fuyubot-tdlib-sys` → 任何 fuyu crate | 禁止（它是最底层） |","table":"table-0"},"234":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-21","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                                                  | 允许吗         |\n| -------------------------------------------------- | ----------- |\n| `fuyubot-loader` → 四个机制 + `tdlib` + `abi` + `core` | 允许（**只有它**） |","table":"table-0"},"235":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-22","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                                           | 允许吗           |\n| ------------------------------------------- | ------------- |\n| `fuyubot-app` → `core` / `loader` / `tdlib` | 允许（编排层；反过来禁止） |","table":"table-0"},"236":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-23","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"组合只发生在两处：`HostRuntime::new`（把四个机制 `install` 进 `Context`）与 `HostRuntime` 里的\n27 个 `unsafe extern \"C\"` 桥（VTable 的 27 个函数指针各对应一个）。四个机制 crate 绝不彼此调用。"},"237":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-24","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#编排层fuyubot-app","content":"启动顺序、登录、收摊这一串**只有一份实现**，在 `fuyubot-app` 里；CLI 与 Android 的 JNI 运行时\n都只是它的宿主："},"238":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-25","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#编排层fuyubot-app","content":"| 谁             | 只负责                                                       |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-app` | 内核 → 宿主运行时 → 接 TDLib → 装插件 → 登录 → 分发 → 收摊；`AppHost` 的三个出口 |","table":"table-1"},"239":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-26","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#编排层fuyubot-app","content":"| 谁             | 只负责                                               |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-cli` | clap、实例锁、`.fuyubot/status` 发布、`--replay`、重登循环、TUI |","table":"table-1"},"240":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-27","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#编排层fuyubot-app","content":"| 谁                 | 只负责                                     |\n| ----------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-android` | C / JNI 符号、目录与日志重定向、停止位、JNI 版 `AppHost` |","table":"table-1"},"241":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-28","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#编排层fuyubot-app","content":"`AppHost` 只有三个方法——`state(state, detail)` / `ask(kind, prompt)` / `qr(link)`——所以「宿主」\n可以是控制台、终端面板或 Java 回调，编排层完全不知道自己在跟谁说话。"},"242":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-29","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#顺序为什么不能换","content":"| 步   | 动作                        | 不能换的理由                               |\n| --- | ------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| ①   | 指 `TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH`（可选） | 必须在建客户端**之前**：`TdClient::new` 只读进程环境 |","table":"table-2"},"243":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-30","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#顺序为什么不能换","content":"| 步   | 动作              | 不能换的理由 |\n| --- | --------------- | ------ |\n| ②   | `Kernel::start` | —   