么不能反过来：`attach_tdlib` 之前 `td_send` 走「没接 TDLib」分支（请求只留档 + 合成请求号，\n起点 `1 << 48`），而插件在 `plugin_start` 里就发请求（模板与示例都这样）；分发排在插件加载之后，\n否则插件漏订阅。`--replay` / `--no-tdlib` 故意不 attach——回放是离线验证。"},"269":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-56","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"数据流：一条主干，两条回程"},"270":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-57","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"插件的调用经 HostApiVTable 落到 HostRuntime，再翻译成 TdClient 的 send 或 execute；接收循环把回来的东西分成 Update（分发）与 Response（回投）两条路。"},"271":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-58","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"插件"},"272":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-59","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"on / invoke / emit / td_invoke / td_execute / get_config / …"},"273":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-60","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"HostApiVTable"},"274":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-61","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"27 个函数指针，首参一律是 host，全是 Option"},"275":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-62","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"HostRuntime"},"276":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-63","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"翻译成事件总线 / 服务容器 / 工具表 / 中间件管线 / TdClient"},"277":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-64","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"发请求"},"278":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-65","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"同步执行"},"279":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-66","page_id":"/d