1":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-78","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"emit_scoped(owner, \"response\", …)"},"292":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-79","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"`process`（吃 `&str`）只是 `process_value` 的前半段（解析 JSON 再交给它）；接收循环那条路\n本来就有 `Value`，所以走 `process_value`。"},"293":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-80","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"| 阶段                                                            | 数值            | 谁跑它                             |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `Stage::PreUpdate` / `PreRoute` / `InPlugin` / `PostResponse` | 0 / 1 / 2 / 3 | `UpdatePipeline::process_value` |","table":"table-3"},"294":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-81","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"| 阶段                                    | 数值    | 谁跑它                                          |\n| ------------------------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `Stage::PreToolCall` / `PostToolCall` | 4 / 5 | **目前没有生产调用方**（只有 `fuyubot-middleware` 自己的测试） |","table":"table-3"},"295":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-82","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"六阶段的数值在 `fuyubot-abi::Stage`，与 `fuyubot-middleware::Stage` 一一对应，由 `runtime.rs` 的\n`stage_numbers_match_the_middleware_crate` 测试钉住。"},"296":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-83","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"三条容易搞错的语义："},"297":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-84","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"**归属是「额外定向」，不是「排除广播」**：`emit` 发给所有订阅者，`emit_scoped(owner, …)` 是\n「全局 + 该归属」。响应因此对所有插件透明。"},"298":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-85","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"**中间件一条更新跑一遍，不是每个监听器跑一遍**：`InPlugin` 的产出就是所有监听器看到的版本\n（按监听器各跑一遍的话，第 N 个会看到被改过 N 次的 payload）。"},"299":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-86","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"**过滤器里的 `event_type` 键只用来选通道**，不参与负载匹配；等响应写\n`{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":N}`。"},"300":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-87","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#宿主预置的两张表","content":"`HostRuntime` 除了四个机制，还内置两张跨插件表："},"301":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-88","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#宿主预置的两张表","content":"**命令能力表** `fuyubot.host.commands`：插件 `start()` 里登记，宿主按 owner 回滚；\n`/help` 只读它，`role` / `scopes` / `hidden` 由闸门和 `/help` 共同消费。"},"302":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-89","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#宿主预置的两张表","content":"**TDLib 对象缓存** `fuyubot.host.cache`：chat / user / 群 / 社区 / 成员的全量 JSON，\n每种默认 100 条 LRU；管线在中间件之前把原始 `update*` 刷进去，`Simplify` 缓存优先。\nchat list 是独立索引，不占 100 条配额。"},"303":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-90","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#宿主预置的两张表","content":"两者都走命名服务，不新增 ABI 函数指针。权限表的 `chat_admin` / 频道判定读缓存；\n缓存未命中且离线时直接返回，不会在接收循环上等 TDLib。"},"304":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-91","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"`HostRuntime::plugin_scope()` 给这次加载分配一个 owner id，之后所有跨 ABI 的注册\n（订阅 / 工具 / 服务 / 中间件）都记在这个 owner 名下（`RegistrationKind` + `Registration`）。\n`scope.commit()` 保留；提前 drop（init 失败、start 报错、ABI 不匹配）或 `LoadedPlugin` 被 drop 时，\n`rollback_owner(owner)` 一次性撤掉这批注册；宿主自己（owner 0）不受影响。"},"305":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-92","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"`LoadedPlugin` 的字段声明顺序就是卸载顺序：先 `plugin_stop`，再 `rollback_owner`，\n最后 `_lib: Library` 才 drop——到这一步动态库才真正卸载。"},"306":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-93","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"中间插件要批量托管脚本时，用**内置 scope 服务**（`get_service(\"fuyubot.host.scope\")`）开子作用域：\n`create` 出的子作用域从当前作用域栈继承 owner（脱离加载线程的场景——比如 watch 线程——要先建\nroot scope 再 `enter`，否则 owner 退化成宿主 0，卸载时回滚不到），注册落在子作用域里，\n`rollback_scope` 可以只撤这一批；插件卸载时连 owner 一起收。"},"307":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-94","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"**唯一的例外是 Go 的 c-shared 库**：它的运行时有线程与信号处理器，卸载后进程会 access violation\n（`0xC0000005`，而且崩在退出那一刻）。`PluginLoader` 用文件里的 Go buildinfo 魔数认出 Go 产物，\n对这类库 `plugin_stop` 与注册回滚照跑，但**故意不卸载那个 `Library`**，让它映射到进程退出。\n代价是「同一进程内反复加载同一个 Go 插件」不可靠（热重载路径），收益是 Go 插件能正常用。"},"308":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-95","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"每个插件有两个依赖列表：`inject`（硬）与 `soft_inject`（软）。它们**只影响准入与顺序**，\n不影响加载——插件已经 `dlopen` 进来了，只是还没轮到它跑。"},"309":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-96","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"依赖解析：硬依赖管准入，软依赖管排序"},"310":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-97","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"每轮先退掉依赖已消失的，再激活一个：硬依赖不齐就停在 Pending，齐了就按「软依赖也齐的先」排序后激活；激活失败会级联到依赖它的插件。"},"311":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-98","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"插件清单"},"312":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-99","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"注册顺序 = 文件名字典序，所以同层 tie-break 是确定的"},"313":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-100","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"每轮 reconcile：先退后进"},"314":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-101","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"依赖不再满足的先 Deactivate，然后只推进一个 fiber"},"315":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-102","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"硬依赖（inject）全可用？"},"316":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-103","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"不齐"},"317":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-104","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"齐了"},"318":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-105","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Pending：等着"},"319":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-106","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"不是失败——提供者可能只是还没起来"},"320":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-107","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"按软依赖排序"},"321":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-108","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"软依赖也齐的先，其余排后面"},"322":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-109","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"激活这一个 fiber"},"323":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-110","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"跑 apply，注册落进它自己的作用域"},"324":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-111","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Active"},"325":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-112","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Failed"},"326":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-113","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"级联到依赖它的"},"327":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-114","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"四条规则："},"328":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-115","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"**硬依赖不齐 → 不激活**，停在 `Pending`。这是「等」，不是「错」——提供者可能只是排在后面还没轮到。"},"329":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-116","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"**软依赖不齐 → 照样激活**，只是排在有软依赖的后面（两轮扫描：先扫软的也齐了的，再扫其余）。"},"330":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-117","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"**每轮只推进一个 fiber**，先退后进。一轮的推进量有保险丝（`2n + 16`），万一依赖图构了环也不会卡死。"},"331":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-118","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"**激活失败 → 级联**：依赖它的插件一并标 `Failed`，因为那个提供者永远回不来了。"},"332":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-119","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"四种状态怎么走"},"333":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-120","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Pending 等到依赖齐了才进 Activating；apply 成功是 Active，报错是 Failed；Active 的依赖消失会退回 Pending。Failed 是终态。"},"334":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-121","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Pending"},"335":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-122","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Activating"},"336":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-123","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Active"},"337":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-124","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Failed"},"338":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-125","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"依赖齐"},"339":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-126","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"成功"},"340":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-127","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"apply 报错"},"341":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-128","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"依赖消失 → Deactivate（退回等着）"},"342":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-129","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"`Pending` 与 `Failed` 的分界就是「还可能好」和「不会好了」：`is_permanently_missing` 只在\n提供者**已经 Failed** 时返回真。服务表里没有、也没有同名 fiber 的依赖，一律保持 `Pending`——\n它可能是以后才出现的服务（比如另一个插件在外层作用域里 later 才 provide）。"},"343":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-130","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"进程边界：动态库插件同进程，脚本插件一进程一脚本"},"344":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-131","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"宿主进程里跑 fuyubot 本体、原生 cdylib 插件、以及 fuyubot.script 这个中间插件；中间插件再用 uv run / bun 起子进程跑脚本。"},"345":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-132","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"宿主进程（同一个地址空间）"},"346":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-133","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"fuyubot 宿主"},"347":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-134","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"原生插件 cdylib"},"348":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-135","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"Rust / C / C++"},"349":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-136","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"中间插件 cdylib"},"350":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-137","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"fuyubot.script"},"351":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-138","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"dlopen · C ABI"},"352":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-139","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"uv run / bun"},"353":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-140","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"子进程（一进程一脚本）"},"354":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-141","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"脚本 A"},"355":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-142","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"main.py"},"356":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-143","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"脚本 B"},"357":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-144","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"index.ts"},"358":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-145","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"脚本经薄 SDK 回调 → 中间插件（原生桥）→ 宿主；子进程死了宿主只记一条错，不跟着崩。"},"359":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-146","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|         | 动态库插件             | 脚本插件（目录形态）    |\n| ------- | ----------------- | ------------- |\n| 进程 / 边界 | 与宿主同进程；C ABI 函数调用 | 一进程一脚本；经原生桥回调 |","table":"table-4"},"360":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-147","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|      | 动态库插件 | 脚本插件（目录形态）                                   |\n| ---- | ----- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| 脚本定位 | 不适用   | manifest（`[tool.fuyubot]` / `\"fuyubot\"`）声明入口 |","table":"table-4"},"361":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-148","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|     | 动态库插件                 | 脚本插件（目录形态）                                 |\n| --- | --------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 装载  | `plugin install <产物>` | `plugin install <目录>` → `plugins/scripts/` |","table":"table-4"},"362":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-149","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|           | 动态库插件     | 脚本插件（目录形态）                    |\n| --------- | --------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 启动时序 / 崩溃 | 同步；崩了拖垮宿主 | 装依赖后起进程，等 `ready`；子进程死，宿主记一条错 |","table":"table-4"},"363":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-150","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|       | 动态库插件                                  | 脚本插件（目录形态）           |\n| ----- | -------------------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| 已知天花板 | panic 靠 `C-unwind` + `catch_unwind` 接住 | 改代码不热载（watch 只认目录增删） |","table":"table-4"},"364":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-151","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"脚本侧（薄 SDK 与目录形态）**不属于运行时本体**：它由独立仓库的 `fuyubot.script` 插件提供，\n文档见脚本插件。\n那一个 dll 同时托管 Python（uv）与 JS/TS（bun）两类 `ScriptHost`，共用同一份 stdio 协议实现。"},"365":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-152","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| crate          | 里面有什么                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-core` | `lib.rs` 的 `Kernel`（Created → Started → Stopped）；`context.rs` 的 `Context`（`Arc<RwLock<HashMap<TypeId, Arc<dyn Any + Send + Sync>>>>`）；`effect.rs` 的 `Effect`（`Box<dyn FnOnce()>` 回滚守卫，`#[must_use]`，`merge()` 后注册者先撤销）；`plugin.rs` 的 `Plugin` trait + `define_plugin!`；`manager.rs` 的 `PluginManager`（load / load_all / unload / reload + DFS 三色拓扑排序） |","table":"table-5"},"366":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-153","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| crate           | 里面有什么                                                            |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-event` | `EventBus` / `Filter` / `SubscriptionHandle` / `EventContextExt` |","table":"table-5"},"367":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-154","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| crate             | 里面有什么                                                      |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-service` | `ServiceContainer` / `ServiceHandle` / `ServiceContextExt` |","table":"table-5"},"368":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-155","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| crate          | 里面有什么                                                                          |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `fuyubot-tool` | `ToolDescriptor` / `ToolRegistry` / `ToolHandle` / `ffi` 模块 / `ToolContextExt` |","table":"table-5"},"369":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-156","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| crate                | 里面有什么                                                                                      |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `fuyubot-middleware` | `Stage` / `Middleware` / `Next` / `Pipeline` / `MiddlewareHandle` / `MiddlewareContextExt` |","table":"table-5"},"370":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-157","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"三条共用约定："},"371":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-158","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**回调错误类型由 core 定**：四个 crate 不能互相依赖，所以 `fuyubot_core::Result<T>` 是全仓唯一允许 boxed error 的地方。"},"372":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-159","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**与 Context 的集成 = `install(ctx)` + 扩展 trait**：返回的 `Effect` 要一直持有，否则服务立刻从 Context 消失。"},"373":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-160","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**所有注册都返回句柄且 `#[must_use]`**：四个 Handle 内部都包着 `core::Effect`，drop 即回滚。"},"374":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-161","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"各自的一条要点："},"375":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-162","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| 机制  | 要点                                                                                                                              |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 事件  | `emit` 在锁**外面**调回调，所以回调里再 `on` / `emit` / `off` 不会自锁；某个回调返回 `Err` 会**中断**本次广播并把错误抛出去。`Filter` 用点分路径（`\"message.chat.id\"`）做字段相等匹配 |","table":"table-6"},"376":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-163","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| 机制  | 要点                                                                                                        |\n| --- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 服务  | 命名容器（跨语言插件报不出 Rust 的 `TypeId`）。同名重复注册报错；`get::<T>` 类型不匹配返回 `None`，用 `contains` + `type_of` 区分「没注册」和「类型不对」 |","table":"table-6"},"377":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-164","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| 机制  | 要点                                                                                                                                                                     |\n| --- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 工具  | `call_tool` = 查表 → 权限门 → input_schema → 处理器 → output_schema。`handler: Option<ToolHandlerFn>`，`None` 表示「只有元数据的声明型工具」；注册/注销用 `on_change` 广播（**不认识事件系统**，要不要转成事件总线由宿主层决定） |","table":"table-6"},"378":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-165","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| 机制  | 要点                                                                                                                   |\n| --- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 中间件 | 洋葱模型，`next.run(ctx)` 前是进入段、后是退出段。`run(stage, ctx)` 会**先复制层列表再执行**，所以中间件里再 `use_middleware` 不会自锁；不调 `next.run` 就是不往下走 |","table":"table-6"},"379":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-166","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"内核的几条语义："},"380":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-167","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**`Context` 只有 `&self`**：`provide` 返回 `Effect`，drop 即注销，所以调用方必须持有它。"},"381":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-168","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**`Effect::merge` 是 LIFO**：`a.merge(b)` 的撤销顺序是 `b → a`。"},"382":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-169","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**加载顺序由依赖决定，卸载是加载顺序的倒序**；`load_all` 报错会把本次已加载的卸掉，不留半加载。"},"383":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-170","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**有依赖者时 `unload` 拒绝**（`HasDependents`），不级联。"},"384":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-171","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**`reload` 之所以能工作**，是因为管理器存的是 `Arc<dyn Plugin>` 而不是 `Box`。"},"385":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-172","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"两个 crate 一人一半：`-sys` 只出类型、不做加载，`tdlib` 才是运行时。"},"386":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-173","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"| crate                  | `build.rs` 做什么                                 | `src/` 里有什么                                                                                                                                                                          |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `fuyubot-tdlib-sys`绑定层 | 拿 `td_api.tl` + 生成编译期两份产物（无条件执行，没有 feature 早退） | `build_support.rs`（与另一个 crate 共用的缓存/下载设施）、`ffi.rs`（函数指针 + 符号名 + 指针形状 `const assert`）、`tl_schema.rs`（解析与 JSON 互转）、`tl_codegen.rs` + `docs.rs`、`schema.rs`、`td_api.rs`（`include!` 生成物） |","table":"table-7"},"387":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-174","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"| crate              | `build.rs` 做什么                        | `src/` 里有什么                                                       |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-tdlib`运行时 | 只管 vendored 动态库 + 把库 staging 到可执行文件旁边 | `loader.rs` / `loader/vendored.rs` / `client.rs` / `authorize.rs` |","table":"table-7"},"388":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-175","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"三条边界约定："},"389":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-176","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"**重导出的路径不变**：`fuyubot_tdlib::` 根上重导出 `-sys` 的 `ffi` / `schema` / `td_api` /\n`tl_schema` 与 `TdApiSchema` / `EntryKind` / `TlEntry` / `TlParam` / `SchemaError` / `TdApi` /\n`DEFAULT_LOG_VERBOSITY`，所以既有调用方一行都不用改。"},"390":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-177","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"**两份源码被两边共用**：`build_support.rs` 与 `loader/vendored.rs` 各自的 `build.rs` 都用 `#[path]`\n引同一份，因此它们只能依赖 std 与可选依赖。"},"391":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-178","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"**两份 metadata 必须一致**：`[package.metadata.fuyubot]` 在两个 crate 里各有一份，值要对得上\n（守卫测试 `metadata_is_in_sync_between_the_two_crates`）。"},"392":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-179","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"`loader::resolve` 按这个顺序找动态库："},"393":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-180","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"`TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH`（文件或目录）"},"394":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-181","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"**vendored 目录**"},"395":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-182","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"**可执行文件所在目录**（ExeDir）"},"396":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-183","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"Linux 带版本号的系统库"},"397":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-184","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"裸库名（真去 `dlopen` 试一次）"},"398":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-185","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"全失败返回 `TdlibLoadError::NotFound`，消息里逐条列出 `[1]`…`[4]` 的尝试与原因。"},"399":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-186","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"真正加载**必须**走 `loader::open_library`（Windows 绝对路径会走 `LOAD_WITH_ALTERED_SEARCH_PATH`），\n**不要直接用 `Library::new`**——以后任何新增的加载动态库的地方都走它。"},"400":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-187","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"`@extra` 是**字符串**（`RequestId::to_extra()`）；`route()` 遇到非数字的 `@extra` 会退化成更新，不 panic。"},"401":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-188","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"编译期：一份 schema 生成两份产物"},"402":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-189","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"td_api.tl 经 tl_schema::parse 解析一次，左路生成 Rust 类型源码、include! 进 td_api；右路写成 JSON、include_str! 进 TdApiSchema::compiled。两条路来自同一个解析结果，所以形状不会漂移。"},"403":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-190","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"td_api.tl"},"404":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-191","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"包内 vendor 优先 → 缓存 → 下载"},"405":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-192","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"tl_schema::parse"},"406":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-193","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"tl_codegen::generate"},"407":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-194","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"$OUT_DIR/td_api.json"},"408":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-195","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"$OUT_DIR/td_api_generated.rs"},"409":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-196","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"include_str!"},"410":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-197","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"fuyubot_tdlib_sys::td_api"},"411":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-198","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"serde 带 tag 的 enum / struct"},"412":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-199","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"TdApiSchema::compiled"},"413":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-200","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"运行时查「有没有这个方法 / 字段」"},"414":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-201","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"两份产物来自同一个解析结果，而且 `tl_schema.rs` 被 build.rs 用 `#[path]` 引同一份实现，所以「编译期\n写出来的形状」与「运行时读回去的形状」不可能漂移。生成规则：类 → 带 `#[serde(tag = \"@type\")]` 的 enum；\n函数 → 带 `METHOD` / `RESULT` 常量的 struct（派生 `Default`，没填的字段不写进请求）；类字段一律\n`Option<Box<T>>`（断互递归 + 对上「缺字段就是没有」）；认不出的类型降级成 `serde_json::Value`；Rust\n关键字转义（`r#type`）；**文档四级齐全**（类 / 变体 / 函数 / 字段）。归类只认\n`---functions---` / `---types---` 分区标记，认不出来时**构建直接失败**。\n`check_request` 那套元数据仍然保留——它做的是生成类型做不到的本地校验（生成类型只能保证**结构**对，\n挡不住「用错方法名」）。"},"415":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-202","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                                      | 位置            | 作用                                                                             |\n| -------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `HostApiVTable` / `PluginHandle` / `HostApi` | `fuyubot-abi` | 函数表（3 个非函数字段 + 27 个函数指针） / `plugin_init` 的返回值（`abi_version == 0` = 失败） / 插件侧门面 |","table":"table-8"},"416":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-203","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                                                            | 位置               | 作用                                                                              |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `HostRuntime` / `UpdatePipeline` / `PluginLoader` / `LoadedPlugin` | `fuyubot-loader` | 27 个桥的落点、请求留档、响应回投、`rollback_owner`、全局配置读写；六阶段（实跑 4 个）+ 双通道路由；dlopen 与 drop 即卸载 |","table":"table-8"},"417":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-204","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                               | 位置              | 作用                                                                                  |\n| ------------------------------------- | --------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `TdClient` / `Routed` / `ReceiveLoop` | `fuyubot-tdlib` | TDLib 客户端；`route()` 分出 `Update` / `Response`；停止把手（`stop()` / `join()`，drop **不会**停） |","table":"table-8"},"418":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-205","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                    | 位置                 | 作用                                                                                                    |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Simplify` / `RichMessage` | `fuyubot-simplify` | 发消息 / 相册 / 编辑 / 删除 / Markdown 转 entities / 等响应 / **富消息**（`rich` 模块，本地 Markdown → 块树）；参数是**每个方法一个结构体** |","table":"table-8"},"419":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-206","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                   | 位置                  | 作用                                     |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `TdApiSchema::compiled()` | `fuyubot-tdlib-sys` | 编译期烘焙的元数据；`check_request` 做本地方法名/参数名校验 |","table":"table-8"},"420":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"page","content":"构建与测试","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test"},"421":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test","content":"三条硬门槛、两类测试，以及本机的离线约定"},"422":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#三条硬门槛","content":"三条硬门槛"},"423":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"构建输入与缓存"},"424":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#两类测试","content":"两类测试"},"425":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"测试写法的三条规矩"},"426":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#本机的离线约定","content":"本机的离线约定"},"427":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#三条硬门槛","content":"⚠️ 三条都带 `--workspace`：根 `Cargo.toml` 有 `default-members = [\"crates/*\"]`，\n**裸** `cargo build` / `cargo test` 只编 `crates/`，不编 `examples/`。\n`#[allow]` 不算消 warning——能改就改。"},"428":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#三条硬门槛","content":"`cargo tree --workspace --offline` 必须无环；依赖方向随时能用\n`cargo tree -p <crate> -e normal --depth 1` 验。"},"429":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"`td_api.tl` 是**构建的必需输入**，`fuyubot-tdlib-sys/build.rs` 无条件去拿它："},"430":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"包内那份随 crate 发布（1.8.70 已带），所以**从 crates.io 装下来的下游和 docs.rs 都不用联网**。\n它按 `[package.metadata.fuyubot] tdlib-version` 拼路径，换了版本却没补 `vendor/` 时会自动退到缓存/下载。"},"431":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"缓存根按顺序找（`build_support::cache_roots()`，两个 build.rs 共用同一串）："},"432":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已把第三档指好（`relative = true`，相对仓库根），克隆下来直接能用。"},"433":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"**手写必须绝对路径**：两个 build.rs 的 CWD 是各自的 crate 根，相对路径会解析到 crate 下面然后 404。"},"434":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"`$OUT_DIR` 每次重跑构建脚本都会被清空 → 退到它意味着下次**重新下载**，缓存根全写不进去时会明确警告。"},"435":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"转换在编译期完成：日志里只有一条 `已转换 …\\td_api.tl：共 N 条`。条数取决于那份文件，**别当常量写进断言**。"},"436":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"`.cargo/config.toml` 另有两个别名：`cargo bot`（= `fuyubot run`）、`cargo package-bot`\n（release 构建 `fuyubot` + 三个内置插件，产物在 `target/release/`，tdjson 由 build.rs 放到 exe 同级；\n`init` / `run` 会把内置插件装成项目的 `plugins/<id>/` 插件包，旧版本的平铺 dll 会就地迁移）。"},"437":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#两类测试","content":"**默认自检不碰任何外部文件**：真 tdjson、真 `td_api.tl`（用 `TDLIB_TD_API_TL` 顶替时）、真 Releases 下载\n全部藏在 `#[ignore]` 后面。所以「全绿」只证明代码自洽——**与真实 TDLib 对不对得上只有那些\n`--ignored` 能回答**："},"438":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#两类测试","content":"改 `ffi.rs` 的符号名/arity、`loader::open_library`（或任何加载动态库的地方）、\n`tl_schema` / `tl_codegen`，或碰登录/授权代码之后，**必须**跑一次。\n`--features vendored` 那条（会尝试访问 Releases，失败只警告）在动 build 脚本 / 资产表时也要跑。"},"439":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"**临时目录不许用 `%TEMP%`**：一律 `target/test-tmp/<crate>/<名字>`。MSYS 会把 `TEMP` 改成 `/tmp`，\n受限环境里真实 `%TEMP%` 也可能写不了——换个 shell 就红的测试几乎总是这个原因。"},"440":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"**嵌套调用 cargo / 编译器时**，把子进程的 `TEMP`/`TMP` 也指到那里：MSVC 的 `link.exe`\n建不了 `%TEMP%` 里的 `lnk*.tmp`，直接 `LNK1104`，插件/夹具根本编不出来。"},"441":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"非平凡逻辑留**一个**可运行自检：`#[cfg(test)]` 里一个 `assert` 测试即可，不引测试框架。"},"442":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-21","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#本机的离线约定","content":"DSH 沙箱里 cargo 的 TLS 连不上 crates.io（`schannel … SEC_E_NO_CREDENTIALS`）。\n`Cargo.lock` 已落盘，`--offline` 就够；**只有改依赖版本时**才需要联网，那时向用户申请一次完整权限跑\n`cargo fetch`。"},"443":{"id":"/docs/dev","page_id":"/docs/dev","type":"page","content":"开发文档","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev"},"444":{"id":"/docs/dev-0","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"改框架本身：结构、构建测试、踩过的坑、发布"},"445":{"id":"/docs/dev-1","page_id":"/docs/dev","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"本节的页面"},"446":{"id":"/docs/dev-2","page_id":"/docs/dev","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev#一分钟上手","content":"一分钟上手"},"447":{"id":"/docs/dev-3","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"这一节是给**改 fuyubot 仓库**的人看的，不是给用它写 bot 的人看的。"},"448":{"id":"/docs/dev-4","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"**公开文档都在这个文档站**：结构、ABI、插件写法、使用方式。"},"449":{"id":"/docs/dev-5","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"| 看什么    | 在哪     |\n| ------ | ------ |\n| 结构与数据流 | 架构与数据流 |","table":"table-0"},"450":{"id":"/docs/dev-6","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"| 看什么                    | 在哪     |\n| ---------------------- | ------ |\n| 插件配置的三层与写盘规则（改配置系统前必读） | 插件配置规范 |","table":"table-0"},"451":{"id":"/docs/dev-7","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"| 看什么                           | 在哪              |\n| ----------------------------- | --------------- |\n| Android 上怎么交付（JNI 运行时，不含 APK） | Android：JNI 运行时 |","table":"table-0"},"452":{"id":"/docs/dev-8","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"| 看什么      | 在哪   |\n| -------- | ---- |\n| 构建、测试、发布 | 下面三页 |","table":"table-0"},"453":{"id":"/docs/dev-9","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"| 看什么                       | 在哪                                    |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 当前状态 / 构建契约 / 已知缺口 / 踩过的坑 | 仓库里随源码分发的工程台账（`docs/`，不入库，只给改代码的人接力用） |","table":"table-0"},"454":{"id":"/docs/dev-10","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"仓库有一条硬规矩：**文档里出现的命令必须真跑过**，带输出的示例要抄真实输出。\n改行为就同步改文档：文档站给使用者与插件作者，仓库里的工程台账给下一个改代码的人。\n否则下一个人会比你更相信旧文档。"},"455":{"id":"/docs/dev-11","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"架构与数据流\" href=\"/docs/dev/architecture/\" />"},"456":{"id":"/docs/dev-12","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"插件配置规范\" href=\"/docs/dev/plugin-config/\" />"},"457":{"id":"/docs/dev-13","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"Android：JNI 运行时\" href=\"/docs/dev/android/\" />"},"458":{"id":"/docs/dev-14","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"构建与测试\" href=\"/docs/dev/build-test/\" />"},"459":{"id":"/docs/dev-15","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"常见陷阱\" href=\"/docs/dev/pitfalls/\" />"},"460":{"id":"/docs/dev-16","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"发布\" href=\"/docs/dev/release/\" />"},"461":{"id":"/docs/dev-17","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#一分钟上手","content":"`td_api.tl` 是**构建的必需输入**：`TDLIB_TD_API_TL` → 缓存 → 从 Releases 下载，拿不到就让构建失败。\n仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已经把缓存指到 `.tdlib-cache/`（相对仓库根），所以上面三条直接敲就行。"},"462":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"page","content":"常见陷阱","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls"},"463":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","content":"编号即引用锚：这些坑真踩过，别再踩回去"},"464":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"ABI 与回调"},"465":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#事件语义","content":"事件语义"},"466":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"TDLib"},"467":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"Rust / Windows"},"468":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","content":"每条都**真踩过**。这里挑最容易复发的几类；仓库内部的台账编号是跨文件引用锚，只随源码分发，不在这里展开。"},"469":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**`extern \"C\"` 边界逃出去的 panic 直接 abort**，宿主来不及 `catch_unwind`：插件与中间件回调必须是\n`unsafe extern \"C-unwind\"`，`define_plugin!` 自己也要包一层。"},"470":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**一个 crate 只能展开一次 `define_plugin!`**：七个导出符号名是 ABI 定死的，展开两次必然重复定义。"},"471":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**订阅不会自动退订**：`HostApi::on` 返回的 `SubscriptionHandle` 只是个 `u64`，`drop` 什么也不会发生。\n循环里注册、事后想撤，必须自己把句柄收进 `Vec` 并调 `off`；插件卸载时宿主会整批回滚。"},"472":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**`Effect` 是 `#[must_use]`**：`let _ =` 会立刻回滚；`drop` 就是注销。\n（`fuyubot-simplify` 的 `CommandSubscription` 是另一回事——它是封装层的 RAII 守卫。）"},"473":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#事件语义","content":"**归属（scope）不是「排除广播」**：第一版写成「全局 `emit` 只发 scope 0」，插件永远收不到更新。\n正确语义是「`emit` 发给所有人；`emit_scoped(scope)` 额外定向给该归属」。"},"474":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#事件语义","content":"**过滤器里的 `event_type` 键只选通道**，不参与负载匹配。"},"475":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"**方法名/字段路径按 TDLib 来，不按 Bot API**：只有 `sendMessage` + `input_message_content`；\n`updateFile` 的 file id 在 `file.id` 不是顶层 `file_id`；`user` 没有 `is_bot` / `username`。"},"476":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"**`td_api.tl` 的「函数 vs 构造器」只认 `---functions---` / `---types---` 标记**：\n`updateNewMessage … = Update` 是构造器，任何按首字母大写的启发式都会误判。"},"477":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"**写死 TDLib 方法名/参数名的模块必须留一条 `check_request` 测试**（离线就能红）。"},"478":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**`Context` 的固有方法会遮蔽扩展 trait 的同名方法**：命名服务只能叫 `provide_named` / `resolve`。"},"479":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**thiserror 把名为 `source` 的字段当错误链**：存额外文本的字段叫 `detail`。"},"480":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**Windows 文件锁是强制锁**：锁住的字节范围别人 `read` 会 `ERROR_LOCK_VIOLATION`，\n所以实例状态把「锁」与「内容」分成两个文件（`.fuyubot/lock` 与 `.fuyubot/status`）。"},"481":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**PowerShell 的 `Get-Content` 在本机按 cp936 解码 UTF-8**：中文注释会毁，还会吞换行导致行号错位。\n改源码一律用编辑器工具，shell 只用来跑命令。"},"482":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**`tar` 在 Windows runner 上要 POSIX 路径**（`/d/a/…`）：GNU tar 会把 `D:/…` 当成「连主机 D」。"},"483":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"> 新踩的坑要补进仓库的 `docs/pitfalls.md` 台账（随源码分发）并给新编号——编号是跨文件引用锚。"},"484":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","type":"page","content":"插件配置规范","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config"},"485":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","content":"三层优先级、段级落盘、原子替换——改配置系统之前先读这一页"},"486":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#三层后者只填前者的缺失键","content":"三层，后者只填前者的缺失键"},"487":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#写只写自己那一个文件","content":"写：只写自己那一个文件"},"488":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#拒绝而不是静默失败","content":"拒绝，而不是静默失败"},"489":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#默认配置文件pluginjson-的-config","content":"默认配置文件（`plugin.json` 的 `config`）"},"490":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#读默认也是自己","content":"读：默认也是自己"},"491":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#写别人的段set_config_section","content":"写别人的段（`set_config_section`）"},"492":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#不要做的事","content":"不要做的事"},"493":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#改动清单","content":"改动清单"},"494":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","content":"插件配置只有一套模型，改 `fuyubot-loader` / `fuyubot-app` / `fuyubot-android` 里任何一处都要守住它。\n面向插件作者的用法在配置文件 · 插件自己的配置段，\n这一页写给**改框架的人**。"},"495":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#三层后者只填前者的缺失键","content":"合并点只有两处，不要在别处再造第三套："},"496":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#三层后者只填前者的缺失键","content":"| 层   | 在哪合并                                                      | 时机                                               |\n| --- | --------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| 包默认 | `DylibPlugin::new` → `HostRuntime::apply_plugin_defaults` | 插件进内核**之前**（`inject` / `soft_inject` 兜底也要能看到默认值） |","table":"table-0"},"497":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#三层后者只填前者的缺失键","content":"| 层     | 在哪合并                                               | 时机               |\n| ----- | -------------------------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| 运行时落盘 | `HostRuntime::install_config` → `merge_store_into` | 装配置时（必须在用户层快照之后） |","table":"table-0"},"498":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#三层后者只填前者的缺失键","content":"`merge_missing` 的语义是「**src 只补 dst 缺席的键**」：已有值一律不动，对象逐层递归。\n所以 `install_config` 必须在插件加载前调，`apply_plugin_defaults` 必须在落盘合并之后跑——\n顺序错了，优先级就反了。"},"499":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#写只写自己那一个文件","content":"`set_config(key, value_json)` 的落盘路径是 `<项目根>/plugin-config/<插件名>.toml`："},"500":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#写只写自己那一个文件","content":"**段级**：文件内容就是那一段配置本身（不带 `[plugin.<名>]` 头）。"},"501":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#写只写自己那一个文件","content":"**只落 delta**：`key` 空 = 整段替换；否则只改那个键。**不要**把合成后的整段写回去——\n否则包默认与用户配置会被「冻结」进插件自己的记忆，插件升级带来的新默认值再也进不来。"},"502":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#写只写自己那一个文件","content":"**原子**：先写同目录的 `<名>.toml.tmp`，再 `rename`。掉电 / 写一半不会留下半截文件。"},"503":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#写只写自己那一个文件","content":"**文件名是插件名的百分号编码**：只保留 `[A-Za-z0-9._-]`，其余字节 `%XX`，Windows 保留名\n（`CON` / `NUL` / `COM1` …）把首字节编码掉。插件名来自不受控的 `plugin_init`，直接拼路径\n就是目录穿越。改编码规则必须同步 `decode_plugin_file_name`（读写两侧不对称 = 配置丢失）。"},"504":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#写只写自己那一个文件","content":"**不写 `fuyubot.toml`**。用户配置只读：注释、段顺序、`api_hash` 都靠这条保住。\n以前那套「全量重写 + 从磁盘补回 api_hash」（`persist_toml` / `saved_api_hash`）已经删了，\n别再引回来。"},"505":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#拒绝而不是静默失败","content":"两种写不进去的情况都必须**返回错误**（`set_config` 非 0），并且**还原内存**："},"506":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-21","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#拒绝而不是静默失败","content":"这次启动没有配置文件（`config_path = None`）——没有落盘位置，写了也会丢。"},"507":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-22","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#拒绝而不是静默失败","content":"这个键被用户配置钉住（`fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<名>]` 里有它）——写了下次启动照样会被\n用户配置盖回去，那正是「返回成功、值却没留住」这类最难查的 bug。"},"508":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-23","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#拒绝而不是静默失败","content":"错误文案要告诉调用方**改哪里**（哪个文件、哪个键），不要只说「写配置失败」。"},"509":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-24","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#默认配置文件pluginjson-的-config","content":"必须是**包内相对路径**，语法校验与 `entry` 同一套（绝对路径、`..`、盘符、开头分隔符一律拒绝），\n落点还要 `canonicalize` 后仍在包内。"},"510":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-25","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#默认配置文件pluginjson-的-config","content":"顶层就是一段配置（TOML 文档顶层必然是表）。"},"511":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-26","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#默认配置文件pluginjson-的-config","content":"读失败（不存在 / 不是 TOML / 转不成 JSON）**只告警、不拦加载**：默认配置坏了不该让整个插件装不上。"},"512":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-27","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#默认配置文件pluginjson-的-config","content":"`config` 是可选字段；没写就是没有默认值。"},"513":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-28","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#读默认也是自己","content":"`get_config(section, key)` 的 `section` 按**配置文件里的段名**寻址，与 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[段]`\n一一对应：`plugin.fuyubot.music`、`[plugin.fuyubot.music]`、裸插件名 `fuyubot.music`、\n顶层 `[bot]` / `[telegram]` 都认。**空串 = 自己那段**，与 `set_config` 的默认同一套判定\n（`HostRuntime::executor_name`，执行者栈顶）。"},"514":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-29","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#读默认也是自己","content":"解析在 `parse_section`：剥掉方括号与空白 → `plugin.*` 是插件段、五个已知顶层名（`bot` /\n`telegram` / `tdlib` / `plugins` / `plugin`）是顶层段、其余裸名字按插件段（兼容旧调用）。"},"515":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-30","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#读默认也是自己","content":"**写只允许 `plugin.*`**：顶层段归用户，`set_config_section(\"bot\", …)` 会被拒绝——\n读得到不等于写得进。"},"516":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-31","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#写别人的段set_config_section","content":"0.1.4 起多了一个入口：`set_config_section(section, key, value_json)`——写**指定插件**的段，\n给协作插件同步设置用（比如播放器把「当前音源」写进宿主自己的段、让别的插件读）。"},"517":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-32","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#写别人的段set_config_section","content":"它是**新函数**，`set_config` 仍然没有 `section` 参数：默认那条永远写自己，\n越权由 `owner_names` 判定，插件伪造不了。"},"518":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-33","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#写别人的段set_config_section","content":"跨插件写是**显式**的：调用方必须自己写出目标插件名，所以谈不上冒充；\n宿主会记一行 `X 改写插件 Y 的配置`，出问题查得到是谁。"},"519":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-34","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#写别人的段set_config_section","content":"两条路共用同一套规则：用户钉住的键照样拒绝、只落\n`plugin-config/<目标插件>.toml`、`fuyubot.toml` 永不重写。"},"520":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-35","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#不要做的事","content":"**不要给 `set_config` 加 `section` 参数**。默认那条的安全模型是「没有 section + `owner_names`\n判定执行者」，给它加参数就等于把越权写别人的段重新打开；要跨插件写请用\n`set_config_section`（显式目标 + 审计日志）。"},"521":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-36","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#不要做的事","content":"**不要让插件直接写 `fuyubot.toml`**，也不要让 CLI 面板的配置编辑器去写插件运行时文件：\n两边各写各的，优先级就说不清了。"},"522":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-37","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#改动清单","content":"动配置系统时，这四类测试缺一不可（`crates/fuyubot-loader/src/runtime.rs` 与 `bundle.rs` 里都有现成的）："},"523":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-38","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#改动清单","content":"三层优先级（用户 > 落盘 > 默认），包括「重复合并不覆盖已有值」。"},"524":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-39","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#改动清单","content":"写盘只动自己那段、`fuyubot.toml` 字节不变、临时文件已 rename。"},"525":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-40","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#改动清单","content":"两种拒绝（无 `config_path`、用户钉住的键）都要还原内存。"},"526":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-41","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#改动清单","content":"文件名编码往返（含 `../`、`/`、非 ASCII、Windows 保留名）。"},"527":{"id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config-42","page_id":"/docs/dev/plugin-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/plugin-config#改动清单","content":"另外同步：`AGENTS.md` 的约束 41 / 52、\n配置文件、插件 ABI 的 `set_config` 行、各语言插件页的写入说明。"},"528":{"id":"/docs/dev/release","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"page","content":"发布","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release"},"529":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"两套发布资产（TDLib 库 / fuyubot 本体）与文档站的静态部署"},"530":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"TDLib 资产（构建期契约）"},"531":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"fuyubot 本体（用户下载即用）"},"532":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release#androidjni-包actions-artifact不进-release","content":"Android：JNI 包（Actions artifact，不进 Release）"},"533":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release#androidapk可安装的图形客户端","content":"Android：APK（可安装的图形客户端）"},"534":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"文档站"},"535":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"仓库有三类**互不替代**的发布资产，tag 前缀不同，别混："},"536":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"| 资产                            | tag           | 生产方                                        | 谁消费                             |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| TDLib 动态库 `TDLib-<os>-<arch>` | `TDLib-v<版本>` | `build-tdlib.yml` + `.github/scripts/*.sh` | 构建期（`fuyubot-tdlib` 的 loader 表） |","table":"table-0"},"537":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"| 资产                                      | tag     | 生产方               | 谁消费         |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------- | ----------------- | ----------- |\n| fuyubot 本体 `fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip` | `v<版本>` | `release-bot.yml` | 终端用户下载、解压即跑 |","table":"table-0"},"538":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"| 资产                                   | tag     | 生产方                                 | 谁消费      |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------- | ----------------------------------- | -------- |\n| Android APK `fuyubot-<版本>-<abi>.apk` | `v<版本>` | `release-bot.yml` 的 `build-apk` job | 终端用户直接安装 |","table":"table-0"},"539":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"消费方是 `crates/fuyubot-tdlib/src/loader/vendored.rs` 的 `ASSETS` 表，生产方是\n`.github/workflows/build-tdlib.yml` 的 matrix；`tests/release_assets.rs` 会**读 workflow 双向比对**，\n漂了就红。四条硬要求："},"540":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"tag 必须精确是 **`TDLib-v<版本>`**（下载 URL 由 `release_url()` 拼）；"},"541":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"资产名**精确等于** `ASSETS` 表的值，**不带扩展名**，`<os>-<arch>` 用 cargo 口径（`x86_64` / `aarch64`）；"},"542":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"内容必须是 **`.tar.gz`**（`.zip` 会被 `extract_library` 当裸库原样写出，得到坏文件还不报错）；"},"543":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"**加平台只动 `ASSETS` 表 + CI matrix，两边同时加**（`macos/x86_64` 故意不在表里：没有那个 runner）。"},"544":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"运行时仓库的 `release-bot.yml` 在 `v*` tag（或手动 dispatch）上按平台编 `fuyubot-cli` 与三个内置插件，\n**构建阶段就把最终布局组好**（内置插件按分发格式 v1 铺成 `plugins/<id>/` 目录包，不单独打包），\n每平台出一份中间 `.tar.gz`（已是最终布局）；`publish`（Linux runner）把它转成用户下载的 zip 再挂 Release："},"545":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"**资产名**：`fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip`，例 `fuyubot-v0.1.0-windows-x86_64.zip`。\n`<版本>` 取自 tag（分支上手动构建退回 `dev-<sha7>`）；`<OS>` = windows / linux / macos，\n`<平台>` = x86_64 / aarch64。名字里带版本，同一页 Release 里多个构建可以并存、一眼可辨。"},"546":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"**zip 解压出来就是本体**——不再套一层目录："},"547":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"脚本插件的 `fuyubot-script-<os>-<arch>.zip` 由 **FuyuBot-Script 仓库**单独发布，\n不混进运行时的包。"},"548":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"平台集合与 `ASSETS` 表一致：Windows / Linux 各 x86_64 + aarch64，**macOS 只有 aarch64**。"},"549":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"中间产物（每平台一份 `fuyubot-*.tar.gz`）只留在 Actions artifacts 里，**不挂 Release**——\n它是构建产物，不是发布形态。"},"550":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-21","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"三条契约：**资产名 `fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip`**、**zip 解压即本体**（无套层目录）、\n**`tdjson` 与可执行文件同级**（靠 loader 优先级 2「可执行文件所在目录」命中）。\nzip 只在 `publish`（Linux runner）里生成，Windows runner 的 bash 没有 `zip` 命令。"},"551":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-22","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#androidjni-包actions-artifact不进-release","content":"`build-android` job 里还会出一份**只有 `.so`** 的包（不是可执行文件、也不是 APK）："},"552":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-23","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#androidjni-包actions-artifact不进-release","content":"> ⚠️ 从 2026-11 起这个 zip **不再作为 Release 资产发布**：它只留在 Actions artifacts 里，\n> 由同一个 workflow 的 `build-apk` job 取用。Release 页只挂 `.apk`，用户不需要自己拼内核。"},"553":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-24","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#androidjni-包actions-artifact不进-release","content":"`abi` 用的是 **AGP 口径**（`arm64-v8a`），因为这两个 `.so` 要直接进 APK 的\n`assets/fuyubot-kernel/`；可执行文件那份包仍用 cargo 口径（`aarch64` / `x86_64`）。\n组包与校验在 `.github/scripts/package-fuyubot-jni.sh`：ELF 类型必须是共享库（`ET_DYN`）、\nABI 机器码对得上、`PT_LOAD` 按 16 KB 页对齐、7 个导出符号齐全、`RegisterNatives` 的绑定类名在\n（方法名/签名由单测钉住）、`DT_NEEDED` 只允许 bionic 的那几个。\n用法见 Android：JNI 运行时。"},"554":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-25","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#androidapk可安装的图形客户端","content":"同一页 Release 里还有 `.apk`：`fuyubot-<版本>-<abi>.apk`（`<abi>` = `arm64-v8a` / `x86_64`，\n例 `fuyubot-v0.1.3-arm64-v8a.apk`）。\n它是把上面那个 JNI 包（本次运行的 Actions artifact）塞进壳仓库\nFuyuBot-for-Android（Kotlin + Compose）再编一次\n得到的，内核与本仓**同版本**——`build-apk` job 取的就是本次运行产出的\n`fuyubot-<版本>-android-jni-<abi>.zip`，不是上游壳仓库自带的旧内核。"},"555":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-26","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#androidapk可安装的图形客户端","content":"壳不在本仓，按 `main` checkout；内核放的上游**指定目录**是\n`app/src/main/assets/fuyubot-kernel/`（不是 `jniLibs/`），由 `.github/scripts/build-android-apk.sh`\n铺进去。这个目录被上游 `.gitignore` 排除，缺了它 gradle 照样编得出 APK，只是装到设备上首次启动\n报「资产中缺少内核目录」——所以 CI 的判据是**APK 里真有 `assets/fuyubot-kernel/lib*.so`**，\n不是「`assembleRelease` 绿了」。"},"556":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-27","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#androidapk可安装的图形客户端","content":"脚本还会按本仓的 tag 与 ABI 改写上游三处常量，不改就会静默出错："},"557":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-28","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#androidapk可安装的图形客户端","content":"| 上游位置                                                      | 为什么要改                                                        |\n| --------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `data/update/UpdateChannel.kt` 的 `CURRENT_KERNEL_VERSION` | `KernelManager` 拿它和已装内核比版本，**相等就跳过重装**。不改 = 用户装上新 APK 仍在跑旧内核 |","table":"table-1"},"558":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-29","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#androidapk可安装的图形客户端","content":"| 上游位置                                                   | 为什么要改                                          |\n| ------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `app/build.gradle.kts` 的 `versionCode` / `versionName` | 不改的话每个 Release 都是 `1.0` / `1`，应用内的更新检查永远看不出新版本 |","table":"table-1"},"559":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-30","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#androidapk可安装的图形客户端","content":"| 上游位置                                                   | 为什么要改                                                                                    |\n| ------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `data/plugin/PluginPlatform.kt` 的 `CURRENT_PLUGIN_ABI` | 壳按它挑插件版本；内核换了 ABI 这行没跟上，会装到内核加载不了的插件（或错过能装的旧版本）。发布流程从本仓 `fuyubot_abi::ABI_VERSION` 读出并写入 |","table":"table-1"},"560":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-31","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#androidapk可安装的图形客户端","content":"签名走 `apksigner`（`zipalign -P 16` 先对齐再签，minSdk 33 只要 v2 + v3），\nkeystore 从 Actions Secrets 还原：`ANDROID_KEYSTORE_BASE64` / `ANDROID_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD` /\n`ANDROID_KEY_ALIAS` / `ANDROID_KEY_PASSWORD`，四个缺一个这条 job 就失败（宁可不发，也不发装不上的包）。\n**同一个 keystore 不能换**——换了老用户装新 APK 会报签名冲突，只能先卸载。\nkeystore 容器类型按文件魔数判定（PKCS12 是 `30xx` DER、JKS 是 `feedfeed`），与扩展名无关。"},"561":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-32","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#androidapk可安装的图形客户端","content":"GitHub Actions 在本机验不了。改 workflow 的组包步骤时，把 `Package the runtime` 与\n`Turn each bundle into a flat zip` 两段 bash **原样抠出来在本机跑一次**，\n解压产物验证 `--version` / `init` / `run --replay` / `--no-login --background` 全通——\n这一步是踩过「改了却没验」之后定的规矩。"},"562":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-33","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"本站是静态导出（`output: 'export'`），产物 `out/`："},"563":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-34","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"**push `main` 自动构建并发布到 `gh-pages`**（`pages.yml`；Pages 的 source 是 `gh-pages` 分支）。\nGitHub Pages 是项目页（挂在 `/FuyuBot-docs/` 下）：构建前设 `NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH=/FuyuBot-docs`，\n正式域名在**构建前**设 `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`（绝对 URL 是烘进产物的）；\n`public/.nojekyll` 不能少（`_next/` 以 `_` 开头会被 Jekyll 吞掉）。"},"564":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-35","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"发布前过一遍提交检查清单：文档站与运行时仓库里的工程台账都更新、`cargo build/test/fmt` 三条绿、\n没把凭据写进任何文件。"},"565":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"page","content":"simplify 封装是怎么实现的","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals"},"566":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","content":"按功能范围拆开 fuyubot-simplify 的实现：等待语义、同步 td_execute、错误映射、异步线程与测试守卫"},"567":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"三条不可协商的原则"},"568":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"1. 请求出口：一切经 ABI"},"569":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"2. 文本链路：为什么不异步"},"570":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"3. 发送：两步合成一次等待"},"571":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"4. 编辑 / 删除 / 应答：只有一步"},"572":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#5-富消息为什么单列一条路","content":"5. 富消息：为什么单列一条路"},"573":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"6. 等待层：三个底层出口"},"574":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么状态要放堆上","content":"7. 命令订阅：为什么状态要放堆上"},"575":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#8-异步版一次调用一个线程","content":"8. 异步版：一次调用一个线程"},"576":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"9. 错误映射"},"577":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"10. 真 schema 守卫（离线测试）"},"578":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#11-后加的四个子系统各自为什么这么实现","content":"11. 后加的四个子系统：各自为什么这么实现"},"579":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"管理权：为什么返回 `bool`"},"580":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#转发为什么不等发送结局","content":"转发：为什么不等发送结局"},"581":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"表情反应：bot 与用户号是两套方法"},"582":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#连接状态只能订阅","content":"连接状态：只能订阅"},"583":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"话题：`MessageTopic` 有四个构造器"},"584":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"12. 加一个新方法 / 新字段的清单"},"585":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","content":"这一篇是给**改这一层的人**看的：为什么这么做，以及加东西时该动哪儿。\n用这一层的人请先看插件 › Simplify 封装。"},"586":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"**只简化输入，不改变输出。** 返回值永远是 TDLib 的原始 JSON（`Value` / `Vec<Value>`），\n不带自己的包装类型。插件要能随时退回手写请求。"},"587":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-21","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"**一个方法一个参数结构体 + 短字段名。** `text` / `media` / `topic_id` 这些名字只服务于「人好写」，\n到 TDLib 字段名的映射**只有一处实现**（`send_params` / `edit_*_params` / `put_common`）。\n短名字不代表裸标量：`topic_id` 是 `Topic`，\n`media` 是 `Media`——凡是有「选哪个构造器」问题的一律用枚举，不用 `i64` 让人猜。"},"588":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-22","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"**公开方法都等到结果**（唯一例外是同步的 `formatted`）。请求号不外泄——泄漏就意味着调用方要自己管\n`old_message_id` / `request_id` 那一套，而这正是这一层要替人扛的东西。"},"589":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-23","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"改这一层之前先读一遍这三条：违反任何一条的改动，都应该先回来改这一节说清楚为什么要破例。"},"590":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-24","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"`Simplify` 只持有一个 `HostApi`（它是 `Copy`）。**没有一处**直接碰 `tdjson` 的符号："},"591":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-25","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"异步方法走 `host.td_invoke_simplified(\"方法名\", payload)`——`@type` 由宿主补，\n返回 `RequestId`；响应从 `\"response\"` 通道回来（只发给发起请求的那个插件）。"},"592":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-26","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"唯一走别的是 `formatted`：同步的 `host.td_execute`（下一节解释）。"},"593":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-27","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"参数 JSON 不是字符串拼接，而是 `serde_json::Map` 一层层 `insert` 出来的——每个字段「发 / 不发」\n在代码里一眼能看出来（`Option` 为 `None` 就是整个字段缺省，不是发 `null`）。"},"594":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-28","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"`Text { text, parse_mode }` → `formattedText { text, entities }` 只有一条路：TDLib 的 `parseTextEntities`。\n**这里刻意不做第二套解析器**——一旦自己解析，「我们认的语法」和「Telegram 认的语法」就开始漂移\n（实测就已经够意外了：MarkdownV2 的粗体是 `*x*`，`**x**` 会被吞成 `x` 且不给 bold entity）。"},"595":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-29","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"代价是一次往返，而这次往返**必须是同步的**："},"596":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-30","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"插件通常正是在**更新回调里**发消息，而「更新」和「响应」都靠接收循环那个线程投递。\n在那儿 `td_invoke` + 等响应 = 自己卡自己的投递线程，等到的一定是超时。\n`parseTextEntities` 不碰服务器，TDLib 允许同步跑它（`td_json_client_execute`）——所以这条链路\n即使在**更新回调里**也是安全的，换成异步等待反而会把自己卡死。"},"597":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-31","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"实现上的三点："},"598":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-32","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"`ParseMode::to_td()` 把四个模式换成三个 `TextParseMode`（`Plain` 返回 `None`，直接跳过请求）；"},"599":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-33","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"拿不到结果（没接 TDLib / 报错 / 回了个别的）→ `formatted_from` 退回纯文本，并打一条 `Warn`；\n一条 Markdown 写错的消息不该让整条消息发不出去；"},"600":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-34","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"`formatted` 作为**渲染闭包**传进 `send_params(.., render)` / `edit_*_params(.., render)`，\n所以每个发送 / 编辑方法都自动得到「文本的最终形态」，不需要各自处理解析。"},"601":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-35","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"TDLib 是异步的，`sendMessage` 的真相是这样的："},"602":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-36","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"封装把 ②③ 合成一次（见 `await_response` / `await_outcome`）："},"603":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-37","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"`await_response`：等 `\"response\"` 通道，`request_id` 精确匹配；`@type == \"error\"` → `SimplifyError::Tdlib`；"},"604":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-38","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"`await_outcome`：走**兜底的 `\"update\"` 通道** + `\"old_message_id\"` 匹配。成功与失败两条更新都在这条通道上，\n所以一次等待就能拿到「到底成了没」；按临时消息的 id 精确对号，同一会话里别人的结局不会串进来。"},"605":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-39","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"**超时先补救**：`cancel_sending` 用 `deleteMessages(revoke = true)` 把那条还没发出去的消息撤掉，\n再返回 `Timeout(u64)`。发出去的撤不回，没发出去的会被取消。这一步**只打日志**，不把删除的成败返回结果。"},"606":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-40","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"相册是同一套的 N 倍：`sendMessageAlbum` 的响应是 `Messages`（一组），`pending_messages` 取出每一项的临时 id，\n然后**逐项** `await_outcome`。`timeout_ms` 是**整组共用一个预算**——方法是把 deadline 算出来，\n每次只剩 `remaining_ms(deadline)`，不是每项各重新计时。"},"607":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-41","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"`AlbumSize` 是**发之前**挡下来的（`invoke_send_album` 里先验 2–10 项），因为一个错项数的相册\n发出去也只会让服务端拒绝，不如在本地给个清脆的错误。"},"608":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-42","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"这类方法**没有结局更新**——结果就是响应本身："},"609":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-43","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"成功 ⇒ `Message`（编辑）或 `ok`（删除 / 应答）；"},"610":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-44","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"`@type == \"error\"` ⇒ `SimplifyError::Tdlib`（`Message is not modified`、消息太老删不动都在这一档）。"},"611":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-45","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"**这里刻意不重试**：该等多久是限流策略的事，调用方比封装层更清楚。"},"612":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-46","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"`editMessageReplyMarkup` 是真签名里 `reply_markup` **必填**的那个（`chat_id message_id reply_markup`），\n所以「不要键盘」不能靠省略字段表示，必须发 `replyMarkupRemoveKeyboard`——`edit_markup_params` 用\n`entry(..).or_insert_with(..)` 兜住这一点。相册要挂键盘就只能先发、再用这条改。"},"613":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-47","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#5-富消息为什么单列一条路","content":"`messageRichMessage` 与普通消息的互斥规则完全不同（那边「文本 / 媒体」二选一，这边是一棵树），\n所以它有独立参数类型 `RichMessageParams` 与独立的构造入口（`RichMessage`）。"},"614":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-48","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#5-富消息为什么单列一条路","content":"特殊性在于：**Markdown/HTML 源由服务端解析且仅 bot 可用**，让 local 之间也就没有中间态可看。\n为了让用户号也能写 Markdown，`fuyubot-simplify` 带了一份**受控子集**的本地转换器\n（`markdown` 模块 → `InputPageBlock` 块树）：认不出的一律退回普通文本，不报错。\n按钮在 Markdown 里没有语法，所以是显式的 `RichButton` + `with_button_row`。"},"615":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-49","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#5-富消息为什么单列一条路","content":"实现细节、覆盖表与测试分工在插件 › 富消息，这里不重复——\n**只记住一条**：发/编辑也只是 `sendMessage` / `editMessageText` + `inputMessageRichMessage`，\n出口仍然只有一个。"},"616":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-50","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"公开方法底下其实只有三种等待："},"617":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-51","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"| 出口                              | 等什么     | 过滤器                                        |\n| ------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `wait_response(request_id, ms)` | 某个请求的响应 | `{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":…}` |","table":"table-0"},"618":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-52","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"| 出口                            | 等什么     | 过滤器                       |\n| ----------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------- |\n| `wait_for_update(filter, ms)` | 一条匹配的更新 | `UpdateFilter::to_json()` |","table":"table-0"},"619":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-53","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"| 出口                    | 等什么                          | 过滤器                                   |\n| --------------------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `download_file` 内部的循环 | 一组 `updateFile`，直到 completed | `{\"event_type\":\"update\",\"file.id\":…}` |","table":"table-0"},"620":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-54","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"`UpdateFilter::to_json()` 里有个容易写错的地方：`update_type` 落在 **`event_type` 键**（通道选择），\n其余条件才是对负载的字段匹配；普通更新把消息包在 `message` 里（所以条件是 `message.chat_id`），\n而 `updateNewCallbackQuery` 这类把字段放在顶层（`UpdateFilter::flat` 切的就是这个前缀）。"},"621":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-55","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"`wait_for_update` 返回的 `WaitHandle::payload_json` 是宿主的**线程局部缓冲**，只在下一次宿主调用前有效；\n`wait_for_update_json` 内部用 `payload_of` 当场拷成 `Value`。凡是跨越宿主调用的，都要拷。"},"622":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-56","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么状态要放堆上","content":"`on_command` 把 Rust 闭包交给 C 回调，`user_data` 必须是一个**稳定**的指针。现在递给 ABI 的\n是**一个结构体**（处理函数 + `HostApi`）的堆地址："},"623":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-57","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么状态要放堆上","content":"Box 活着时堆上那份的地址不变；trampoline 里再还原成 `&CommandHandler`。所有权整体压在\n`CommandSubscription` 上，所以 **drop = 退订**（`Drop` 里调 `host.off(handle)`），语义跟 `Effect` 一致。"},"624":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-58","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么状态要放堆上","content":"以前这里是「两层 Box」（`Box<Box<dyn Fn(..)>>`，交出去的是内层胖指针的目标地址）。加身份判定之后\n需要随订阅一起活的状态不止一个闭包，就收成一个结构体——**同样的道理：只有堆上那份的地址能交出去**。"},"625":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-59","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么状态要放堆上","content":"过滤发生在这个 trampoline 里：`command.addressed_to` 是 `Some(别人)` 就直接返回，闭包根本不会被调。\n判定要问宿主（`fuyubot.host.identity` 的 `usernames`），**每条点名命令都现问一次**：这是纯内存的\nservice 读，不碰 TDLib；反过来把它缓存进 `CommandHandler` 就会在用户名被 `updateUser` 改掉之后\n一直按旧名字判断（踩过一次）。命令是人手敲的，这点开销无所谓。"},"626":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-60","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么状态要放堆上","content":"trampoline 是 `extern \"C-unwind\"`（宿主要求），并且对所有空指针先 `return -1` / `0`，不会 panic 过 FFI。"},"627":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-61","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#8-异步版一次调用一个线程","content":"`*_then` 的实现就三行——`spawn_then(move || simplify.xxx(..), on_done)`："},"628":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-62","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#8-异步版一次调用一个线程","content":"因为等待必须是阻塞的（上层 API 就是这么设计的），要「不阻塞」只能换线程。代价是每次调用一个 OS 线程\n（有 `timeout_ms` 兜着，不会一直挂着），并且 `JoinHandle` 必须交回插件——**插件卸载前要 join**，\n否则动态库卸载之后线程还在执行库里的代码。这是 Gotcha，不是建议。"},"629":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-63","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#8-异步版一次调用一个线程","content":"这一层**不引入 async runtime**：阻塞 + 线程已经够表达这套语义，而且 `HostApi` 本身是同步的 C ABI。"},"630":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-64","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源               | 变体                                   |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 请求本身就发不出去（ABI 层） | `Abi(AbiError)`（宿主没接 TDLib 时也会在这里冒泡） |","table":"table-1"},"631":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-65","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源        | 变体          |\n| --------- | ----------- |\n| 参数串里含 NUL | `BadString` |","table":"table-1"},"632":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-66","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源                     | 变体                        |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| 响应是 `@type == \"error\"` | `Tdlib { code, message }` |","table":"table-1"},"633":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-67","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源                        | 变体                             |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `updateMessageSendFailed` | `SendFailed { code, message }` |","table":"table-1"},"634":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-68","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源               | 变体             |\n| ---------------- | -------------- |\n| 到期没结局（**已先撤回**过） | `Timeout(u64)` |","table":"table-1"},"635":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-69","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源                                    | 变体                                                                                                              |\n| ------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 本地校验挡下来的（相册项数、空的富消息 / 按钮行、源不是块树、转发条数） | `AlbumSize` / `EmptyRichMessage` / `RichSourceNotBlocks` / `EmptyButtonRow` / `EmptyForward` / `TooManyForward` |","table":"table-1"},"636":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-70","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"身份类查询（`me` / `chat_member`）走的是另一条路：**不把错误往上传**。\n调用方只想要「有 / 没有管理权」，不该被迫处理 TDLib 的错误码，所以内部 `soften`\n把 `error` 响应记一行 `Warn` 之后当成「没拿到」，再由上层的 `bool` 方法折成 `false`。"},"637":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-71","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"区分 `Tdlib` 与 `SendFailed` 是有意的：**方法被拒绝**和**发出去了但没发成**是两回事，\n调用方的处理也不一样（前者通常是用法错，后者通常是限流 / 权限）。"},"638":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-72","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"靠肉眼对 `td_api.tl` 是靠不住的（本文开头那批方法名以前就按 Bot API 拼错过一次），\n所以每次改动都要过这几条离线测试："},"639":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-73","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"`every_request_simplify_builds_passes_the_real_schema`：`TdApiSchema::compiled()`\n（编译期从 `td_api.tl` 烤出来的元数据）逐条 `check_request(\"方法名\", &payload)`——\n参数名写错、漏字段、多发字段都会失败，**不需要联网**；"},"640":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-74","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"`every_media_kind_becomes_one_send_message` / `media_setters_touch_only_the_variants_that_have_the_field`：\n七个 `Media` 变体各自的 `inputMessage*` 形状，以及「链式设置器只在有这个字段的变体上生效」；"},"641":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-75","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"`album_rejects_wrong_sizes` / `edit_reply_markup_is_how_an_album_gets_a_keyboard`：\n上面两节说的那些边界；"},"642":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-76","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"`block_syntax_covers_the_official_table` / `input_page_block_coverage_is_accounted_for`\n（在 `rich.rs`）：本地 Markdown 转换器对着官方 Rich Markdown 表一类一例，加块 / 删块会让它失败。"},"643":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-77","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"上面第一条只覆盖「离线也发得出去」的那些请求。**要走账号分支的**（比如 bot 专用的\n`setMessageReactions`）离线根本走不到，所以 `chat.rs` 里另有一条\n`new_request_shapes_pass_the_real_schema`：直接把 `*_params` 函数拼出来的形状喂给\n`check_request`。加新方法时**两边都要接**：前者靠在 schema 测试里补一次调用，后者靠补一个 case。"},"644":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-78","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"嵌套构造器的名字同样要验：`every_message_topic_constructor_is_reachable` 检查四个\n`MessageTopic` 构造器的 `@type` 与字段名都还在真 `td_api.tl` 里（见下一节）。"},"645":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-79","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"在线行为（`cargo test -p fuyubot-tdlib -- --ignored`）验证的是「真库认不认这些值」，与上面这层互补。"},"646":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-80","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"TDLib 里没有「这个人是不是管理员」这种字段：`user` 连 `is_bot` 都没有（身份在 `user.type`），\n管理权只在 `getChatMember` 的 `ChatMember.status` 里。所以："},"647":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-81","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"`chat_member()` 拿原始 `ChatMember`（想要细节就用它）；"},"648":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-82","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"`is_chat_admin` / `am_i_chat_admin` 直接返回 `bool`——**不是 `Result<bool>`**。\n查不到的四种情况（超时 / TDLib 报错 / 不是群聊 / 拿不到自己 id）答案都一样：\n「不确定」时说「没有」比说「有」安全，让调用方处理一堆「其实是没查到」的 `Err` 没有价值。"},"649":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-83","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"「自己」没有捷径：`getChat` 不带「我是不是管理员」，只能 `getMe` 拿 id 再 `getChatMember`。\n两次等待**各用一份** `timeout_ms`。"},"650":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-84","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"群主（`chatMemberStatusCreator`）**没有** `rights` 结构，所以除了 `is_anonymous`（它在 creator\n自己的字段上）以外一律算「有」——`is_admin_status` 里这个分支是显式的。"},"651":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-85","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#转发为什么不等发送结局","content":"`forwardMessages` 的响应是 `Messages`，和 `sendMessage` 一样是**还没发完**的临时消息。\n这里刻意只等响应：转发的成败通常不参与后续逻辑，多等一轮（N 条 `updateMessageSend*`）不划算。\nTDLib 单项失败时在对应位置放 `null`，所以调用方仍能按位判断。"},"652":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-86","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#转发为什么不等发送结局","content":"`message_ids` 在 `forward_params` 里**排序去重**：TDLib 要求严格递增，而调用方手里的 id 多半\n是从若干条更新里攒出来的。"},"653":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-87","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"|     | 用户号                  | bot                                  |\n| --- | -------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 加一个 | `addMessageReaction` | `setMessageReactions`（**bot 只能用这个**） |","table":"table-2"},"654":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-88","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"|     | 用户号                     | bot                        |\n| --- | ----------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| 去掉  | `removeMessageReaction` | `setMessageReactions` 传空列表 |","table":"table-2"},"655":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-89","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"语义差别是真实的：用户是「在已有反应上追加 / 删掉指定的一个」，bot 是「整组覆盖」。\n所以 bot 侧的 `unreact` **忽略** `reaction` 参数直接清空——这一点写在方法文档里，不要当 bug 修。"},"656":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-90","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"判定靠 `getMe` 的 `user.type`，也就是每次 `react` 多一次往返。**这里刻意不做缓存**：\n`Simplify` 是 `Copy` 且无状态，加个进程级 `OnceLock` 会让「离线环境拿到过什么」变成隐藏状态，\n测试也会被污染。调用方已经知道自己是哪种时，直接调 `add_reaction` / `set_reactions` 就绕开了。"},"657":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-91","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#连接状态只能订阅","content":"TDLib 没有 `getConnectionState`，状态只以 `updateConnectionState` 出现且**不重放**——\n所以只能订阅并记住最新那条，`ConnectionTracker` 就是干这个的："},"658":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-92","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#连接状态只能订阅","content":"与第 7 节的「状态放堆上」同一个道理：结构体会**按值返回**（被移动），\n只有堆上那一份的地址能交出去给 ABI。所有权压在 `ConnectionTracker` 上，所以 **drop = 退订**。"},"659":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-93","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#连接状态只能订阅","content":"`is_ready()` 对「还没收到过任何更新」也返回 `false`——宁可保守，别把「不知道」当「连上了」。\n⚠️ 这是**连接**状态，不是授权状态：`connectionStateReady` 也可能还没登录。"},"660":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-94","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"`sendMessage` / `sendMessageAlbum` / `forwardMessages` 的 `topic_id` 是 `MessageTopic`，\n**不是**一个裸 id："},"661":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-95","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"`messageTopicForum { forum_topic_id: int32 }` —— **论坛**群组，以及与 bot 的私聊；"},"662":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-96","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"`messageTopicThread { message_thread_id: int53 }` —— **非论坛**群组的评论串；"},"663":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-97","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"`messageTopicDirectMessages` / `messageTopicSavedMessages`。"},"664":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-98","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"这一层以前固定按 `messageTopicThread` 拼，等于在非论坛群以外全错，所以改成 `Topic` 枚举并\n**不给 `From<i64>`**：论坛话题是 `int32`、评论串是 `int53`，一个裸数字说不清是哪一种。"},"665":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-99","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**参数结构体**（一个方法一个，字段用短名字）→ `Default`（`timeout_ms` 用 `DEFAULT_TIMEOUT_MS`）；"},"666":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-100","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**请求组装函数** `xxx_params(.., render)`：`@type` 不要自己写（那是宿主补的），\n字段名以真 `td_api.tl` 为准；"},"667":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-101","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**`Simplify` 上的方法**：阻塞版等到结果 + 同名 `*_then`（见第 8 节）；"},"668":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-102","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**补测试**：先让 `every_request_simplify_builds_passes_the_real_schema` 盖住新请求；"},"669":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-103","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**补文档**：插件 › Simplify 封装 里按**功能范围**归到对应那一节，\n别新开章节堆在末尾。"},"670":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-104","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"方法名 / 字段名**不要按 Telegram Bot API 的直觉写**。TDLib 里一切发送都是 `sendMessage`，\n媒体类型在 `input_message_content.@type` 里；话题是 `topic_id`（而且是 `MessageTopic`，\n论坛话题是 `messageTopicForum` **不是** `messageTopicThread`）、回复是 `reply_to`、\n没有顶层 `caption`。要查就查真 `td_api.tl`。"},"671":{"id":"/docs","page_id":"/docs","type":"page","content":"fuyubot 文档","tags":[],"url":"/docs"},"672":{"id":"/docs-0","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"基于 TDLib 的 Telegram bot / user 框架"},"673":{"id":"/docs-1","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#两条插件路线","content":"两条插件路线"},"674":{"id":"/docs-2","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#下一步","content":"下一步"},"675":{"id":"/docs-3","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"**fuyubot** 是一个基于 TDLib 的 Telegram bot / user 框架：Rust 内核 + C ABI 插件 + 可选的脚本插件。\n插件就是一个动态库（`.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib`），一个 cdylib 就是一个插件。"},"676":{"id":"/docs-4","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"使用文档\" href=\"/docs/usage/\" description=\"下载安装、配置文件、运行、回放、实例管理与排错\" />"},"677":{"id":"/docs-5","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"插件开发\" href=\"/docs/plugin/\" description=\"用 Rust / C / C++ / Go 写原生插件：导出符号、事件、TDLib 调用与 ABI\" />"},"678":{"id":"/docs-6","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"开发文档\" href=\"/docs/dev/\" description=\"改框架本身：架构、构建测试、常见陷阱、发布\" />"},"679":{"id":"/docs-7","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"脚本插件\" href=\"/docs/script/\" description=\"Python / JS / TS：由独立的 fuyubot.script 插件托管，不编译、装上就跑\" />"},"680":{"id":"/docs-8","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"CLI 文档\" href=\"/docs/cli/\" description=\"fuyubot 的完整命令参考\" />"},"681":{"id":"/docs-9","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#两条插件路线","content":"| 路线         | 写什么                           | 要编译吗                                        |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| 原生插件（插件开发） | Rust / C / C++ / Go，一个 cdylib | 要（`cargo build` / `cl /LD` / `gcc -shared`） |","table":"table-0"},"682":{"id":"/docs-10","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#两条插件路线","content":"| 路线         | 写什么                   | 要编译吗 |\n| ---------- | --------------------- | ---- |\n| 脚本插件（脚本插件） | Python / JS / TS，一个目录 | 不要   |","table":"table-0"},"683":{"id":"/docs-11","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#两条插件路线","content":"脚本能力**不在运行时本体里**：它由独立仓库的 `fuyubot.script` 插件提供，装上才有。\n想要 Python / JS / TS 脚本支持，到\nFuyuBot-Script Releases 下载\n`fuyubot-script-<OS>-<平台>.zip`，把里面的 `plugins/fuyubot.script/` 放进插件目录；\n**同时要先装好 uv（Python）和 bun（JS / TS）**——\n这两个运行时不在任何安装包里。\n`fuyubot` 自己**只跑不编译**——`fuyubot plugin install` 只负责把编好的产物**复制**进插件目录。"},"684":{"id":"/docs-12","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"**普通用户（桌面）**：到 Releases 下对应平台的包，\n解压后直接运行 `fuyubot` 开**终端操作面板**（登录 / 启停 / 日志 / 配置都在里面）——\n见 下载与安装"},"685":{"id":"/docs-13","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"**Android 用户**：推荐官方图形客户端\nFuyuBot-for-Android（APK），不用在 Termux 里手敲 CLI"},"686":{"id":"/docs-14","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"要自己编：见 从源码构建"},"687":{"id":"/docs-15","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"要写插件：看 插件总览"},"688":{"id":"/docs-16","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"想改框架：看 开发文档"},"689":{"id":"/docs-17","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"卡住了：看 常见问题"},"690":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","type":"page","content":"ABI v5 → v6 迁移","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6"},"691":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","content":"服务调用现在经过宿主，提供方能识别调用方；插件重编一次即可"},"692":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#你要做什么","content":"你要做什么"},"693":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#调用方写法不变","content":"调用方：写法不变"},"694":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#提供方能准确拿到调用方","content":"提供方：能准确拿到调用方"},"695":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#返回值null-与空串","content":"返回值：`NULL` 与空串"},"696":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#c--go-调用方","content":"C / Go 调用方"},"697":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#排错","content":"排错"},"698":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#顺手补齐的三件事","content":"顺手补齐的三件事"},"699":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#服务的调用方与执行者","content":"服务的调用方与执行者"},"700":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","content":"从 0.1.4 起，插件之间的服务调用由宿主转交。最直接的变化：像命令表这样的服务\n终于能可靠地知道**是哪个插件**在做登记——包括调用方在自己的线程上发起的情况。"},"701":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#你要做什么","content":"绝大多数插件只需要**重新编译一次**："},"702":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#你要做什么","content":"用 `define_plugin!` 的 Rust 插件：`cargo build` 就够了，版本号由 `fuyubot-abi` 提供。"},"703":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#你要做什么","content":"手写 C / C++：换用新的 `fuyubot_plugin.h`（`#define ABI_VERSION 6`）。"},"704":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#你要做什么","content":"Go（c-shared）：重新 `go build`。这类库一旦加载就不能卸载，换版本后要重启进程。"},"705":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#你要做什么","content":"`plugin.json` 里的 `\"abi\": 6` 只是给人看的建议值，写不写都不会影响加载。"},"706":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#你要做什么","content":"> 0.1.4 宿主不会加载 0.1.3 编译的插件（反过来也一样）。看到\n> `plugin_init 返回了失败句柄` 就是这件事：重编插件即可。"},"707":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#调用方写法不变","content":"不需要传插件名，也传不了别人的名字——身份由宿主判定。\n命令表现在由宿主提供；旧的 `fuyubot.help.commands` 仍保留为兼容别名。"},"708":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#提供方能准确拿到调用方","content":"| 调用发生在哪                    | 拿到的调用方          |\n| ------------------------- | --------------- |\n| 插件 `start()` / 事件回调 / 中间件 | 该插件（与 0.1.3 相同） |","table":"table-0"},"709":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#提供方能准确拿到调用方","content":"| 调用发生在哪                               | 拿到的调用方              |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------------- |\n| 插件自己起的线程（tokio task、`thread::spawn`） | **该插件**（0.1.3 会拿不到） |","table":"table-0"},"710":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#提供方能准确拿到调用方","content":"| 调用发生在哪               | 拿到的调用方                   |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| A 调 B 的服务、B 再调 C 的服务 | C 看到的是 **B**（0.1.3 看到 A） |","table":"table-0"},"711":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#提供方能准确拿到调用方","content":"| 调用发生在哪                 | 拿到的调用方 |\n| ---------------------- | ------ |\n| 宿主自己调（`plugin list` 等） | `None` |","table":"table-0"},"712":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#提供方能准确拿到调用方","content":"`None` 表示「不是某个插件在调」，不要拿它当错误。"},"713":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#返回值null-与空串","content":"服务方法返回的字符串，约定收紧了一点："},"714":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#返回值null-与空串","content":"| 提供方返回  | 调用方看到                                   |\n| ------ | --------------------------------------- |\n| `NULL` | **失败**（服务不存在 / 没有该方法 / 入参非法），具体原因在宿主日志里 |","table":"table-1"},"715":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#返回值null-与空串","content":"| 提供方返回   | 调用方看到    |\n| ------- | -------- |\n| 空串 `\"\"` | 成功，但没有输出 |","table":"table-1"},"716":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#返回值null-与空串","content":"| 提供方返回 | 调用方看到           |\n| ----- | --------------- |\n| 其他字符串 | 成功，内容就是返回的 JSON |","table":"table-1"},"717":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#返回值null-与空串","content":"所以以前用 `NULL` 表示「成功但无内容」的服务，改成返回 `\"\"`。\n字符串仍然是**提供方持有、读完即弃**：调用方要保留就当场拷走（`HostApi::call_service` 已经替你拷好了）。"},"718":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#c--go-调用方","content":"建议改走同一个入口："},"719":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#c--go-调用方","content":"自己 `get_service` 拿到表再直接调函数指针仍然能跑，但那次调用绕过了宿主，\n提供方只会拿到 `None`——拿不到调用方。"},"720":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#排错","content":"| 现象                                  | 原因            | 处理   |\n| ----------------------------------- | ------------- | ---- |\n| 启动时插件全被跳过，日志有 `plugin_init 返回了失败句柄` | 插件还是 0.1.3 编的 | 重编插件 |","table":"table-2"},"721":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#排错","content":"| 现象         | 原因                   | 处理                     |\n| ---------- | -------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| 服务的归属字段是空的 | 有一条调用路径绕过了宿主（自己取表直调） | 改用 `host.call_service` |","table":"table-2"},"722":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#排错","content":"| 现象                 | 原因            | 处理           |\n| ------------------ | ------------- | ------------ |\n| 服务调用从「成功、无内容」变成了失败 | 提供方返回了 `NULL` | 提供方改成返回 `\"\"` |","table":"table-2"},"723":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#顺手补齐的三件事","content":"0.1.4 在 v6 内还追加了三个入口，都是**尾部追加、不跳版本号**："},"724":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#顺手补齐的三件事","content":"| 入口                  | 用途                                                                   |\n| ------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `host.last_error()` | `call_service` 失败时**为什么**失败。`HostApi::call_service` 已经自动拼进错误文本，不用自己调 |","table":"table-3"},"725":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#顺手补齐的三件事","content":"| 入口                     | 用途                                                 |\n| ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `host.list_services()` | 当前插件看得见的服务清单（名字 / 版本 / 方法名 / 提供方）。按能力找服务，别硬编码别人的名字 |","table":"table-3"},"726":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#顺手补齐的三件事","content":"| 入口                                         | 用途                                                                                                                                                                              |\n| ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `host.set_config_for(section, key, value)` | 写**指定插件**的配置段（跨插件同步设置）。`section` 用配置文件里的段名（`plugin.fuyubot.music` 或 `[plugin.fuyubot.music]`，空串 = 自己）；只接受 `plugin.*`，顶层归用户。规则与 `set_config` 一致：用户钉住的键照样拒绝、只落目标那个文件，宿主会记一行「谁改了谁」 |","table":"table-3"},"727":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#顺手补齐的三件事","content":"另外两处行为跟着修正："},"728":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#顺手补齐的三件事","content":"**服务方法里 `set_config` 现在写提供方自己的段**（以前会错写进调用方那段）。"},"729":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#顺手补齐的三件事","content":"`get_config` 多了个「默认读自己」：`section` 空串 = 自己那段；段名按 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[段]` 写（`plugin.x.y` / `[bot]` / 裸插件名都认）。"},"730":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi-v6#服务的调用方与执行者","content":"`current_plugin()` 回答的是「谁在调我」；`set_config` 关心的是「这段代码算谁的」。\n一个插件在自己线程上调服务时，两者**不是同一个插件**（前者是调用方，后者是提供方）。\n0.1.4 起宿主分开记这两件事，所以你不需要在服务方法里手动绕开 `set_config` 了。"},"731":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"page","content":"ABI 契约","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi"},"732":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi","content":"HostApiVTable、导出符号、内存所有权与版本协商"},"733":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"插件必须导出的符号"},"734":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"HostApiVTable：`host_ctx` + 27 个函数指针"},"735":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"服务作用域"},"736":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务的形状servicevtable","content":"服务的形状：`ServiceVTable`"},"737":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么调方法","content":"怎么调方法"},"738":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么找到服务list_services","content":"怎么找到服务：`list_services`"},"739":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#调用者身份current_plugin","content":"调用者身份：`current_plugin`"},"740":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"宿主预置的服务"},"741":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"内存所有权：三条硬规矩"},"742":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"版本协商"},"743":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#simplify-操作表","content":"simplify 操作表"},"744":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#结果怎么回来","content":"结果怎么回来"},"745":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#入参的形状","content":"入参的形状"},"746":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"操作清单"},"747":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"为什么本 ABI 一个可变参数函数指针都没有"},"748":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"五种语言各自声明的兼容 ABI 版本"},"749":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"回调为什么是 `C-unwind`"},"750":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi","content":"这是**唯一**的跨语言契约：形状只有 `fuyubot-abi/src/lib.rs` 一份实现，C 头文件\n`fuyubot_plugin.h` 由 cbindgen 从它生成（**产物，不是源码**，别手改；怎么拿到它见\nC 与 C++ 插件 › 头文件）。宿主侧所有桥在\n`fuyubot-loader/src/runtime.rs`。**改 ABI = 改那个文件 + 加版本号。**"},"751":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"v3 的四个契约符号仍是必需/可选的底线；v4 另外导出三个**静态符号**，让\n宿主与静态工具**不 dlopen** 也能看见插件是按哪个 ABI 编的（版本值仍只能运行时判定）。"},"752":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号            | 类型                                                           | 必须吗    | 说明                                              |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | ------ | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_init` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(*const HostApiVTable) -> PluginHandle` | **必须** | 校验 VTable、构造状态；返回失败句柄（`abi_version == 0`）= 拒绝加载 |","table":"table-0"},"753":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号             | 类型                                                         | 必须吗 | 说明                                  |\n| -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- | --- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(PluginHandle, *const c_char) -> i32` | 可选  | 拿到配置 JSON，注册订阅 / 工具 / 中间件；返回 `0` 成功 |","table":"table-0"},"754":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号            | 类型                                   | 必须吗 | 说明             |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------ | --- | -------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(PluginHandle)` | 可选  | 卸载前调一次，回收自己的状态 |","table":"table-0"},"755":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号                   | 类型                                  | 必须吗    | 说明                                |\n| -------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ------ | --------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(*mut c_char)` | **必须** | 释放**插件自己**分配的字符串（宿主从不 free 插件的指针） |","table":"table-0"},"756":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号                   | 类型                                   | 必须吗   | 说明                                                 |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------ | ----- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_handle` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(PluginHandle)` | v4 可选 | 版本不匹配、不能调 `plugin_stop` 时，用来释放 `plugin_init` 分配的状态 |","table":"table-0"},"757":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号                    | 类型                              | 必须吗   | 说明                                     |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot_abi_version` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn() -> u32` | v4 可选 | 返回编译期 `ABI_VERSION`；静态工具只检查“存在”，值要运行时看 |","table":"table-0"},"758":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号                | 类型                                        | 必须吗   | 说明                                                                                                       |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_manifest` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn() -> *const c_char` | v4 可选 | 自描述 JSON（名字 / 版本 / `inject` / `soft_inject`）。宿主在 `plugin_init` **之前**读；名字与 `init` 不一致只告警，依赖以 manifest 为准 |","table":"table-0"},"759":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"符号名由常量钉住（`SYM_PLUGIN_INIT` / `SYM_PLUGIN_START` / `SYM_PLUGIN_STOP` /\n`SYM_PLUGIN_FREE_STRING` / `SYM_PLUGIN_FREE_HANDLE` / `SYM_PLUGIN_ABI_VERSION` /\n`SYM_PLUGIN_MANIFEST`），`PluginLoader::load_with_config` 按这些名字 `lib.get(...)`。\nC++ 里必须把它们放进 `extern \"C\"` 块，否则名字被 mangle，宿主 dlsym 不到。"},"760":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"`PluginHandle` = `{ abi_version: u32, size: u32, context: *mut c_void, name: *const c_char }`；\n`is_valid()` 的判据是「`abi_version != 0` **且** `context` 非空」，所以插件的 `context` 不能是\n`NULL`。`PluginHandle::FAILED` 是全零版本号，`const _` 里有\n`assert!(PluginHandle::FAILED.abi_version == 0)`。"},"761":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"宿主拿一个 cdylib 之后，按这个顺序敲你的符号——右边那条岔路是版本不匹配时的走法："},"762":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"插件符号的调用时序与版本不匹配时的岔路"},"763":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"宿主先 dlopen 并按名字 dlsym 七个符号，然后读 manifest 决定激活顺序，再调 plugin_init 校验 VTable；版本不匹配时只能调 plugin_free_handle 而不能调 plugin_stop，匹配则进 plugin_start、运行、最后 plugin_stop 与回滚。"},"764":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"1 · dlopen + dlsym 七个符号"},"765":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"C++ 要放进 extern \"C\""},"766":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"2 · plugin_manifest（v4 可选）"},"767":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"决定激活顺序"},"768":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"3 · plugin_init(&amp;VTable) → PluginHandle"},"769":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"先比 version 再比 size"},"770":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"不匹配"},"771":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"拒绝加载"},"772":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"abi_version == 0"},"773":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"plugin_free_handle"},"774":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"不能调 stop"},"775":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"4 · plugin_start(handle, config_json)"},"776":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"订阅 / 工具 / 中间件"},"777":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"5 · 运行：事件回调与 td_invoke"},"778":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"6 · plugin_stop → 回滚这批注册"},"779":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"最后才卸载 cdylib"},"780":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"plugin_free_string：谁分配谁释放"},"781":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"三点值得记住：`plugin_manifest` 在 `plugin_init` **之前**读（宿主得先知道你的依赖才能排顺序）；\n版本不匹配时**只能**用 `plugin_free_handle` 收尾，那一刻 `plugin_stop` 不会被调；\n卸载顺序是 `plugin_stop` → 回滚注册 → 最后才 drop 那个 `Library`。"},"782":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"`version` 在偏移 0、`size` 在 4、`host_ctx` 在 8，其余 **27 个是函数指针**，全是 `Option<...>`；\n总大小 = `2 * size_of::<u32>() + 28 * size_of::<*const c_void>()`（`host_ctx` + 27 个函数），\n由 `const _` 里的 `offset_of!` / `size_of` 断言钉死。每个函数第一个参数都是 `host: *mut c_void`。"},"783":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"下表签名省略第一个参数 `host`："},"784":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段        | 签名    | 宿主实现          | 说明                                        |\n| --- | --------- | ----- | ------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| —   | `version` | `u32` | `ABI_VERSION` | 必须等于 `ABI_VERSION`；首个字段，插件能在读其它任何字段之前先比一次 |","table":"table-1"},"785":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段     | 签名    | 宿主实现                         | 说明                                  |\n| --- | ------ | ----- | ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| —   | `size` | `u32` | `size_of::<HostApiVTable>()` | 老宿主 + 新插件时先比 `size` 再读尾部字段，读越界就是 UB |","table":"table-1"},"786":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段         | 签名            | 宿主实现           | 说明                                 |\n| --- | ---------- | ------------- | -------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| —   | `host_ctx` | `*mut c_void` | `&HostRuntime` | 每个函数都原样回传；插件作者看不见它（`HostApi` 自动带上） |","table":"table-1"},"787":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段   | 签名                                                                      | 宿主实现     | 说明                                                                         |\n| --- | ---- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | `on` | `(update_type, filter_json, callback, user_data) -> SubscriptionHandle` | `api_on` | 订阅；`filter_json` 里的 `event_type` 选通道，其余键做负载匹配；`NULL` / 空串 / `\"null\"` = 收全部 |","table":"table-1"},"788":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段    | 签名               | 宿主实现      | 说明                   |\n| --- | ----- | ---------------- | --------- | -------------------- |\n| 2   | `off` | `(handle) -> ()` | `api_off` | 退订；句柄 drop 时宿主也会整批回滚 |","table":"table-1"},"789":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段     | 签名                                  | 宿主实现       | 说明                                              |\n| --- | ------ | ----------------------------------- | ---------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | `emit` | `(event_type, payload_json) -> i32` | `api_emit` | 发自定义事件；对插件而言是 `emit_scoped(自己, …)`，只送自己 + 全局订阅者 |","table":"table-1"},"790":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段              | 签名                                                    | 宿主实现                | 说明                                                                                                    |\n| --- | --------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | `register_tool` | `(descriptor_json, handler, user_data) -> ToolHandle` | `api_register_tool` | 登记元数据 + 可选处理器；处理器是 `C-unwind fn(user_data, input_json) -> *const c_char`，只登记元数据用 `register_tool_meta` |","table":"table-1"},"791":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段          | 签名                                | 宿主实现            | 说明                                          |\n| --- | ----------- | --------------------------------- | --------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| 5   | `call_tool` | `(name, input_json) -> RequestId` | `api_call_tool` | 走 `ToolRegistry::call_tool` 的请求号路径（兼容/异步工具） |","table":"table-1"},"792":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                 | 签名                                    | 宿主实现                   | 说明                                                   |\n| --- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| 6   | `call_tool_result` | `(name, input_json) -> *const c_char` | `api_call_tool_result` | **同步**执行工具并返回结果 JSON（失败 `{\"error\":…}`）。宿主线程局部缓冲，读完即弃 |","table":"table-1"},"793":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段           | 签名                    | 宿主实现             | 说明                                 |\n| --- | ------------ | --------------------- | ---------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 7   | `list_tools` | `() -> *const c_char` | `api_list_tools` | 全部工具的元数据 JSON 数组。**宿主线程局部缓冲**，读完即弃 |","table":"table-1"},"794":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段             | 签名                    | 宿主实现               | 说明                                    |\n| --- | -------------- | --------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------- |\n| 8   | `list_plugins` | `() -> *const c_char` | `api_list_plugins` | 进程内插件报告 JSON 数组（名字 / 状态 / 缺依赖 / 失败原因） |","table":"table-1"},"795":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                | 签名                                              | 宿主实现                  | 说明                                                   |\n| --- | ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| 9   | `provide_service` | `(name, *const ServiceVTable) -> ServiceHandle` | `api_provide_service` | 注册命名服务到**调用者自己的作用域**（默认私有，兄弟插件看不见）；`vtable` 必须活到注销为止 |","table":"table-1"},"796":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段            | 签名                               | 宿主实现              | 说明                                |\n| --- | ------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| 10  | `get_service` | `(name) -> *const ServiceVTable` | `api_get_service` | 从调用者自己的作用域**沿父链**向上查找；没有就是 `NULL` |","table":"table-1"},"797":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段          | 签名                           | 宿主实现            | 说明                           |\n| --- | ----------- | ---------------------------- | --------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| 11  | `td_invoke` | `(method_json) -> RequestId` | `api_td_invoke` | 发完整 TDLib 请求 JSON（含 `@type`） |","table":"table-1"},"798":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                     | 签名                                        | 宿主实现                       | 说明                                                      |\n| --- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 12  | `td_invoke_simplified` | `(method_name, params_json) -> RequestId` | `api_td_invoke_simplified` | 给参数补上 `@type = method_name`；参数不是对象就整份替换成 `{\"@type\": …}` |","table":"table-1"},"799":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段           | 签名                                | 宿主实现             | 说明                                                                                                              |\n| --- | ------------ | --------------------------------- | ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 13  | `td_execute` | `(request_json) -> *const c_char` | `api_td_execute` | **同步**执行不碰网络的方法（`td_json_client_execute`），当场返回响应 JSON。**不发请求号、不进请求留档、不等响应通道**——所以能在事件回调里用；宿主没接 TDLib 时返回 `NULL` |","table":"table-1"},"800":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段               | 签名                                                      | 宿主实现                 | 说明                     |\n| --- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| 14  | `use_middleware` | `(stage: u32, callback, user_data) -> MiddlewareHandle` | `api_use_middleware` | 挂在某个阶段；回调返回非 0 → 本阶段中断 |","table":"table-1"},"801":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                | 签名                                             | 宿主实现                  | 说明                                                                           |\n| --- | ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 15  | `wait_for_update` | `(filter_json, timeout_ms: u64) -> WaitHandle` | `api_wait_for_update` | **阻塞**当前线程；`timeout_ms == 0` 表示只检查当前状态。Rust 插件优先用 `ResponseRouter` 的 await 版 |","table":"table-1"},"802":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段            | 签名               | 宿主实现              | 说明         |\n| --- | ------------- | ---------------- | ----------------- | ---------- |\n| 16  | `cancel_wait` | `(handle) -> ()` | `api_cancel_wait` | 从另一个线程取消等待 |","table":"table-1"},"803":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段    | 签名                            | 宿主实现      | 说明                                                              |\n| --- | ----- | ----------------------------- | --------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 17  | `log` | `(level: u32, message) -> ()` | `api_log` | 落进宿主环形缓冲（`LOG_CAPACITY = 256`）并打一行到 stderr；非法 level 按 `Info` 处理 |","table":"table-1"},"804":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段           | 签名                                | 宿主实现             | 说明                                                                                                                                                                                  |\n| --- | ------------ | --------------------------------- | ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 18  | `get_config` | `(section, key) -> *const c_char` | `api_get_config` | 读配置：`section` 用**配置文件里的段名**——`plugin.fuyubot.manage`、`[bot]`、或裸插件名 `fuyubot.manage` 都认；**空串 = 自己那段**（与 `set_config` 同一个默认）。`key` 空串读整段、否则按点路径取键。**宿主线程局部缓冲**，读完即弃；段 / 键不存在返回 `NULL` |","table":"table-1"},"805":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段           | 签名                         | 宿主实现             | 说明                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |\n| --- | ------------ | -------------------------- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 19  | `set_config` | `(key, value_json) -> i32` | `api_set_config` | 写配置：**只能写执行者自己名下的段**（没有 section 参数，宿主按执行者身份判定，插件无法伪造；要写别人用第 27 项）。`key` 空串覆盖整段、否则按点路径设键。返回 0 = 成功（写内存 + **段级落盘**到 `<root>/plugin-config/<名>.toml`，原子替换，`fuyubot.toml` 永不改写）；非 0 = 越权 / 解析失败 / 写盘失败 / **这个键被用户配置钉住**（`fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<名>]` 里写了它）/ 这次启动没有可回写的配置文件（宿主不给 `config_path`，写入会丢，所以直接失败而不是静默只改内存） |","table":"table-1"},"806":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                       | 签名                                              | 宿主实现                         | 说明                                                                     |\n| --- | ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 20  | `provide_service_shared` | `(name, *const ServiceVTable) -> ServiceHandle` | `api_provide_service_shared` | 注册到**进程级**（所有插件可见，这也是宿主那四个机制所在的层级）。同名会撞，只在真要共享时用。v4 起追加在 VTable **尾部** |","table":"table-1"},"807":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                | 签名                       | 宿主实现                  | 说明                                                                                         |\n| --- | ----------------- | ------------------------ | --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 21  | `simplify_invoke` | `(op_json) -> RequestId` | `api_simplify_invoke` | **跨语言跑一个 simplify 操作**（v5）。宿主起工作线程执行，结果照 `@request_id` 回投到 `\"response\"` 通道。见「simplify 操作表」 |","table":"table-1"},"808":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                       | 签名                           | 宿主实现                         | 说明                                                                                            |\n| --- | ------------------------ | ---------------------------- | ---------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 22  | `simplify_invoke_result` | `(op_json) -> *const c_char` | `api_simplify_invoke_result` | **同步**跑一个不碰网络的 simplify 操作，当场返回结果 JSON（线程局部缓冲）。回调里安全；传异步 op 返回 `ok:false` / `code:\"async_op\"` |","table":"table-1"},"809":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段               | 签名                    | 宿主实现                 | 说明                                                                                                                                                     |\n| --- | ---------------- | --------------------- | -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 23  | `current_plugin` | `() -> *const c_char` | `api_current_plugin` | **当前调用者是谁**：宿主自己回 `NULL`，插件回它的名字（线程局部缓冲，读完即弃）。被别的插件调用时返回那个调用方（v6 起跨线程也成立），其余时候返回宿主最后交给的那个插件。两个来源都查同一份 `owner_names` 映射（与 `set_config` 的越权判定同一份），插件伪造不了 |","table":"table-1"},"810":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段             | 签名                                               | 宿主实现               | 说明                                                                                                                                                          |\n| --- | -------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 24  | `call_service` | `(service, method, input_json) -> *const c_char` | `api_call_service` | **经过宿主调服务**（v6 尾部追加，Rust 侧即 `HostApi::call_service`）：宿主把调用转给提供方，并记下调用方，于是对方问得出「谁在调我」。返回 `NULL` = 失败（原因进宿主日志）；**空串 = 成功但对方没输出**；其余是对方给的 JSON 文本（线程局部缓冲，读完即弃） |","table":"table-1"},"811":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段           | 签名                    | 宿主实现             | 说明                                                                                               |\n| --- | ------------ | --------------------- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 25  | `last_error` | `() -> *const c_char` | `api_last_error` | 上一次被拒绝的调用**为什么**失败（本线程；没失败过是 `NULL`）。目前只有 `call_service` 会填，`HostApi::call_service` 已经自动把它转成错误文本 |","table":"table-1"},"812":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段              | 签名                    | 宿主实现                | 说明                                                                                                          |\n| --- | --------------- | --------------------- | ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 26  | `list_services` | `() -> *const c_char` | `api_list_services` | 当前插件**看得见**的服务清单（JSON 数组）：`{name, version, methods[], plugin}`；`plugin` 为 `null` = 宿主预置。按能力找服务用它，别再硬编码别人的名字 |","table":"table-1"},"813":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--27-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                   | 签名                                  | 宿主实现                     | 说明                                                                                                                                                                                                               |\n| --- | -------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 27  | `set_config_section` | `(section, key, value_json) -> i32` | `api_set_config_section` | 写**指定插件**的配置段（跨插件写）：`section` 用同样的段名写法（`plugin.fuyubot.music` / `[plugin.fuyubot.music]` / 裸插件名；空串 = 自己），但**只接受 `plugin.*`**——顶层 `[bot]` / `[telegram]` 归用户，写了会被拒。拒绝规则与第 19 项一致（用户钉住的键照样拒绝、只落目标那个文件），宿主记一行「谁改了谁」 |","table":"table-1"},"814":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"每个插件加载时拿到**自己的一层 `Context`**，于是："},"815":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"`provide_service` 注册的服务只对本插件（和它更深的子作用域）可见——**默认私有**。\n两个插件注册同名服务**不冲突**，各用各的实现。"},"816":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"宿主注册在根上的公共服务（事件总线 / 服务容器 / 工具表 / 中间件管线）沿父链照样看得到。"},"817":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"真要跨插件共享才用 `provide_service_shared`：它写进程级的根表，同名会和别人撞\n（直接报 `ServiceNameExists`）。"},"818":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"插件卸载时，它那层作用域连同里面的服务一起消失。"},"819":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"跨插件联动的端到端示例（共享服务 `demo.notes`）见插件联动；\n命令表本身是宿主预置服务，见命令表与 /help。"},"820":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"两条形状上的硬要求："},"821":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-89","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"**第一个参数总是 `host: *mut c_void`**：裸函数指针没有捕获环境，VTable 里放不了闭包；\n不给显式上下文就只能靠进程级全局，那样一个进程只能有一个宿主、测试也没法并行。"},"822":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-90","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"**每个函数指针字段都是 `Option<...>`**：C 侧传 `NULL` 合法，非 `Option` 字段收到 `NULL` 就是 UB。\nRust 侧 `HostApi::from_raw` 一次解包校验全部 27 个，之后调用路径上没有 `Option`、也没有 panic 分支。"},"823":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-91","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务的形状servicevtable","content":"一个服务就是一张 C 结构表——宿主和插件都不需要知道服务的 Rust 类型，按名字调方法即可："},"824":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-92","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务的形状servicevtable","content":"| 字段     | 类型              | 含义               |\n| ------ | --------------- | ---------------- |\n| `name` | `*const c_char` | 服务名，NUL 结尾 UTF-8 |","table":"table-2"},"825":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-93","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务的形状servicevtable","content":"| 字段        | 类型    | 含义                   |\n| --------- | ----- | -------------------- |\n| `version` | `u32` | 提供方填的协议版本（协商用，宿主不校验） |","table":"table-2"},"826":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-94","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务的形状servicevtable","content":"| 字段     | 类型    | 含义                           |\n| ------ | ----- | ---------------------------- |\n| `size` | `u32` | `size_of::<ServiceVTable>()` |","table":"table-2"},"827":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-95","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务的形状servicevtable","content":"| 字段        | 类型            | 含义                    |\n| --------- | ------------- | --------------------- |\n| `context` | `*mut c_void` | 提供方的实例数据，**原样传给每个方法** |","table":"table-2"},"828":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-96","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务的形状servicevtable","content":"| 字段        | 类型                     | 含义                        |\n| --------- | ---------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `methods` | `*const ServiceMethod` | 指向 `method_count` 个连续的方法项 |","table":"table-2"},"829":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-97","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务的形状servicevtable","content":"| 字段             | 类型      | 含义    |\n| -------------- | ------- | ----- |\n| `method_count` | `usize` | 方法项个数 |","table":"table-2"},"830":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-98","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务的形状servicevtable","content":"每个方法项是 `{ name: *const c_char, func: ServiceMethodFn }`，\n`ServiceMethodFn = fn(context: *mut c_void, input_json: *const c_char) -> *const c_char`。"},"831":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-99","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么调方法","content":"**v6 起这次调用经过宿主**（VTable 第 24 项 `call_service`），Rust 侧写法没变：\n`HostApi::call_service(name, method, input_json)`。"},"832":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-100","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么调方法","content":"宿主替你把这个调用转给提供方，并在调用期间记下调用方是谁；"},"833":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-101","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么调方法","content":"被调方因此能在方法里问出**真实调用方**（下一节），插件在自己的线程上调进来也成立；"},"834":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-102","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么调方法","content":"返回 `NULL` = **失败**（服务不存在 / 没这个方法 / 入参含 NUL）；"},"835":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-103","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么调方法","content":"返回**空串** = 成功但没有输出（对方方法返回了 `NULL`）；"},"836":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-104","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么调方法","content":"其余 = **提供方持有的** NUL 字符串，立刻拷走——它只在本次调用返回后、\n下一次宿主函数调用之前有效（与 `list_tools` / `get_config` 同一套线程局部缓冲）。"},"837":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-105","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么调方法","content":"失败时別只说「调用失败」：第 25 项 `last_error` 带着原因（哪个服务、哪个方法、为什么）。\n`HostApi::call_service` 已经自动把它拼进错误里，Rust 侧直接 `?` 就能看到："},"838":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-106","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么调方法","content":"> `NULL` 与空串的分工是 v6 才明确的（v5 时两者都当「成功但没有输出」）。\n> 提供方想说「成功、无返回值」请 `return \"\"`，不要 `return NULL`。"},"839":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-107","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么找到服务list_services","content":"不想硬编码别人的服务名，就先问一句："},"840":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-108","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么找到服务list_services","content":"`plugin` 为 `null` 的是宿主预置服务（`fuyubot.host.scope` / `.plugins` / `.identity` /\n`.command` / `.commands` / `.cache`）。\n清单从**调用方**的作用域链算，所以自己的私有服务也在里面；只给元数据，不给 vtable 指针。"},"841":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-109","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么找到服务list_services","content":"C / Go 侧**同样走这一步**：`host->call_service(host_ctx, name, method, input_json)`。\n自己 `get_service` 拿表再直调仍然能跑，但宿主不在场，被调方就拿不到调用方。\n脚本插件（Python / JS）目前 **没有**服务调用接口——薄 SDK 只覆盖订阅 / 请求 / 日志 /\n工具元数据，见脚本插件。"},"842":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-110","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#调用者身份current_plugin","content":"服务方在方法里问一句「谁在调我」："},"843":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-111","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#调用者身份current_plugin","content":"取值规则（v6）：**正在被别人调用时就是调用方**；其余时候是宿主最后把控制权交给的那个插件\n（在插件自己起的线程上则是 `NULL`）。身份由宿主判定，插件自报不了，也拿不到别人的。\n命令能力表的归属就是这么来的。"},"844":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-112","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#调用者身份current_plugin","content":"v5 只有第二级，所以「插件在自己起的线程上调服务」时归属会静默变成 `null`；\n这条差异以及 v5 → v6 的完整清单见 ABI v5 → v6 迁移。"},"845":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-113","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"宿主在根上预置了六个服务，任何插件沿父链都看得见，直接 `call_service` 就行："},"846":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-114","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名                    | 方法       | 协议                                                                                                                                               |\n| ---------------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `fuyubot.host.plugins` | `report` | 无参 → `{\"plugins\":[{name, state, …}]}`，进程内插件快照；`state` ∈ `active` / `pending` / `failed` / `activating`，`pending` 带 `missing`、`failed` 带 `reason` |","table":"table-3"},"847":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-115","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名                     | 方法          | 协议                                                                                |\n| ----------------------- | ----------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot.host.identity` | `usernames` | 无参 → `[\"FuyuBot\"]`，自身全部活跃用户名（`usernames.active_usernames`）；没登录 / 没接 TDLib 时是 `[]` |","table":"table-3"},"848":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-116","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名 | 方法   | 协议                                       |\n| --- | ---- | ---------------------------------------- |\n|     | `me` | 无参 → `getMe` 的原始 `user` JSON；没登录时 `null` |","table":"table-3"},"849":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-117","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名                    | 方法      | 协议                                                                                                                                        |\n| ---------------------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot.host.command` | `reply` | `{\"chat_id\":…,\"message_id\":…,\"timeout_ms\":…,\"payload\":<sendMessage 参数>}` → TDLib 的最终 `Message`；失败 `{\"@type\":\"error\",…}`。宿主决定发新消息还是编辑原命令消息 |","table":"table-3"},"850":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-118","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名                     | 方法         | 协议                                                                                               |\n| ----------------------- | ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `fuyubot.host.commands` | `register` | `{name, description?, role?, scopes?, hidden?}` → `{ok:true, name, plugin}`；失败 `{error}`。归属由宿主判定 |","table":"table-3"},"851":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-119","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名 | 方法           | 协议                             |\n| --- | ------------ | ------------------------------ |\n|     | `unregister` | `{name}` → `{ok:true}`；只能注销自己的 |","table":"table-3"},"852":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-120","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名 | 方法     | 协议                                                              |\n| --- | ------ | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n|     | `list` | 无参 → 扁平数组 `[{name, description, plugin, role, scopes, hidden}]` |","table":"table-3"},"853":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-121","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名 | 方法     | 协议                                                       |\n| --- | ------ | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n|     | `role` | `{user_id}` → `{global}`（`user` / `admin` / `owner`），纯内存 |","table":"table-3"},"854":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-122","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名                  | 方法    | 协议                                                  |\n| -------------------- | ----- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot.host.cache` | `get` | `{kind, id, user_id?, ttl_ms?}` → `{value, online}` |","table":"table-3"},"855":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-123","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名 | 方法    | 协议                                          |\n| --- | ----- | ------------------------------------------- |\n|     | `put` | `{kind, id, user_id?, value}` → `{ok:true}` |","table":"table-3"},"856":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-124","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名 | 方法           | 协议                                            |\n| --- | ------------ | --------------------------------------------- |\n|     | `list_chats` | `{list, limit?}` → `{chats:[chatListEntry…]}` |","table":"table-3"},"857":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-125","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名 | 方法            | 协议                               |\n| --- | ------------- | -------------------------------- |\n|     | `list_groups` | 无参 → `{groups:[chatListGroup…]}` |","table":"table-3"},"858":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-126","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名 | 方法             | 协议                                   |\n| --- | -------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n|     | `chat_folders` | 无参 → `{value: updateChatFolders 快照}` |","table":"table-3"},"859":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-127","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名 | 方法                | 协议           |\n| --- | ----------------- | ------------ |\n|     | `stats` / `clear` | 无参 → 诊断 / 清空 |","table":"table-3"},"860":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-128","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名                  | 方法             | 协议                            |\n| -------------------- | -------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot.host.scope` | `scope_create` | `{}` → `{\"handle\":N}`，开一个子作用域 |","table":"table-3"},"861":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-129","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名 | 方法            | 协议                                          |\n| --- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n|     | `scope_enter` | `{\"handle\":N}`；成功 `null`，失败 `{\"error\":\"…\"}` |","table":"table-3"},"862":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-130","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名 | 方法            | 协议           |\n| --- | ------------- | ------------ |\n|     | `scope_leave` | 忽略入参；离开当前作用域 |","table":"table-3"},"863":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-131","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名 | 方法           | 协议                                          |\n| --- | ------------ | ------------------------------------------- |\n|     | `scope_drop` | `{\"handle\":N}`；成功 `null`，失败 `{\"error\":\"…\"}` |","table":"table-3"},"864":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-132","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"命名服务表（`context.names()`）里还能看到 `fuyubot.host.commands` / `.cache`；\n`fuyubot.help.commands` 是 `.commands` 的兼容别名，一个版本后移除。"},"865":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-133","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"`fuyubot.host.plugins` 与 ABI 第 8 项 `list_plugins` 同源，只是多一条走服务这条路\n（内置 `/plugins` 插件就是这么读「进程里真在跑的」插件清单的）。`fuyubot.host.identity`\n是「我是谁」：宿主登录成功拿到 `getMe` 之后写进去，之后**每条 `updateUser`（id 是自己那条）\n都会刷新它**，所以改名字 / 改用户名之后读到的就是新值。`fuyubot-simplify` 的 `on_command`\n靠它把「点名给别人的命令」挡在插件外面——纯内存读取，不是 TDLib 请求，\n**在命令回调里调它不会卡接收循环**。面板与 `fuyubot status` 显示的账户行也来自同一份数据\n（经 `.fuyubot/status` 跨进程过去）。\n`fuyubot.host.command` 是**命令回复**的唯一入口：插件把 `SendMessageParams` 拼好的\n`sendMessage` 参数交给它，宿主按账号类型与触发者决定 `sendMessage` + `reply_to`\n（bot / user 账户白名单用户）还是编辑原命令消息（user 账户自己触发），返回最终 `Message`。\n命令消息带 `ephemeral_message_id > 0`、当前账号是 bot、且不是私聊时，宿主改发\n`sendEphemeralMessage` + `inputMessageReplyToEphemeralMessage`（`receiver_user_id` = 命令发送者）；\n任一条件不满足就退回普通消息/编辑，不尝试 ephemeral。\n它**同步阻塞**等 TDLib；插件在命令回调里应走 `Command::reply_then`（其它语言自己起工作线程），\n别在接收循环线程上直接调。被拦下的命令只会从 `updateNewMessage` 通道消失，`update` 通用通道照发。"},"866":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-134","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"`fuyubot.host.scope` 是中间插件批量托管脚本时开子作用域用的，见架构。"},"867":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-135","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"句柄类型（`SubscriptionHandle` / `ToolHandle` / `ServiceHandle` / `MiddlewareHandle` / `RequestId`）\n都是 `#[repr(C)]` + 单个 `u64`（断言钉住 `size_of == size_of::<u64>()`）；\n`LogLevel` = 1..5（`Error` / `Warn` / `Info` / `Debug` / `Trace`），`Stage` = 0..5；\n`WaitHandle` = `{ id: u64, matched: u32, _reserved: u32, payload_json: *const c_char }`。"},"868":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-136","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"**谁分配谁释放**。插件通过 `plugin_init` 返回的 `name`、以及插件自己分配的任何字符串，\n都由插件持有；宿主**绝不** free 它们。插件要给宿主一个需要接管的临时字符串，只能走\n`plugin_free_string` 那套约定。"},"869":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-137","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"**宿主返回的字符串是线程局部缓冲**。`list_tools`、`get_config`、`WaitHandle::payload_json`\n指向宿主的一块复用缓冲（`thread_local! HOST_STRING`），**只在下一次调用宿主函数之前有效**。\n要留着就当场拷走，并且**不要试图释放它**——VTable 里没有 host 侧的 free 函数，这是设计不是遗漏。"},"870":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-138","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"**`ServiceMethodFn` 的返回值由提供方持有**，调用方读完即弃。"},"871":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-139","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                    | 谁比           | 不匹配的后果 |\n| --------------------- | ------------ | ------ |\n| `ABI_VERSION`（当前 `6`） | 编译期常量，两侧共同引用 | —      |","table":"table-4"},"872":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-140","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                       | 谁比                      | 不匹配的后果                      |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `HostApiVTable::version` | 插件侧 `HostApi::from_raw` | `AbiError::VersionMismatch` |","table":"table-4"},"873":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-141","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                    | 谁比  | 不匹配的后果                     |\n| --------------------- | --- | -------------------------- |\n| `HostApiVTable::size` | 同上  | `AbiError::VTableTooSmall` |","table":"table-4"},"874":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-142","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置             | 谁比  | 不匹配的后果                               |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 某个函数指针是 `NULL` | 同上  | `AbiError::MissingFunction(\"<字段名>\")` |","table":"table-4"},"875":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-143","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                          | 谁比                 | 不匹配的后果                 |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------ | ---------------------- |\n| `PluginHandle::abi_version` | 宿主侧 `PluginLoader` | `AbiMismatch`：**拒绝加载** |","table":"table-4"},"876":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-144","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"版本不兼容时宿主**不能**调 `plugin_stop`——那是对一个不认识的 ABI 下手。v4 起插件可以\n导出 `plugin_free_handle`，让宿主在版本不匹配时释放 `plugin_init` 分配的状态；老插件没有\n这个符号，那部分内存仍然回收不了。字段只增不改，新增一律追加在尾部。"},"877":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-145","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"**版本 2 的改动**：尾部追加了 `td_execute`（同步执行，见上表第 13 项）。"},"878":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-146","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"**版本 3 的改动**：尾部追加了 `get_config` / `set_config`（第 18 / 19 项），让插件能读全局配置、\n写自己的段。"},"879":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-147","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"**版本 4 的改动**："},"880":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-148","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"`register_tool` 增加 `handler` / `user_data`，工具终于能真的执行；"},"881":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-149","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"尾部追加 `call_tool_result`（同步拿工具结果）与 `list_plugins`（插件报告）；"},"882":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-150","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"尾部追加 `provide_service_shared`（第 20 项）：服务默认按插件作用域隔离，要共享得显式走它；"},"883":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-151","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"新增静态导出 `plugin_free_handle` / `fuyubot_abi_version` / `plugin_manifest`。"},"884":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-152","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"**版本 5 的改动**：尾部追加 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result`（第 21 / 22 项），\n把 `fuyubot-simplify` 的语义下沉到宿主——**所有语言**的插件都能用「发消息等结局 / 超时撤回 /\nbot 与用户号挑不同反应方法 / Markdown → entities / 富消息本地块树」，不再只有 Rust 有。\n详见「simplify 操作表」。"},"885":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-153","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"**v5 的尾部追加**：`current_plugin`（第 23 项）。服务方法终于能问出「现在是谁在调我」，\n拿到宿主判定的**权威**插件名——命令归属不再需要入参自报。当时是**纯追加、不改语义**，\n靠 `size` 协商，所以没跳版本号。"},"886":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-154","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"**版本 6 的改动**：尾部追加 `call_service`（第 24 项），**服务调用改成经过宿主**。\n宿主因此在调用期间知道调用方是谁，`current_plugin` 拿到的就是它——于是\n「插件在自己起的线程上调服务」也认得出调用方，嵌套调用报的是直接调用者而不是最初的调用方。\n同时 `call_service` 的返回值约定收紧：`NULL` = 失败，**空串** = 成功但无输出。"},"887":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-155","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"同一次 v6 里还追加了三项（25 / 26 / 27）：`last_error`（失败原因）、`list_services`\n（服务发现）、`set_config_section`（跨插件写配置）。这三项是**纯尾部追加**，靠 `size`\n协商、不再跳版本号——老宿主（没有这三项）会明确拒绝新插件，而不是读到错位的指针。"},"888":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-156","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"另外 `set_config` 的判定对象从「调用者」改成了「执行者」：服务方法里写配置现在落\n**提供方**自己的段（以前会错写进调用方那段），`get_config` 不受影响。"},"889":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-157","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"> ⚠️ 这次**跳了版本号**（`5` → `6`）：字段是纯追加，但 `current_plugin` 的**取值来源变了**，\n> 属于静默的行为差异，不能只靠 `size` 协商。v5 插件在 v6 宿主上、v6 插件在 v5 宿主上\n> 都会 `AbiMismatch`（拒绝加载），**重编一次即可**（仓库里所有插件与模板都从 `ABI_VERSION` 取值）。\n> 完整清单见 ABI v5 → v6 迁移。"},"890":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-158","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"追加字段本身不破坏老插件（它们先比 `size`），但按契约「改 ABI 就加版本号」，\nv4 / v5 / v6 各跳过一次——**用旧版本编出来的插件会被宿主拒绝加载**，重新编一次即可。"},"891":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-159","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#simplify-操作表","content":"`simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 收的是一张**操作表**而不是「一个方法一个函数指针」："},"892":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-160","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#simplify-操作表","content":"**为什么不是每个操作一个函数指针**：那样以后每加一个方法都要升一次 ABI 版本、三个仓库一起动。\n一张表之后，**加操作不动 ABI**。"},"893":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-161","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#结果怎么回来","content":"`simplify_invoke` 返回 `RequestId`，结果走**既有的** `\"response\"` 通道回到发起插件——\nJS/TS 的 `invokeAsync`、Python 的 `invoke_async`、Go 的 channel、Rust 的 `ResponseRouter`\n全都原样接住，没有新的回投机制。负载长这样（成功失败同形状，只看 `ok`）："},"894":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-162","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#结果怎么回来","content":"`error.code` 是稳定的英文代号，可以拿它分支：`timeout` / `send_failed` / `tdlib` /\n`missing_field` / `bad_args` / `unknown_op` / `async_op` / `host` / `missing_op`\n（`op` JSON 缺字符串字段 `op`）/ `simplify`（`SimplifyError` 里没单独归类的兜底）。"},"895":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-163","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#入参的形状","content":"`args` 基本就是对应 TDLib 方法的参数（键名以 `td_api.tl` 为准），**认不出的键原样透传**\n（宿主照 schema 只警告不拦，TDLib 升版加了新参数也不用等 ABI）。外加两个统一项："},"896":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-164","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#入参的形状","content":"`timeout_ms`（默认 30 000）：整次操作共用的等待预算；"},"897":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-165","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#入参的形状","content":"文本字段（`text` / `caption`）可以是字符串（按纯文本），也可以是\n`{\"text\":\"…\",\"parse_mode\":\"markdown|markdown_v2|html\"}`——宿主替你走 `parseTextEntities`\n换成 `formattedText`。已经是 `formattedText` 就原样放过。"},"898":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-166","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"同步（不碰网络，`simplify_invoke_result` 也能跑，回调里安全）："},"899":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-167","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                    | args                  | 返回              |\n| --------------------- | --------------------- | --------------- |\n| `parse_text_entities` | `text` / `parse_mode` | `formattedText` |","table":"table-5"},"900":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-168","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                   | args                                              | 返回                                                                     |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `rich_from_markdown` | `markdown` / `is_rtl` / `detect_automatic_blocks` | `inputMessageRichText`（可直接塞进 `send_message` 的 `input_message_content`） |","table":"table-5"},"901":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-169","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op         | args | 返回                         |\n| ---------- | ---- | -------------------------- |\n| `list_ops` | —    | `{\"sync\":[…],\"async\":[…]}` |","table":"table-5"},"902":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-170","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"异步（要等 TDLib 应答，只能走 `simplify_invoke`）："},"903":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-171","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op             | 语义                                                       |\n| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `send_message` | 发 → 等响应拿临时消息 → 等**发送结局**；超时先 `deleteMessages(revoke)` 撤回 |","table":"table-6"},"904":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-172","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                   | 语义                    |\n| -------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `send_message_album` | 整组一个预算，逐项等结局，任一项失败即返回 |","table":"table-6"},"905":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-173","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                                                                                                | 语义                                                        |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `edit_message_text` / `edit_message_caption` / `edit_message_media` / `edit_message_reply_markup` | 等响应（`edit_message_reply_markup` 不给 `reply_markup` = 移除键盘） |","table":"table-6"},"906":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-174","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                | 语义                                   |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `delete_messages` | `chat_id` / `message_ids` / `revoke` |","table":"table-6"},"907":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-175","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                      | 语义                  |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `answer_callback_query` | 点了内联按钮必须回，否则客户端一直转圈 |","table":"table-6"},"908":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-176","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                 | 语义                               |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------------- |\n| `forward_messages` | `message_ids` 排序去重、最多 100 条；只等响应 |","table":"table-6"},"909":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-177","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                  | 语义                                                                      |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `react` / `unreact` | **自动挑方法**：bot 只能 `setMessageReactions`，用户号用 `add/removeMessageReaction` |","table":"table-6"},"910":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-178","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                               | 语义                   |\n| -------------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `add_reaction` / `set_reactions` | 显式走某一条路（省一次 `getMe`） |","table":"table-6"},"911":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-179","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                        | 语义  |\n| ------------------------- | --- |\n| `me` / `my_id` / `is_bot` | 身份  |","table":"table-6"},"912":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-180","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                                                  | 语义                                                                    |\n| --------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `chat_member` / `is_chat_admin` / `am_i_chat_admin` | 管理权（`right` 是 `chatAdministratorRights` 的字段名，如 `can_delete_messages`） |","table":"table-6"},"913":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-181","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op              | 语义                                 |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `download_file` | 等到 `updateFile` 报下载完成，返回最终的 `file` |","table":"table-6"},"914":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-182","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op       | 语义                                                |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `invoke` | 逃生舱：`args.request` 是**完整**的 TDLib 请求 JSON，发 + 等响应 |","table":"table-6"},"915":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-183","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"操作表可以问出来：`{\"op\":\"list_ops\"}`。"},"916":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-184","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"Rust 的 `extern \"C\" fn(.., ...)` 确实稳定（能写、cbindgen 也能生成），但**本 ABI 一个都没用**，\n理由只有一条：`...` 会把**参数类型和个数校验全部丢掉**。VTable 里 27 个函数的参数都是固定的，\n用 `...` 只会让 C 侧传错参数从编译错误降级成运行期 UB。"},"917":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-185","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"将来真要加，正确的声明形状是（C 侧）："},"918":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-186","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"两条必须知道的事："},"919":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-187","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"变参部分**不能**是唯一的参数——C 要求 `...` 之前至少有一个具名参数。"},"920":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-188","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"**变参函数指针跨不了 ABI 的 `Option` 优化**：`Option<fn(..., ...)>` 不是 niche 优化，占**两个指针宽**，\n必须显式判空。本 crate 里那条\n`size_of::<Option<unsafe extern \"C\" fn()>>() == size_of::<*const c_void>()` 断言只对**非变参**函数指针\n成立；普通函数指针字段能享受 niche 优化（`NULL` 就是 `None`），这也是「整个 VTable 所有字段都能是\n`Option<...>` 且不撑大布局」的前提之一。"},"921":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-189","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言  | 声明在哪                                              | 值   | 怎么生效                                                                      |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| C   | 头文件 `fuyubot_plugin.h` 里的 `#define ABI_VERSION 6` | 6   | 模板里写 `if (host == NULL \\|\\| host->version != ABI_VERSION) return failed;` |","table":"table-7"},"922":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-190","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言  | 声明在哪                   | 值   | 怎么生效                   |\n| --- | ---------------------- | --- | ---------------------- |\n| C++ | 同一份 `fuyubot_plugin.h` | 6   | 同上（导出符号放 `extern \"C\"`） |","table":"table-7"},"923":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-191","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言   | 声明在哪                       | 值   | 怎么生效                                                                          |\n| ---- | -------------------------- | --- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Rust | `fuyubot_abi::ABI_VERSION` | 6   | `define_plugin!` 把它填进 `PluginHandle::abi_version`，并导出一份 `fuyubot_abi_version` |","table":"table-7"},"924":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-192","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言     | 声明在哪          | 值   | 怎么生效                                                                                             |\n| ------ | ------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Python | **脚本不接触 ABI** | —   | 由 `fuyubot.script` 承载（标准 ABI 的 cdylib，v6，尾部带 `current_plugin` + `call_service`），`abi_version` 它填 |","table":"table-7"},"925":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-193","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言      | 声明在哪          | 值   | 怎么生效                       |\n| ------- | ------------- | --- | -------------------------- |\n| JS / TS | **脚本不接触 ABI** | —   | 同上，同一个 `fuyubot.script` 插件 |","table":"table-7"},"926":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-194","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"脚本插件走的是薄 SDK（PyPI / npm 的 `fuyubot`）→ 原生桥 → `fuyubot.script` 这条路，\n**作者永远不碰 C ABI**；ABI 版本由承载它的那份 cdylib 声明。那是一个**独立仓库的插件**，\n不属于运行时本体，见脚本插件。"},"927":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-195","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"`EventCallbackFn` 与 `MiddlewareCallbackFn` 都是 `unsafe extern \"C-unwind\" fn(...)`。\n`extern \"C\"` 边界上逃出去的 panic 会直接 **abort 整个进程**，宿主来不及 `catch_unwind`；\n`C-unwind` 允许 unwind 穿过边界，宿主就能接住、记一条日志、继续跑下一条更新。\n对 C/C++ 而言两者 ABI 完全一致；C++ 异常同样会穿过这个边界，**请自己在回调内处理完**。"},"928":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-196","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"`define_plugin!` 生成的三个导出函数还会把插件代码包在 `catch_unwind` 里——两层都要。"},"929":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-197","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"版本不兼容时宿主**不会**调 `plugin_stop`：那是对一个不认识的 ABI 下手。字段只增不改，\n新增一律追加在尾部；改动必须同时抬 `ABI_VERSION`。"},"930":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-198","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"宿主 ABI 版本是 `fuyubot_abi::ABI_VERSION`（当前 **6**）；插件编译时用它做校验，不用手抄。"},"931":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"page","content":"异步等待（await）","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async"},"932":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async","content":"Rust 插件里可 await 的请求与更新等待"},"933":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"Rust：`ResponseRouter`"},"934":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#哪些语言有-await","content":"哪些语言有 await"},"935":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#工具结果","content":"工具结果"},"936":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async","content":"`wait_for_update` 是**阻塞**原语：调用线程停下来等。要 `async/await` 那种语义，\n用下面这层**不阻塞**的封装——任务挂起，事件到了再唤醒。"},"937":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async","content":"本页只讲原生插件。脚本插件（Python / JS / TS）的 `invoke_async` / `wait_async` /\n`runAsync` 在脚本插件板块。"},"938":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"`fuyubot-abi` 重导出 `ResponseRouter` / `ResponseFuture` / `UpdateFuture`："},"939":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"要点："},"940":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"**必须在插件自己的 executor 上 await**，别在宿主事件回调里 await（那是接收线程）。"},"941":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"`router.invoke*` 从插件自己的线程发请求时会用 scope service 把归属切回插件，\n响应不会丢；不需要手动 `scope_enter`。"},"942":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"**simplify op 必须走 `invoke_op`**：宿主侧 op 工作线程不压作用域栈，请求归属在\n`simplify_invoke` 被调用的那一刻就登记了。直接调 `host.simplify_invoke` 会把归属记成\n宿主（owner 0），`simplifyResult` 只投给全局订阅者，本插件永远等不到。"},"943":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"取消 = `drop(fut)`；关闭 = drop router（所有 pending 立刻 `RouterClosed`）。"},"944":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"超时不内建，用 `tokio::time::timeout` 或你运行时的等价物。"},"945":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#哪些语言有-await","content":"| 语言   | 怎么写                                  |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------ |\n| Rust | 本页的 `ResponseRouter`（要有自己的 executor） |","table":"table-0"},"946":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#哪些语言有-await","content":"| 语言           | 怎么写                                     |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------------- |\n| C / C++ / Go | 没有 await：`on` 回调 + 状态机，或者用语言自己的协程包装同步等待 |","table":"table-0"},"947":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#哪些语言有-await","content":"| 语言               | 怎么写                                   |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| Python / JS / TS | 不在这个板块——脚本侧见 Python / JS 与 TypeScript |","table":"table-0"},"948":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#工具结果","content":"工具调用没有「等响应」这一层：ABI v4 的 `call_tool_result` / `callTool` 是**同步**返回结果的。\n详见 工具与中间件。"},"949":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"page","content":"插件分发包","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle"},"950":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle","content":"目录结构、plugin.json 字段，以及安装到机器人里的方法"},"951":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"plugin.json"},"952":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"打包成 zip"},"953":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#安装","content":"安装"},"954":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#从商店安装","content":"从商店安装"},"955":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#本地目录安装","content":"本地目录安装"},"956":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#手动安装","content":"手动安装"},"957":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#排查","content":"排查"},"958":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#卸载","content":"卸载"},"959":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle","content":"一个原生插件就是一个目录：根上放 `plugin.json`，入口和依赖放在 `bin/`。\n脚本插件仍然是一个目录，放在 `plugins/scripts/` 下。"},"960":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle","content":"入口文件名不限，`plugin.json` 的 `entry` 指向哪个人就用哪个。Windows 是 `.dll`，\nLinux 是 `.so`，macOS 是 `.dylib`。"},"961":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle","content":"内置插件也遵循同一份布局：发布包里是 `plugins/fuyubot.start/`、`plugins/fuyubot.help/`、\n`plugins/fuyubot.manage/`，每份都有 `plugin.json` + `bin/`；`fuyubot init` / `run`\n会自动装进项目的插件目录。"},"962":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"最小可用的原生插件清单："},"963":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"| 字段       | 必填  | 说明     |\n| -------- | --- | ------ |\n| `schema` | 是   | 固定 `1` |","table":"table-0"},"964":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"| 字段   | 必填  | 说明                                        |\n| ---- | --- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `id` | 是   | 插件唯一标识，只能用字母、数字、`.`、`_`、`-`，最长 128；不能以点结尾 |","table":"table-0"},"965":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"| 字段     | 必填  | 说明  |\n| ------ | --- | --- |\n| `name` | 是   | 展示名 |","table":"table-0"},"966":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"| 字段        | 必填  | 说明               |\n| --------- | --- | ---------------- |\n| `version` | 是   | 语义化版本，和发布 tag 一致 |","table":"table-0"},"967":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"| 字段     | 必填  | 说明                         |\n| ------ | --- | -------------------------- |\n| `kind` | 是   | `native` / `python` / `js` |","table":"table-0"},"968":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"| 字段      | 必填  | 说明               |\n| ------- | --- | ---------------- |\n| `entry` | 是   | 相对包根的入口路径，必须真的存在 |","table":"table-0"},"969":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"| 字段    | 必填  | 说明                        |\n| ----- | --- | ------------------------- |\n| `abi` | 建议  | 编译时使用的宿主 ABI 版本；不写则加载后才知道 |","table":"table-0"},"970":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"| 字段          | 必填  | 说明                             |\n| ----------- | --- | ------------------------------ |\n| `platforms` | 否   | 为空或 `[\"any\"]` 表示全平台；否则必须包含当前平台 |","table":"table-0"},"971":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"| 字段        | 必填  | 说明                          |\n| --------- | --- | --------------------------- |\n| `depends` | 否   | 硬依赖的服务名，例如 `[\"demo.notes\"]` |","table":"table-0"},"972":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"| 字段                 | 必填  | 说明      |\n| ------------------ | --- | ------- |\n| `optional_depends` | 否   | 软依赖的服务名 |","table":"table-0"},"973":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"| 字段         | 必填  | 说明                 |\n| ---------- | --- | ------------------ |\n| `provides` | 否   | 本插件提供的服务名，供展示与依赖检查 |","table":"table-0"},"974":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"| 字段       | 必填  | 说明                                                                                               |\n| -------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `config` | 否   | 默认配置文件的**相对包根路径**（如 `config.default.toml`）。加载时并进 `[plugin.<id>]`，**优先级最低**：用户配置与插件运行时落盘已有的键不会被覆盖 |","table":"table-0"},"975":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"| 字段            | 必填  | 说明                 |\n| ------------- | --- | ------------------ |\n| `description` | 否   | 一句话说明，显示在插件列表 / 商店 |","table":"table-0"},"976":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"| 字段        | 必填  | 说明    |\n| --------- | --- | ----- |\n| `license` | 否   | 许可证标识 |","table":"table-0"},"977":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"| 字段         | 必填  | 说明   |\n| ---------- | --- | ---- |\n| `homepage` | 否   | 项目主页 |","table":"table-0"},"978":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"`id` 也决定配置段：`[plugin.com.example.weather]`。三层优先级（包默认 < 运行时落盘 <\n用户配置）与 `set_config` 的写规则见配置文件 · 插件自己的配置段。"},"979":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"默认配置文件的例子（它的顶层就是一段配置，不要写 `[plugin.x]` 头）："},"980":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"脚本插件的 `plugin.json` 可以只写身份，`entry` 指向脚本："},"981":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"发布时打一个 zip，**zip 根就是插件目录的内容**，不要套一层目录："},"982":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"打包要求："},"983":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"只放运行需要的东西：不要带 `node_modules/`、`.venv/`、`target/`、`.git/`；"},"984":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"不要放符号链接；"},"985":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"单个 zip 不超过 50MB，解压后不超过 200MB，文件数不超过 2000；"},"986":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"文件名不要以点或空格结尾，不要用 `CON`、`NUL`、`COM1` 这类 Windows 保留名\n（大小写也算冲突）；"},"987":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"资产名建议 `<id>-<version>-<平台>.zip`，例如\n`com.example.weather-1.2.0-windows-x86_64.zip`；纯脚本包用 `-any.zip`。\nAndroid 用 `android-aarch64` / `android-x86_64`，入口是 `.so`（例如\n`bin/libweather.so`），不能拿 Linux 的包代替。"},"988":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"商城按资产名和 `plugin.json` 校验，不符合上面的规则会被拒绝收录。"},"989":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#从商店安装","content":"新建项目默认已配置官方商店（`fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugins].registry_url`）。\n换商店改那一行，删掉则关闭商店。"},"990":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#从商店安装","content":"运行 `fuyubot run --tui`，进「商店」页搜索、选中、安装，然后重启实例。"},"991":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#本地目录安装","content":"原生包装进 `plugins/<id>/`，脚本包装进 `plugins/scripts/<目录名>/`。\n也可以用 `fuyubot plugin install` 装单个 `.dll`（旧形态），但推荐目录包。"},"992":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#手动安装","content":"把 zip 解压到 `plugins/<id>/`，或者把目录直接拷进去，然后重启："},"993":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#排查","content":"| 现象                | 原因 / 处理                                       |\n| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin list` 看不到 | 目录不在 `plugins/` 下，或 `plugin.json` 读不了；确认路径与权限 |","table":"table-1"},"994":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#排查","content":"| 现象             | 原因 / 处理                                       |\n| -------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| 提示 `id` 与目录不一致 | 目录名和 `plugin.json` 的 `id` 不同会以 `id` 为准；改名保持一致 |","table":"table-1"},"995":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#排查","content":"| 现象      | 原因 / 处理              |\n| ------- | -------------------- |\n| 提示平台不匹配 | 压缩包不是给当前系统的；换对应平台的资产 |","table":"table-1"},"996":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#排查","content":"| 现象      | 原因 / 处理                       |\n| ------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 提示入口不存在 | `entry` 写错，或打包时漏了 `bin/` 里的文件 |","table":"table-1"},"997":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#排查","content":"| 现象           | 原因 / 处理                                       |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------------------- |\n| 启动时报 ABI 不匹配 | 插件编译时的 ABI 与宿主不一致；用与宿主同版本的 `fuyubot-abi` 重新编译 |","table":"table-1"},"998":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#排查","content":"| 现象       | 原因 / 处理                                      |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| 加载后名字对不上 | `plugin_init` 返回的名字必须等于 `plugin.json` 的 `id` |","table":"table-1"},"999":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#卸载","content":"只删插件目录，`[plugin.<id>]` 配置和 `data/plugins/<id>/` 不会被删。"},"1