台 / zip\n安全规则，合并后自动重建索引。"},"1953":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#收录到官方商城","content":"一个条目的写法："},"1954":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#收录到官方商城","content":"`assets` 里写文件名，CI 会拼出 `https://github.com/<repo>/releases/download/<tag>/<文件名>`\n并计算 `sha256`。"},"1955":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#安全与限制","content":"索引地址与资产 URL 只接受 HTTPS（http、`file://` 拒绝）；明细分片允许相对路径，但不许 `..`；"},"1956":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#安全与限制","content":"下载后强制校验 sha256，失败即停止，不会落盘；"},"1957":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#安全与限制","content":"解压时拒绝 `..`、绝对路径、符号链接、大小写冲突、Windows 保留名；"},"1958":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#安全与限制","content":"单包上限 50MB，解压后 200MB，最多 2000 个文件；"},"1959":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#安全与限制","content":"安装先落到 `plugins/.staging/<id>/`，校验通过后才改名到 `plugins/<id>/`\n或 `plugins/scripts/<id>/`；目标已存在时拒绝覆盖。"},"1960":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"page","content":"调用 TDLib","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib"},"1961":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"td_invoke、请求号与 response 通道、便捷封装"},"1962":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"请求号与 response 通道"},"1963":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","conten