docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"真的发出去"},"1984":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"请求号"},"1985":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"响应回来"},"1986":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"回程"},"1987":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"接收循环 route()"},"1988":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"按 @extra 认出归属"},"1989":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"emit_scoped"},"1990":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"response 通道"},"1991":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"发起的插件"},"1992":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"过滤器 request_id = N"},"1993":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"同一条 @extra 把去程和回程对上；没接 TDLib 时只发合成请求号，永远等不到响应"},"1994":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"响应负载是 TDLib 原始 JSON，宿主额外挂一个**数值型** `request_id`（来自它注入的字符串 `@extra`，\n别自己设这个字段）。"},"1995":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"要等某条响应：过滤器写 `{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":5}`。`event_type` 键只选通道，\n不参与负载匹配（见 订阅与事件）。"},"1996":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"**没接 TDLib 时**（`--replay` / `--no-tdlib`）请求只留档并返回**合成请求号**（从 `1 << 48` 起），\n链路照样能测通，但永远不会真的到达 TDLib。"},"1997":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"`wait_for_update` **阻塞当前线程**，`timeout_ms == 0` 表示只检查当前状态；\n返回的 `payload_json` 是宿主线程局部缓冲，只在下一次宿主调用前有效——要留就当场拷走。"},"1998":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"⚠️ **TDLib 的方法名 ≠ Telegram Bot API 的方法名**。TDLib 里所有发送都是 `sendMessage`，\n内容类型靠 `input_message_content` 区分；`sendPhoto` / `sendDocument` / `sendLocation`\n（HTTP Bot API）**在 TDLib 里不存在**。"},"1999":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的                               | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                                                                          |\n| --------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `sendPhoto` / `sendDocument` / `sendLocation` | `sendMessage` + `input_message_content.@type` = `inputMessagePhoto` / `inputMessageDocument` / `inputMessageLocation` |","table":"table-1"},"2000":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的     | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                                                                                                                                        |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `message_thread_id` | `topic_id`，类型是 `MessageTopic`——**论坛**群组用 `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicForum\",\"forum_topic_id\":N}`，**非论坛**群组的评论串才是 `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicThread\",\"message_thread_id\":N}`（用 `Topic` 就不会选错） |","table":"table-1"},"2001":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的       | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                        |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `reply_to_message_id` | `reply_to`（`{\"@type\":\"inputMessageReplyToMessage\",\"message_id\":N}`） |","table":"table-1"},"2002":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的                               | 在 TDLib 里这么写                            |\n| --------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 顶层 `disable_notification` / `protect_content` | `options`（`@type: messageSendOptions`）里 |","table":"table-1"},"2003":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的 | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                       |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| 顶层 `caption`    | 在内容类型里（`inputMessageText` / `inputMessagePhoto` …） |","table":"table-1"},"2004":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的 | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                             |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `parse_mode`    | 没有这个字段；`formattedText` 只有 `text` + `entities`（要标记先走 `parseTextEntities`） |","table":"table-1"},"2005":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的         | 在 TDLib 里这么写         |\n| ----------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `file_id`（`updateFile`） | 在 **`file.id`**，不是顶层 |","table":"table-1"},"2006":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"`sendMessage` 的真签名（来自 `td_api.tl`）："},"2007":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"方法名与字段名以 `td_api.tl` 为准：在运行时仓库里搜 `sendMessage`，或者看\n`td_api.tl`。"},"2008":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#便捷封装fuyubot-simplify","content":"`Simplify` 只简化**输入**，不改变输出：每个方法都经 `td_invoke*` 发出，原始更新照旧对插件可见。\n参数形状是**一个方法一个结构体 + 短字段名**，调用方不用拼 TDLib 的嵌套 JSON；\n文本格式（Markdown / HTML）**不自己解析**，经同步的 `td_execute` 问 TDLib 的 `parseTextEntities`。"},"2009":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#便捷封装fuyubot-simplify","content":"它的**完整 API 参考（按功能范围分组）在 Simplify 封装**；\n想知道为什么这么拼、为什么这么等，看开发 › simplify 封装是怎么实现的。\n本页只留跟「请求号 + 线程」有关的那两件事——它们是这层最容易被搞错的部分。"},"2010":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"**每个方法都等到结果才返回**，不交回请求号。分两类："},"2011":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"| 类别                                               | 等到什么                                                                                                    | 返回值                                   |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 发送类（`send_message` / `send_message_album` / 富消息） | 响应（**还没发出去**的临时消息）+ 它的**发送结局**：`updateMessageSendSucceeded`（里面有最终 `Message`）或 `updateMessageSendFailed` | 最终 `Message`（相册是与 `medias` 同序的 `Vec`） |","table":"table-2"},"2012":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"| 类别                                                        | 等到什么     | 返回值                  |\n| --------------------------------------------------------- | -------- | -------------------- |\n| 其余（`edit_*` / `delete_message` / `answer_callback_query`） | 只有**响应** | 改完的 `Message` / `()` |","table":"table-2"},"2013":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"两步之间按临时消息的 `old_message_id` 精确对号，同一会话里别人的结局不会串进来；"},"2014":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"相册的 `timeout_ms` 是**整组共用**的一个预算（先等 `Messages` 响应、再等 N 条结局），不是每项各等一次；"},"2015":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"**超时先撤回**：到期还没结局，就先 `deleteMessages(revoke = true)` 把那条没发出去的消息撤掉，再返回\n`Timeout`——发出去的撤不回，没发出去的会被取消；"},"2016":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"`@type == \"error\"` 的响应一律变成 `SimplifyError::Tdlib`（例如 `Message is not modified`），\n**封装层不重试**：限流该等多久是调用方的事。"},"2017":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#回调里用-_then","content":"等更新要靠**接收循环**那个线程送回来，而插件的更新回调就跑在它上面——在那里等待=自己卡自己，\n等到的一定是超时。每个等待版都有一个 `*_then`：把等待挪到另一个线程，结局交给闭包。"},"2018":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#回调里用-_then","content":"它们返回那个线程的 `JoinHandle`——**插件要在 `stop()` 里 join 掉**，否则动态库卸载之后线程还在跑库里的代码\n（未定义行为）。三个内置插件就是这么写的，可以照抄。"},"2019":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#最小上手","content":"方法名与参数名由 `every_request_simplify_builds_passes_the_real_schema` 拿真 `td_api.tl` 烤出来的元数据\n（`TdApiSchema::compiled()`）逐条校验，离线就能跑。"},"2020":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"便捷方法把等待收进去了：发送类等**响应 + 发送结局**，其余等**响应**\n（`\"response\"` 通道，事件类型 `RESPONSE_EVENT`，只发给发起请求的那个插件）。\n想自己接原始 JSON，底层出口 `wait_response` / `wait_for_update` 仍然公开。"},"2021":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"`WaitHandle::payload_json` / `td_execute` 的返回串都是宿主临时的**线程局部缓冲**，\n只在下一次宿主调用之前有效。要拿数据就立刻读，或者用 `*_json` / `wait_response`（它们已经替你拷好了）。"},"2022":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"`HostRuntime::td_send` 在**没接 TDLib** 时只留档 + 发合成请求号（从 `1 << 48` 起），`td_execute` 在同样\n情况下返回 `None`——所以本文的每个方法在离线状态下都能被跑通、但不会真的到达 TDLib（Markdown 会退回纯文本）。"},"2023":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#python--js","content":"脚本里的 `invoke` 有第三个参数 `onResponse`（Python 是 `on_response`），响应按请求号\n自动配对，脚本不用自己记。细节在脚本板块：Python /\nJS 与 TypeScript。"},"2024":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"page","content":"调试与安装","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing"},"2025":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"回放验证、静态检查、装进插件目录"},"2026":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"静态检查导出符号"},"2027":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"回放：不接账号也能验插件"},"2028":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#安装","content":"安装"},"2029":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"装完还是不响？"},"2030":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"插件出问题通常不是「代码写得不对」，而是「没被加载」「加载了但没订阅上」「订阅了但请求拼错」。\n这三步各有对应的工具，全都不需要 Telegram 账号。"},"2031":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 做什么   | 用什么                                               | 需要账号吗 |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------- | ----- |\n| 看导出符号 | `dumpbin /exports`（Windows）/ `nm -D`（Linux/macOS） | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"2032":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 做什么     | 用什么                         | 需要账号吗 |\n| ------- | --------------------------- | ----- |\n| 跑一遍更新管线 | `fuyubot run --replay <文件>` | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"2033":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 做什么    | 用什么                           | 需要账号吗 |\n| ------ | ----------------------------- | ----- |\n| 装进插件目录 | `fuyubot plugin install <路径>` | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"2034":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 做什么     | 用什么                              | 需要账号吗 |\n| ------- | -------------------------------- | ----- |\n| 看装了哪些插件 | `fuyubot plugin list`（静态读清单，不加载） | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"2035":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 做什么     | 用什么           | 需要账号吗 |\n| ------- | ------------- | ----- |\n| 真登录、真更新 | `fuyubot run` | 是     |","table":"table-0"},"2036":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"宿主只认七个符号，缺 `plugin_init` 一定加载失败。**不要用 `dlopen` 去验**——那会在你的进程里\n跑插件的初始化代码，已经算加载了。直接读导出表："},"2037":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"应该看到 `plugin_init` / `plugin_start` / `plugin_stop` / `plugin_free_string`，\n以及可选的 `plugin_manifest` / `fuyubot_abi_version` / `plugin_free_handle`。\n看不到 `plugin_init` = 宿主一定拒绝，先查 `crate-type = [\"cdylib\"]` 和 `extern \"C\"`。"},"2038":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"三个版本别混："},"2039":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"**宿主 ABI 世代** = `HostApiVTable::version`（当前 6），就在 VTable 首字段；"},"2040":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"**插件声明的 ABI 版本** 在 `PluginHandle::abi_version`，是 `plugin_init` 的返回值——\n静态检查看不到，**装载时才判定**；"},"2041":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"**插件自己的 crate 版本** 在 `plugin_manifest` 的 `version` 字段里。"},"2042":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"回放把文件里的更新（单个对象或对象数组）灌进六阶段管线后退出：**不接 TDLib、不用账号**，\n插件发出的请求只留档不发。输出三样东西："},"2043":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"每条更新的 `UpdateOutcome`："},"2044":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"插件打的日志（`HostRuntime::log_lines`，上限 256 行）；"},"2045":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"插件发出去的请求：`#请求号 方法名 参数`。"},"2046":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"| 参数              | 说明             |\n| --------------- | -------------- |\n| `--replay <文件>` | 要回放的更新；对象或对象数组 |","table":"table-1"},"2047":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"| 参数                  | 说明                                         |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `--plugin-dir <目录>` | 覆盖插件目录（默认取 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `plugins.dir`） |","table":"table-1"},"2048":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"| 参数                   | 说明                                           |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `--replay-wait <MS>` | 回放后的静默窗口；不填时脚本插件 2000ms、纯原生插件 150ms（上限 60 秒） |","table":"table-1"},"2049":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"脚本插件在**另一个进程**里跑，反应要经管道回来，还可能捎带网络请求——窗口太短会把最终答复漏掉。"},"2050":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"回放**故意不接 TDLib**：它要在任何机器上离线可跑，接了就要账号与网络。\n所以回放能证明「插件收到更新后做出了正确判断、发出了正确请求」，**不能**证明真 Telegram 认这些参数。"},"2051":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#安装","content":"脚本插件走另一条路（目录形，装进 `plugins/scripts/<目录名>/`），见脚本插件。"},"2052":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#安装","content":"`plugin install <工程目录>` 找产物的顺序是 `<工程>/target/{release,debug}` → 工程目录本身 →\n**沿父链最近的** `target/{release,debug}`（两边都有时取**较新**的那个）。最后一档专为 workspace\n成员准备：`cargo build -p <crate>` 的产物默认落在仓库根 `target/`，工程自己那份 `target/` 并不存在，\n靠父链一样能找到——**没有 `--target-dir` 这个参数**，找不着就直接指着产物装。"},"2053":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状                   | 先看                                                              |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 导出表里没有 `plugin_init` | crate 是不是 `crate-type = [\"cdylib\"]`；C++ 的七个符号在不在 `extern \"C\"` 里 |","table":"table-2"},"2054":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状           | 先看                                                      |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 日志里有「跳过 xxx」 | ABI 版本不匹配，或 `dlopen` 失败（缺兄弟 DLL：把依赖放在插件旁边，加载器会先查库自己的目录） |","table":"table-2"},"2055":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状           | 先看                                                        |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 加载了但一条事件都没收到 | 订阅是不是没注册成功（`HostApi::on` 返回的句柄 `is_valid()` 为假），或事件名写成了别名 |","table":"table-2"},"2056":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状      | 先看                                                        |\n| ------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 脚本插件起不来 | 不在本板块——见脚本插件 › 排查（manifest 身份段、`run()`、`uv` / `bun`、原生桥库） |","table":"table-2"},"2057":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状           | 先看                                                    |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| 请求发出去了但没收到响应 | 回放里本来就不会有响应（请求只留档）；真环境下等的是 `\"response\"` 通道，见 调用 TDLib |","table":"table-2"},"2058":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"TDLib 的方法名与参数名以 `td_api.tl` 为准（见调用 TDLib）；\n契约与所有权规则见 ABI 契约。"},"2059":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"page","content":"工具与中间件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools"},"2060":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools","content":"注册工具（元数据 + 处理器）、call_tool / call_tool_result、六阶段洋葱管线"},"2061":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"注册工具：元数据 + 处理器"},"2062":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"调用工具：请求号或同步结果"},"2063":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"中间件：六阶段洋葱"},"2064":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools","content":"工具（tool）是「有名字、有 schema、可被别的插件或宿主调用」的能力；中间件（middleware）\n是流经更新管线时的洋葱式拦截点。两者的注册都记在**当前插件的作用域**下：\n插件卸载（或加载失败）时宿主一次性回滚这批注册。"},"2065":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"ABI v4 的 `register_tool` 收三个东西：JSON 描述、可选的处理器、处理器要用的 `user_data`。\n处理器是 `C-unwind` 的 `fn(user_data, input_json) -> *const c_char`，返回 JSON 字符串。"},"2066":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"只登记元数据（不提供执行能力）用 `register_tool_meta(descriptor)`，等价于\n`register_tool(descriptor, None, null)`。`handle` 无效（`id == 0`）表示登记被拒\n（重名、schema 不合法等）。"},"2067":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段     | 类型     | 说明                |\n| ------ | ------ | ----------------- |\n| `name` | string | 全局唯一，建议 `插件名.工具名` |","table":"table-0"},"2068":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段        | 类型     | 说明                |\n| --------- | ------ | ----------------- |\n| `version` | string | semver，默认 `0.1.0` |","table":"table-0"},"2069":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段            | 类型     | 说明      |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------- |\n| `description` | string | 给人看的一句话 |","table":"table-0"},"2070":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段             | 类型          | 说明   |\n| -------------- | ----------- | ---- |\n| `input_schema` | JSON Schema | 描述入参 |","table":"table-0"},"2071":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段              | 类型          | 说明                  |\n| --------------- | ----------- | ------------------- |\n| `output_schema` | JSON Schema | `null` / `{}` 表示不校验 |","table":"table-0"},"2072":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段                     | 类型       | 说明        |\n| ---------------------- | -------- | --------- |\n| `required_permissions` | string[] | 调用前要过的权限门 |","table":"table-0"},"2073":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段           | 类型   | 说明         |\n| ------------ | ---- | ---------- |\n| `idempotent` | bool | 默认 `false` |","table":"table-0"},"2074":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段           | 类型     | 说明         |\n| ------------ | ------ | ---------- |\n| `timeout_ms` | number | 默认 `30000` |","table":"table-0"},"2075":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段         | 类型   | 说明         |\n| ---------- | ---- | ---------- |\n| `is_async` | bool | 默认 `false` |","table":"table-0"},"2076":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段         | 类型   | 说明                     |\n| ---------- | ---- | ---------------------- |\n| `callable` | bool | **读出时才有**：本进程里有没有可调处理器 |","table":"table-0"},"2077":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"两条入口，按需选："},"2078":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"| 入口                            | 返回          | 用途                |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------- | ----------------- |\n| `call_tool(name, input_json)` | `RequestId` | 只需要“发出去”，或将来接异步工具 |","table":"table-1"},"2079":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"| 入口                                   | 返回          | 用途                              |\n| ------------------------------------ | ----------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `call_tool_result(name, input_json)` | 结果 JSON 字符串 | **同步**拿结果（失败是 `{\"error\": \"…\"}`） |","table":"table-1"},"2080":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"`call_tool_result` 的顺序是："},"2081":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"call_tool_result 的五步链路"},"2082":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"同步调用工具时，宿主依次做：按名字查表、过权限门、校验入参 schema、跑处理器、校验出参 schema；任一步失败就返回 error 对象。"},"2083":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"同步链路：任一步不过就到此为止"},"2084":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"查表"},"2085":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"名字 → 注册项"},"2086":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"权限门"},"2087":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"required_…"},"2088":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"入参校验"},"2089":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"input_schema"},"2090":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"处理器"},"2091":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"C-unwind 回调"},"2092":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"出参校验"},"2093":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"output_schema"},"2094":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"结果 JSON（线程局部缓冲，读完即弃）"},"2095":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"任一步不过 → {'{\"error\": …}'}"},"2096":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"`call_tool`（返回请求号那条）走的是同一张表，只是不等结果——想要结果就用 `call_tool_result`。"},"2097":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"`list_tools()` 返回全部工具的元数据 JSON 数组。**宿主线程局部缓冲**：读完即弃，\n要留就当场拷走，**不要试图释放它**。"},"2098":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"脚本侧：薄 SDK 只能 `register_tool` / `registerTool` **登记元数据**，没有处理器指针——\n脚本进程不能把函数指针交回宿主，所以工具调用不会回到脚本。调用别的插件的工具、读配置、\n调服务这些也还没在薄 SDK 里暴露，见脚本插件。"},"2099":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"一个中间件自己看到的是**进入段 / 退出段**两截，中间那句 `next.run(ctx)` 就是分界："},"2100":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"中间件的洋葱：进入段、next.run、退出段"},"2101":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"一次 run 会先复制层列表再执行；next.run 之前是进入段，之后是退出段，外层先进后出。不调 next.run 就不往下走。"},"2102":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"run(stage, ctx)：层列表先复制一份再跑，所以中间件里再挂中间件不会自锁"},"2103":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"进入段"},"2104":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"next.run 之前的代码"},"2105":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"next.run(ctx)"},"2106":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"交给下一层"},"2107":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"退出段"},"2108":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"next.run 之后的代码"},"2109":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"外层先进后出；回调返回非 0 就中断这一阶段；不调 next.run 就是不往下走"},"2110":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段          | 数值  | 谁跑它       |\n| ----------- | --- | --------- |\n| `PreUpdate` | 0   | 收到更新、还没解析 |","table":"table-2"},"2111":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段         | 数值  | 谁跑它             |\n| ---------- | --- | --------------- |\n| `PreRoute` | 1   | 已解析 `@type`，路由前 |","table":"table-2"},"2112":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段         | 数值  | 谁跑它                   |\n| ---------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `InPlugin` | 2   | 分发给监听器之前；**一条更新只跑一遍** |","table":"table-2"},"2113":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段             | 数值  | 谁跑它    |\n| -------------- | --- | ------ |\n| `PostResponse` | 3   | 响应发出之后 |","table":"table-2"},"2114":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段            | 数值  | 谁跑它                   |\n| ------------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `PreToolCall` | 4   | 工具调用之前（**目前没有生产调用方**） |","table":"table-2"},"2115":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段             | 数值  | 谁跑它        |\n| -------------- | --- | ---------- |\n| `PostToolCall` | 5   | 工具调用之后（同上） |","table":"table-2"},"2116":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"数值就是 ABI 里的 `stage` 参数，与 `fuyubot-middleware::Stage` 一一对应。"},"2117":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"要点："},"2118":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"**回调是 `C-unwind` 的** `fn(user_data, stage: u32, payload_json) -> i32`：返回 `0` 继续、**非 0 中断本阶段**。\n中断只影响**本阶段剩下的层**，管线继续走下一阶段（已经改过的负载照样往下传），宿主记一条 warning。"},"2119":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"**中间件一条更新跑一遍，不是每个监听器跑一遍**：`InPlugin` 的产出就是所有监听器看到的版本。\n按监听器各跑一遍的话，第 N 个会看到被改过 N 次的负载。"},"2120":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"洋葱模型：进入段在「继续往下」之前，退出段在之后。不往下走就是中断。"},"2121":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"Rust 侧 `MiddlewareHandle` 只是一个 `u64`，drop 不会摘除；注册后一直有效到插件卸载。"},"2122":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"阶段号非法或回调为空会让 `use_middleware` 直接返回无效句柄（不会静默挂个空层）。"},"2123":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"想看订阅与双通道怎么配合，见 订阅与事件；工具调用的格式最终由宿主层决定，\n契约本身见 ABI 契约。"},"2124":{"id":"/docs/script","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"page","content":"脚本插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","脚本插件"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/script"},"2125":{"id":"/docs/script-0","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"Python / JS / TS 写逻辑：由独立的 fuyubot.script 插件托管，不编译、装上就跑"},"2126":{"id":"/docs/script-1","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#它是怎么搭起来的","content":"它是怎么搭起来的"},"2127":{"id":"/docs/script-2","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#装宿主插件","content":"装宿主插件"},"2128":{"id":"/docs/script-3","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#前置条件","content":"前置条件"},"2129":{"id":"/docs/script-4","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"写第一个脚本"},"2130":{"id":"/docs/script-5","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#装进机器人","content":"装进机器人"},"2131":{"id":"/docs/script-6","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"装好之后会发生什么"},"2132":{"id":"/docs/script-7","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#脚本目录在哪","content":"脚本目录在哪"},"2133":{"id":"/docs/script-8","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#排查","content":"排查"},"2134":{"id":"/docs/script-9","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"**运行时不认识 Python，也不认识 JavaScript。** 脚本能力**完全由另一个插件提供**：\nFuyuBot-Script 打出的 `fuyubot.script`。\n它本身就是一个普通的 ABI 插件——装进 `plugins/` 之后，替宿主去扫 `plugins/scripts/`、\n给每个脚本起一个子进程、把事件和请求来回搬。"},"2135":{"id":"/docs/script-10","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"所以这一块和「插件开发」是两件事："},"2136":{"id":"/docs/script-11","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"|       | 原生插件（插件开发） | 脚本插件（本板块）               |\n| ----- | ---------- | ----------------------- |\n| 谁提供能力 | 运行时本体      | 独立的 `fuyubot.script` 插件 |","table":"table-0"},"2137":{"id":"/docs/script-12","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"|      | 原生插件（插件开发）                     | 脚本插件（本板块）             |\n| ---- | ------------------------------ | --------------------- |\n| 你写什么 | Rust / C / C++ / Go，编译成 cdylib | Python / JS / TS，一个目录 |","table":"table-0"},"2138":{"id":"/docs/script-13","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"|      | 原生插件（插件开发） | 脚本插件（本板块） |\n| ---- | ---------- | --------- |\n| 要编译吗 | 要          | 不要        |","table":"table-0"},"2139":{"id":"/docs/script-14","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"|     | 原生插件（插件开发）   | 脚本插件（本板块）    |\n| --- | ------------ | ------------ |\n| 边界  | 与宿主同进程，C ABI | 一个脚本一个解释器子进程 |","table":"table-0"},"2140":{"id":"/docs/script-15","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"|       | 原生插件（插件开发） | 脚本插件（本板块）       |\n| ----- | ---------- | --------------- |\n| 崩了会怎样 | 可能拖垮宿主     | 只有那个子进程死，宿主记一条错 |","table":"table-0"},"2141":{"id":"/docs/script-16","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#它是怎么搭起来的","content":"一个中间插件、两个语言运行时、N 个脚本进程："},"2142":{"id":"/docs/script-17","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#它是怎么搭起来的","content":"**一个脚本一个进程**：脚本崩溃、死循环、内存涨爆，都只影响它自己。"},"2143":{"id":"/docs/script-18","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#它是怎么搭起来的","content":"**stdio 协议**：脚本的 stdout / stdin 上跑「一行一个 JSON」。薄 SDK 把它包成函数调用，\n作者看不到任何 `op` / `tag` / `handle`。"},"2144":{"id":"/docs/script-19","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#它是怎么搭起来的","content":"**子作用域**：每个脚本的订阅、工具、中间件都落在自己的作用域里，停掉它只撤它自己的注册。"},"2145":{"id":"/docs/script-20","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装宿主插件","content":"去 FuyuBot-Script Releases\n下载对应平台的 `fuyubot-script-<OS>-<平台>.zip`（例：`fuyubot-script-windows-x86_64.zip`）。"},"2146":{"id":"/docs/script-21","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装宿主插件","content":"解压，把里面的 `plugins/fuyubot.script/` **整个目录**放进机器人的 `plugins/`。"},"2147":{"id":"/docs/script-22","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装宿主插件","content":"重启 `fuyubot`。"},"2148":{"id":"/docs/script-23","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装宿主插件","content":"`fuyubot plugin list` 的「原生插件包」那一段里能看到 `fuyubot.script`；\n「脚本插件」那一段列出 `plugins/scripts/` 里已经装好的脚本。"},"2149":{"id":"/docs/script-24","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装宿主插件","content":"运行时发行包里**不带**脚本能力：内置插件只有 `/start`、`/help`、`/plugins` 那几个。\n脚本插件单独发版、单独升级，装与不装都不影响运行时本体。"},"2150":{"id":"/docs/script-25","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#前置条件","content":"**uv 和 bun 必须自己先装好**：它们不在运行时发行包里，也不会被自动下载。\n只装了 `fuyubot.script` 却没装对应运行时，那门语言的脚本一律起不来\n（日志里是「找不到 uv / bun」），机器人本体照常跑。"},"2151":{"id":"/docs/script-26","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#前置条件","content":"| 语言     | 要装  | 谁在用                                |\n| ------ | --- | ---------------------------------- |\n| Python | uv  | `uv sync` 装依赖，`uv run <entry>` 起脚本 |","table":"table-1"},"2152":{"id":"/docs/script-27","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#前置条件","content":"| 语言      | 要装           | 谁在用                                 |\n| ------- | ------------ | ----------------------------------- |\n| JS / TS | bun（≥ 1.3.1） | `bun install` 装依赖，`bun <entry>` 起脚本 |","table":"table-1"},"2153":{"id":"/docs/script-28","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#前置条件","content":"只缺其中一门，只会让那门语言的脚本起不来；机器人本体照常跑，日志里会有提示。"},"2154":{"id":"/docs/script-29","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"一个目录就是一个插件，身份写在 manifest 里。Python 用 `pyproject.toml`："},"2155":{"id":"/docs/script-30","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"JS / TS 用 `package.json`："},"2156":{"id":"/docs/script-31","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"入口文件只用薄 SDK，不需要任何构建步骤："},"2157":{"id":"/docs/script-32","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"按语言看完整方法表与示例："},"2158":{"id":"/docs/script-33","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"<Card title=\"Python 插件\" href=\"/docs/script/python/\" />"},"2159":{"id":"/docs/script-34","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"<Card title=\"JS 与 TypeScript 插件\" href=\"/docs/script/js-ts/\" />"},"2160":{"id":"/docs/script-35","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装进机器人","content":"整个目录被复制到 `plugins/scripts/<目录名>/`。目录名是装卸载的单位，\nmanifest 里的 `name` 是插件身份——两者不必相同（卸载时用目录名）。"},"2161":{"id":"/docs/script-36","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装进机器人","content":"要把它打成可分发的 zip（带 `plugin.json`、`kind` 写 `python` / `js`），见\n插件分发格式 v1。"},"2162":{"id":"/docs/script-37","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                           | 机器人的反应                                        |\n| ----------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin install <目录>` | 整个目录拷进 `plugins/scripts/<目录名>/`，下次 `run` 自动加载 |","table":"table-2"},"2163":{"id":"/docs/script-38","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                            | 机器人的反应                                               |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| 运行中往 `plugins/scripts/` 丢一个新目录 | 约一秒内发现 → `uv sync` / `bun install` → 起进程 → 等 `ready` |","table":"table-2"},"2164":{"id":"/docs/script-39","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的         | 机器人的反应                    |\n| ----------- | ------------------------- |\n| 运行中删掉一个脚本目录 | 杀掉对应子进程并撤掉它的注册（跑着的实例上也安全） |","table":"table-2"},"2165":{"id":"/docs/script-40","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的      | 机器人的反应              |\n| -------- | ------------------- |\n| 改了脚本里的代码 | **不**自动重启；改完重启机器人即可 |","table":"table-2"},"2166":{"id":"/docs/script-41","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                              | 机器人的反应    |\n| -------------------------------- | --------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin uninstall <目录名>` | 删掉目录并停掉脚本 |","table":"table-2"},"2167":{"id":"/docs/script-42","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"两个数量级上的细节："},"2168":{"id":"/docs/script-43","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"**启动有 10 秒预算**：`plugin_start` 最多等每个脚本 10 秒报 `ready`，超时算这个脚本失败。\n第一次 `uv sync` / `bun install` 可能更久——先手动装一遍依赖再启动会快很多。"},"2169":{"id":"/docs/script-44","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"**只认目录增删，不做热更新**：watch 只比较「顶层有哪些脚本目录」，\n所以 `node_modules` / `.venv` 里的文件风暴不会触发任何动作，代价是改代码必须重启。"},"2170":{"id":"/docs/script-45","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"脚本身份必须能被静态读到：Python 的 `[tool.fuyubot]`、JS 的 `\"fuyubot\"` 段。\n两样都没有的目录不是插件，`plugin list` 不会列它，`run` 也不会跑它。"},"2171":{"id":"/docs/script-46","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#脚本目录在哪","content":"固定是**插件目录下的 `scripts/`**（默认 `plugins/scripts/`），没有配置项可以改。\n想换地方就整体换插件目录（`fuyubot run --plugin-dir …` 或 `[plugins].dir`）。"},"2172":{"id":"/docs/script-47","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#排查","content":"**`plugin list` 里没有某个脚本**：目录里没有身份段，或者入口文件不在，\n或者它在 `.disabled/` 里。"},"2173":{"id":"/docs/script-48","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#排查","content":"**脚本起不来**：先看日志里那条 `ready` 超时/退出码；常见原因是 `uv` / `bun` 没装、\n依赖装不上、入口文件路径写错。"},"2174":{"id":"/docs/script-49","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#排查","content":"**「找不到 fuyubot 原生桥库」**：薄 SDK 要加载 `fuyubot_script` 那份 dll。\n宿主起脚本时会自动设 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` 指过去，所以**别把 dll 挪出\n`plugins/fuyubot.script/`**；实在要挪就自己设这个变量。"},"2175":{"id":"/docs/script-50","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#排查","content":"**改了代码没反应**：不热重载，重启机器人。"},"2176":{"id":"/docs/script-51","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#排查","content":"**想看得更细**：把 `[plugins].log_level` 调成 `\"debug\"`，脚本的 `log()` 会原样转发到宿主日志。"},"2177":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"page","content":"JS 与 TypeScript 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","脚本插件"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts"},"2178":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-0","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts","content":"bun 上的薄 SDK：方法表、事件过滤、`_` 写 @type，以及异步写法"},"2179":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-1","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"方法一览"},"2180":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-2","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#事件","content":"事件"},"2181":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-3","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#写-tdlib-参数_-就是-type","content":"写 TDLib 参数：`_` 就是 `@type`"},"2182":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-4","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#调-tdlib","content":"调 TDLib"},"2183":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-5","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#异步runasync--invokeasync--waitasync","content":"异步：`runAsync` / `invokeAsync` / `waitAsync`"},"2184":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-6","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#日志工具与中间件","content":"日志、工具与中间件"},"2185":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-7","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#完整示例","content":"完整示例"},"2186":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-8","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#现在还没有的能力","content":"现在还没有的能力"},"2187":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-9","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"2188":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-10","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts","content":"JS / TS 脚本插件同样是一个目录：`package.json` 写身份，`index.ts` 写逻辑，\n`fuyubot` 是从 npm 装的薄 SDK。宿主插件与安装流程见 脚本插件。"},"2189":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-11","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts","content":"要求 **bun ≥ 1.3.1**（SDK 用的是 `bun:ffi`，旧版本的 `cstring` 参数行为不一样）。\nTS 不需要额外配置，bun 直接跑 `.ts`。"},"2190":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-12","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                            | 干什么                     |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `on(event, handler, filter?)` | 订阅一条事件；返回回调对象，可交给 `off` |","table":"table-0"},"2191":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-13","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法              | 干什么             |\n| --------------- | --------------- |\n| `off(callback)` | 退订 `on` 返回的那个对象 |","table":"table-0"},"2192":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-14","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                     | 干什么                     |\n| -------------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `invoke(method, params?, onResponse?)` | 发一条 TDLib 请求；给了回调就按请求配对 |","table":"table-0"},"2193":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-15","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                             | 干什么                                    |\n| ------------------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| `invokeAsync(method, params?)` | `invoke` 的 Promise 版，只能在 `runAsync` 里用 |","table":"table-0"},"2194":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-16","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                               | 干什么                     |\n| -------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `waitAsync(filter?, timeoutMs?)` | 等一条匹配的更新；超时/取消返回 `null` |","table":"table-0"},"2195":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-17","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                      | 干什么                     |\n| ----------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `emit(event, payload?)` | 发一条自定义事件（自己 + 全局订阅者收得到） |","table":"table-0"},"2196":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-18","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                     | 干什么                                                     |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `log(message, level?)` | 打日志；level：`error` / `warn` / `info` / `debug` / `trace` |","table":"table-0"},"2197":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-19","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                               | 干什么                  |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | -------------------- |\n| `registerTool(name, description?, inputSchema?)` | 登记工具的**元数据**（没有执行回调） |","table":"table-0"},"2198":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-20","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                              | 干什么                                           |\n| ------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `useMiddleware(stage, handler)` | 挂中间件，`handler(stage, payload)`，`stage` 是 0..5 |","table":"table-0"},"2199":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-21","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法      | 干什么                            |\n| ------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `run()` | 发 `ready` 握手，然后阻塞收事件——**最后一行** |","table":"table-0"},"2200":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-22","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                | 干什么                                |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `runAsync(main?)` | Promise 版：原生桥在后台读 stdin，JS 事件循环继续跑 |","table":"table-0"},"2201":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-23","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"和 Python 一样的两条：**不是装饰器**（`on` 是个普通函数）、**`run()` / `runAsync()`\n都阻塞到进程结束**，写在文件最后。"},"2202":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-24","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#事件","content":"事件名就是 TDLib 更新的 `@type`，另外每条更新还会落到兜底的 `\"update\"` 通道。\n自己 `emit()` 的事件只送自己 + 全局订阅者。"},"2203":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-25","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#事件","content":"过滤器是「点分路径 = 期望值」，所有条件都相等才触发："},"2204":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-26","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#写-tdlib-参数_-就是-type","content":"TDLib 的每个对象都要带判别字段 `@type`，写起来啰嗦。JS / TS 的 SDK 允许你写 `_`，\n发送前会**递归**换成 `@type`（`vector<T>` 里的对象也一样）；两个都写时以 `@type` 为准。"},"2205":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-27","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#写-tdlib-参数_-就是-type","content":"这层规整只在 JS / TS 侧有，Python 侧要老老实实写 `\"@type\"`。"},"2206":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-28","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#调-tdlib","content":"`invoke` 不阻塞、立刻返回；请求号由 SDK 配对。方法名与字段以 TDLib 为准（不是 Bot API），\n发送一律是 `sendMessage` + `input_message_content`。"},"2207":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-29","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#异步runasync--invokeasync--waitasync","content":"`runAsync` 在后台线程读 stdin，但**回调在主线程的 `step()` 循环里分发**\n（bun 的 JSCallback 不能跨线程调）；`main` 与 step 循环并行跑，直到宿主关掉管道。"},"2208":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-30","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#异步runasync--invokeasync--waitasync","content":"`invokeAsync` 的 **TDLib 业务错误也会 resolve**（返回 `@type: \"error\"` 的对象），\n只有宿主拒绝请求才 reject。"},"2209":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-31","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#异步runasync--invokeasync--waitasync","content":"`waitAsync` 是一次性订阅：命中或超时后自动退订；`timeoutMs=0` 表示一直等。"},"2210":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-32","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#异步runasync--invokeasync--waitasync","content":"不用 `main` 也行：`await runAsync()` 只跑事件循环，`on` 回调里自己起异步任务。"},"2211":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-33","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#日志工具与中间件","content":"中间件的六阶段与原生插件一致，见 工具与中间件。"},"2212":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-34","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**回声机器人**："},"2213":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-35","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**命令处理器**："},"2214":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-36","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#现在还没有的能力","content":"薄 SDK 只覆盖「收事件、发请求、打日志、登记工具、挂中间件」。下面这些宿主的 ABI\n有、但 JS / TS 侧**还没暴露**："},"2215":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-37","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#现在还没有的能力","content":"读写 `[plugin.<名字>]` 配置段"},"2216":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-38","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#现在还没有的能力","content":"调用其它插件注册的工具 / 共享服务"},"2217":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-39","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#现在还没有的能力","content":"`simplify` 操作表（发消息等结局、Markdown → entities 之类）"},"2218":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-40","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#现在还没有的能力","content":"原生插件不受这个限制，见 插件 ABI。"},"2219":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-41","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**`Cannot find package 'fuyubot'`**：依赖没装进脚本目录。`bun add fuyubot`，\n再重启机器人（或先手动 `bun install`）。"},"2220":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-42","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**`bun:ffi` 报错 / 回调收不到**：先确认 bun ≥ 1.3.1；再确认 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB`\n指到了 `plugins/fuyubot.script/` 里的那份 dll（宿主起脚本时会自动设）。"},"2221":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-43","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**自检**：`bun node_modules/fuyubot/fuyubot.ts` 只验证 API 形状、不碰宿主，\n输出 `fuyubot: self-test ok`；它仍要能加载原生桥（宿主起脚本时会设 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB`，\n手动跑就自己指到 `fuyubot_script` 那份 dll）。"},"2222":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-44","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**类型**：`fuyubot` 自带 `fuyubot.d.ts`，不需要手写声明；TDLib 负载是 `any`，\n`update.message` 之类记得判空。"},"2223":{"id":"/docs/script/python","page_id":"/docs/script/python","type":"page","content":"Python 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","脚本插件"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/python"},"2224":{"id":"/docs/script/python-0","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python","content":"薄 SDK 的方法表、事件与过滤、异步等待，以及能直接抄的例子"},"2225":{"id":"/docs/script/python-1","page_id":"/docs/script/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"方法一览"},"2226":{"id":"/docs/script/python-2","page_id":"/docs/script/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/python#事件","content":"事件"},"2227":{"id":"/docs/script/python-3","page_id":"/docs/script/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/python#调-tdlib","content":"调 TDLib"},"2228":{"id":"/docs/script/python-4","page_id":"/docs/script/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/python#异步run_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"异步：`run_async` / `invoke_async` / `wait_async`"},"2229":{"id":"/docs/script/python-5","page_id":"/docs/script/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/python#日志工具与中间件","content":"日志、工具与中间件"},"2230":{"id":"/docs/script/python-6","page_id":"/docs/script/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/python#完整示例","content":"完整示例"},"2231":{"id":"/docs/script/python-7","page_id":"/docs/script/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/python#现在还没有的能力","content":"现在还没有的能力"},"2232":{"id":"/docs/script/python-8","page_id":"/docs/script/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/python#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"2233":{"id":"/docs/script/python-9","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python","content":"Python 脚本插件就是一个目录：`pyproject.toml` 写身份，`main.py` 写逻辑，\n`fuyubot` 是从 PyPI 装的薄 SDK。装宿主插件、装脚本的流程见 脚本插件，\n本页只讲**怎么写**。"},"2234":{"id":"/docs/script/python-10","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python","content":"要求 Python ≥ 3.11。SDK 的 Python 包是 `fuyubot`，用 uv 装进项目："},"2235":{"id":"/docs/script/python-11","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                | 干什么                     |\n| --------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `on(event, handler, filter=None)` | 订阅一条事件；返回回调对象，可交给 `off` |","table":"table-0"},"2236":{"id":"/docs/script/python-12","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法              | 干什么             |\n| --------------- | --------------- |\n| `off(callback)` | 退订 `on` 返回的那个对象 |","table":"table-0"},"2237":{"id":"/docs/script/python-13","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                              | 干什么                                    |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `invoke(method, params=None, on_response=None)` | 发一条 TDLib 请求；给了 `on_response` 就按请求配对回调 |","table":"table-0"},"2238":{"id":"/docs/script/python-14","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                  | 干什么                                          |\n| ----------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `invoke_async(method, params=None)` | `invoke` 的 `await` 版，只能在 `run_async` 的事件循环里用 |","table":"table-0"},"2239":{"id":"/docs/script/python-15","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                      | 干什么                            |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `wait_async(filter=None, timeout_ms=0)` | `await` 一条匹配的更新；超时/取消返回 `None` |","table":"table-0"},"2240":{"id":"/docs/script/python-16","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                          | 干什么                     |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `emit(event, payload=None)` | 发一条自定义事件（自己 + 全局订阅者收得到） |","table":"table-0"},"2241":{"id":"/docs/script/python-17","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                           | 干什么                                                       |\n| ---------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `log(message, level=\"info\")` | 打日志；`level`：`error` / `warn` / `info` / `debug` / `trace` |","table":"table-0"},"2242":{"id":"/docs/script/python-18","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                                       | 干什么                  |\n| -------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `register_tool(name, description=\"\", input_schema=None)` | 登记工具的**元数据**（没有执行回调） |","table":"table-0"},"2243":{"id":"/docs/script/python-19","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                               | 干什么                                           |\n| -------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `use_middleware(stage, handler)` | 挂中间件，`handler(stage, payload)`，`stage` 是 0..5 |","table":"table-0"},"2244":{"id":"/docs/script/python-20","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法      | 干什么                              |\n| ------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `run()` | 发 `ready` 握手，然后阻塞收事件——**永远最后一行** |","table":"table-0"},"2245":{"id":"/docs/script/python-21","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                     | 干什么                                                    |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `run_async(main=None)` | 同上，但跑 asyncio 事件循环；要 `invoke_async` / `wait_async` 就用它 |","table":"table-0"},"2246":{"id":"/docs/script/python-22","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"三个容易踩的："},"2247":{"id":"/docs/script/python-23","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"**不是装饰器**。`@on(\"updateNewMessage\")` 会报错，老老实实写 `on(\"updateNewMessage\", handler)`。"},"2248":{"id":"/docs/script/python-24","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"**回调只在 `run()` / `run_async()` 之后才有**。模块顶层可以注册订阅、挂中间件，\n但事件要等握手完成才会来。"},"2249":{"id":"/docs/script/python-25","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"**`run()` 和 `run_async()` 都阻塞到进程结束**，写在文件最后，后面不要有代码。"},"2250":{"id":"/docs/script/python-26","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#事件","content":"事件有两个来源："},"2251":{"id":"/docs/script/python-27","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#事件","content":"**TDLib 更新**：事件名就是更新的 `@type`（`updateNewMessage`、`updateMessageSendSucceeded`……）。\n每条更新同时发到两条通道：具体的 `@type`，和兜底的 `\"update\"`。"},"2252":{"id":"/docs/script/python-28","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#事件","content":"**你自己 `emit()` 的事件**：只送**自己 + 全局订阅者**，不会广播给别的插件。"},"2253":{"id":"/docs/script/python-29","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#事件","content":"**过滤器**是「点分路径 = 期望值」，所有条件都相等才触发："},"2254":{"id":"/docs/script/python-30","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#事件","content":"同一个事件可以订阅多次，各带各的过滤器。订阅会一直有效到进程结束，\n需要提前退订就留住 `on` 的返回值、交给 `off`。"},"2255":{"id":"/docs/script/python-31","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#调-tdlib","content":"`method` 是 TDLib 的方法名（**不是** Bot API），`params` 是方法参数（不需要写 `@type`）。\n给了 `on_response` 时，响应回来会调它——请求号由 SDK 配对，你不用记。"},"2256":{"id":"/docs/script/python-32","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#调-tdlib","content":"`invoke` **不阻塞**、立刻返回。不传 `on_response` 就是「发完不管」；\n要等结果请用异步版，别在回调里轮询。"},"2257":{"id":"/docs/script/python-33","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#调-tdlib","content":"方法名和字段拿不准就查 TDLib 文档或 `td_api.tl`：发送一律是 `sendMessage` +\n`input_message_content`，`sendPhoto` / `sendDocument` 这类 Bot API 名字在 TDLib 里不存在。"},"2258":{"id":"/docs/script/python-34","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#异步run_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"同步的 `run()` 没有事件循环，回调里不能 `await`。要 `await` 就把启动换成 `run_async`："},"2259":{"id":"/docs/script/python-35","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#异步run_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"`run_async` 把读 stdin 的原生桥放到后台线程，主线程跑 asyncio 事件循环；\n`main` 在握手之后作为任务启动，函数返回后循环继续跑，直到宿主关掉管道。"},"2260":{"id":"/docs/script/python-36","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#异步run_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"`invoke_async` 的 **TDLib 业务错误也会 resolve**（返回 `@type: \"error\"` 的对象），\n只有宿主拒绝请求时才抛异常——别指望 `try/except` 接住 TDLib 的报错。"},"2261":{"id":"/docs/script/python-37","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#异步run_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"`wait_async` 是**一次性**订阅：命中或超时后自动退订；`timeout_ms=0` 表示一直等。"},"2262":{"id":"/docs/script/python-38","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#异步run_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"不想用 `main` 也行：`run_async()` 只跑事件循环，`on` 回调里自己\n`asyncio.create_task(...)`。"},"2263":{"id":"/docs/script/python-39","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#日志工具与中间件","content":"中间件的六阶段与原生插件一致，细节见 工具与中间件。"},"2264":{"id":"/docs/script/python-40","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#完整示例","content":"**回声机器人**——只复读别人发的文本："},"2265":{"id":"/docs/script/python-41","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#完整示例","content":"**命令处理器**——不同命令各干各的，靠过滤器分流："},"2266":{"id":"/docs/script/python-42","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#现在还没有的能力","content":"薄 SDK 只覆盖「收事件、发请求、打日志、登记工具、挂中间件」。下面这些宿主的 ABI\n有、但 Python 侧**还没暴露**，遇到需要它们的场景只能等 SDK 补："},"2267":{"id":"/docs/script/python-43","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#现在还没有的能力","content":"读写 `[plugin.<名字>]` 配置段"},"2268":{"id":"/docs/script/python-44","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#现在还没有的能力","content":"调用其它插件注册的工具 / 共享服务"},"2269":{"id":"/docs/script/python-45","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#现在还没有的能力","content":"`simplify` 操作表（发消息等结局、Markdown → entities 之类）"},"2270":{"id":"/docs/script/python-46","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#现在还没有的能力","content":"原生插件不受这个限制，见 插件 ABI。"},"2271":{"id":"/docs/script/python-47","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#常见问题","content":"**`ModuleNotFoundError: fuyubot`**：依赖没装进脚本自己的 `.venv`。在脚本目录里\n`uv add fuyubot`，再重启机器人（或先手动 `uv sync`）。"},"2272":{"id":"/docs/script/python-48","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#常见问题","content":"**「找不到 fuyubot 原生桥库」**：SDK 靠 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` 找 `fuyubot_script` 那份 dll，\n宿主起脚本时会自动设好；把 dll 挪出 `plugins/fuyubot.script/` 就会失效。\n排法见 脚本插件 › 排查。"},"2273":{"id":"/docs/script/python-49","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#常见问题","content":"**自检**：`python -m fuyubot` 只验证 API 形状、不碰宿主，输出 `fuyubot: self-test ok`；\n它仍要能加载原生桥，先把 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` 指到 `fuyubot_script` 那份 dll。"},"2274":{"id":"/docs/script/python-50","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#常见问题","content":"**payload 取字段先判空**：不同更新类型字段位置不同；`updateNewMessage` 的文本在\n`message.content.text.text`，而且 `message.content` 可能根本没有 `text`。"},"2275":{"id":"/docs/usage/build","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"page","content":"从源码构建","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build"},"2276":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build","content":"开发者路线：自己编 fuyubot"},"2277":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"前置"},"2278":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"构建"},"2279":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"编出来的东西在哪"},"2280":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#发布包是怎么出的","content":"发布包是怎么出的"},"2281":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#自检","content":"自检"},"2282":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build","content":"普通用户请走 下载与安装——发布包里有可执行文件和 `tdjson`，不用编译。\n这一页是给要改代码、或者平台没有发布包（比如 Intel Mac）的人。"},"2283":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置   | 要求                    |\n| ---- | --------------------- |\n| Rust | 1.99+（`edition 2024`） |","table":"table-0"},"2284":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置      | 要求                               |\n| ------- | -------------------------------- |\n| Windows | MSVC 工具链（Rust / C / C++ 插件都用它链接） |","table":"table-0"},"2285":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置   | 要求                   |\n| ---- | -------------------- |\n| 构建输入 | 一份 `td_api.tl`（下面说明） |","table":"table-0"},"2286":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置  | 要求                           |\n| --- | ---------------------------- |\n| 运行期 | `tdjson` 动态库（构建期会被拷到可执行文件同级） |","table":"table-0"},"2287":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"`td_api.tl` 是**构建的必需输入**：`fuyubot-tdlib-sys/build.rs` 无条件去拿它——`TDLIB_TD_API_TL`（显式指定，优先级最高）→ **包内 `vendor/<tdlib-version>/td_api.tl`** → 缓存 → 从 GitHub Releases 下载，拿不到就让**构建失败**。包内那份随 crate 一起发布（1.8.70 已带），所以从 crates.io 装下来的下游与 docs.rs **不用联网**；升 `tdlib-version` 时要记得补 `vendor/<新版本>/`。缓存根顺序：`FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE` → `$CARGO_HOME/fuyubot-tdlib-vendored` → 项目本地 `<工作区>/.tdlib-cache`。仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已把最后一档指好，在仓库里敲命令不用先 export。"},"2288":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"转换在**编译期**完成，构建日志里只有一条 `已转换 …\\td_api.tl：共 N 条`。条数取决于构建时用的那份文件（本机三千多条），**不是常量**，别当断言用。"},"2289":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"`tdjson` 是**运行时**动态加载的，编译期不依赖它存在——所以构建成功不代表运行找得到。构建期 `fuyubot-tdlib/build.rs` 会把它（连同那个目录里的兄弟 DLL）拷到可执行文件同级目录，`target/debug/fuyubot.exe` 拷走就能跑。唯一例外是 `cargo install` 装出来的二进制：安装目录不受构建脚本管，tdjson 得自己放。"},"2290":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"| 命令                           | 产物                         | 说明  |\n| ---------------------------- | -------------------------- | --- |\n| `cargo build -p fuyubot-cli` | `target\\debug\\fuyubot.exe` | 开发用 |","table":"table-1"},"2291":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"| 命令                  | 产物                           | 说明                  |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `cargo package-bot` | `target\\release\\fuyubot.exe` | 本地打包（tdjson 已在同级目录） |","table":"table-1"},"2292":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"| 命令          | 产物  | 说明                    |\n| ----------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `cargo bot` | —   | 一键 `fuyubot run` 当前目录 |","table":"table-1"},"2293":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"别名就这三个，都写在仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml`（只影响本仓）。"},"2294":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"本文档其余页面里的 `fuyubot` / `fuyubot.exe` 指的就是这些产物；从发布包安装的用户手里就是解压出来的那个。"},"2295":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#发布包是怎么出的","content":"`.github/workflows/release-bot.yml` 在 `v*` tag 上按平台编 `fuyubot` 与三个内置插件，\n**构建阶段就组好最终布局**（内置插件按分发格式 v1 铺成 `plugins/<id>/` 目录包，不单独打包），\n每平台出一份中间 `.tar.gz`，`publish` 再转成各平台一个 zip：\n解压出来**就是本体**（没有外层目录），里面有可执行文件、该平台的 `tdjson`\n（从 `TDLib-v<版本>` 那个 Release 取）和 `plugins/`。\n名字与 `crates/fuyubot-tdlib/src/loader/vendored.rs` 的 `ASSETS` 表同一套口径（`x86_64` / `aarch64`），\n加平台时两边一起加。"},"2296":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#自检","content":"真 TDLib 的端到端自检（要本机的 `tdjson`）："},"2297":{"id":"/docs/usage/config","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"page","content":"配置文件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config"},"2298":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config","content":"fuyubot.toml 的字段与默认值"},"2299":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"字段"},"2300":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#命令头与白名单","content":"命令头与白名单"},"2301":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#角色主人与管理员","content":"角色：主人与管理员"},"2302":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#tdlib-对象缓存","content":"TDLib 对象缓存"},"2303":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"插件自己的配置段"},"2304":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#三层包默认--运行时落盘--你写的","content":"三层：包默认 / 运行时落盘 / 你写的"},"2305":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"读写"},"2306":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"几条约定"},"2307":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"改了配置怎么生效"},"2308":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config","content":"`fuyubot run` 读 `fuyubot.toml`，**所有键都有默认值**。缺这个文件时 `run` 会按模板自动生成一份（等价于先跑一次 `fuyubot init`）——`--replay` 是例外，它不会为了回放在你的目录里留配置。"},"2309":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config","content":"> `run --tui` 的**配置页**可以直接改核心项：`↑↓` 选中、`Enter` / `e` 编辑，写回时保留注释与 CRLF。\n> 运行中改完需重启实例；`api_hash`、Bot Token / 手机号 / 密码和 `[plugin.*]` 段只读。"},"2310":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config","content":"一个项目目录长这样："},"2311":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键            | 默认值       | 它决定什么                     |\n| ------------ | --------- | ------------------------- |\n| `[bot].name` | `fuyubot` | 显示名（启动那行、`status` 里的「名字」） |","table":"table-0"},"2312":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键              | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                             |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[bot].api_id` | `0` | **旧位置**；`[telegram].api_id` 优先。新配置写进 `[telegram]` |","table":"table-0"},"2313":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                         | 默认值   | 它决定什么                                                         |\n| ------------------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[telegram].account_type` | `bot` | 登录走哪条路：`bot` → Bot Token；`user` → 手机号 / 扫码。**写错报错**，不会静默当 bot |","table":"table-0"},"2314":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                   | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                                     |\n| ------------------- | --- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[telegram].api_id` | `0` | TDLib api_id（到 my.telegram.org 申请）。不是秘密；`0` = 没配，`run` 会问 |","table":"table-0"},"2315":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                     | 默认值    | 它决定什么                                      |\n| --------------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `[telegram].data_dir` | `data` | TDLib 的数据目录：database 与 files **都**指它。相对项目根 |","table":"table-0"},"2316":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                  | 默认值                     | 它决定什么                                                                                                                     |\n| ------------------ | ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[command].prefix` | bot `[\"/\"]`user `[\".\"]` | 命令头**数组**，可配多个（每项单个字符，不能是字母 / 数字 / 空白）。不写按账号默认：bot 认 `/`、user 认 `.`。写了就**整套替换**（bot 不再自动保留 `/`）。user 账户下 `/` 即使写进数组也始终不生效 |","table":"table-0"},"2317":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                     | 默认值  | 它决定什么                                                                    |\n| --------------------- | ---- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `[command].whitelist` | `[]` | 额外允许触发命令的用户 id（数字）。user 账户自己发的始终触发；bot 账户非空时只响应表里的用户。**主人 / 全局管理员不受它影响** |","table":"table-0"},"2318":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                          | 默认值    | 它决定什么                                                                                        |\n| -------------------------- | ------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[command].whitelist_only` | `true` | user 账户的**白名单模式**：只响应自己与 `whitelist` 里的用户。改成 `false` 可关，但 **⚠️ 不建议**——关掉后任何人都能触发插件；bot 不受它影响 |","table":"table-0"},"2319":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-21","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                | 默认值  | 它决定什么                                                                                    |\n| ---------------- | ---- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[roles].owners` | `[]` | 主人用户 id。最高权限；列表为空时 user 账户默认自己是主人，配置后按列表来（可换成别人）。bot 账户必须显式配置。主人绕过 `[command].whitelist` |","table":"table-0"},"2320":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-22","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                | 默认值  | 它决定什么                                                                   |\n| ---------------- | ---- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[roles].admins` | `[]` | 全局管理员用户 id。能用 `admin` 级命令，但不能用 `owner` 级；群里的 Telegram 管理员**不**自动成为全局管理员 |","table":"table-0"},"2321":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-23","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                 | 默认值    | 它决定什么                                               |\n| ----------------- | ------ | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[cache].enabled` | `true` | 是否启用宿主 TDLib 对象缓存；关掉后 `Simplify` 直连 TDLib，连接状态判断仍保留 |","table":"table-0"},"2322":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-24","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                  | 默认值   | 它决定什么                                                                                                        |\n| ------------------ | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `[cache].capacity` | `100` | **每种类型**（chat / user / basic_group / supergroup / chat_member / community / community_full_info）的条数上限，LRU 淘汰 |","table":"table-0"},"2323":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-25","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键               | 默认值       | 它决定什么                                                     |\n| --------------- | --------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[plugins].dir` | `plugins` | `run` 从这里加载插件（动态库 + `scripts/` 下的脚本插件）；`--plugin-dir` 覆盖它 |","table":"table-0"},"2324":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-26","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                     | 默认值    | 它决定什么                                                                                                                                   |\n| --------------------- | ------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[plugins].log_level` | `info` | 插件日志的最低级别：error / warn / info / debug / trace。排查插件时调成 `\"debug\"`；**写错级别名会报错**。运行中也可以在 `run --tui` 的日志页按 `Tab` 聚焦工作区后按 `l` 临时调整（只对本次运行生效） |","table":"table-0"},"2325":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-27","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键              | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                          |\n| -------------- | --- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `[tdlib].path` | 空   | 留空 = 按四级优先级自动找 tdjson；指定时给 tdjson 的**目录**或文件路径 |","table":"table-0"},"2326":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-28","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                       | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                                              |\n| ----------------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `[tdlib].log_verbosity` | `1` | TDLib 日志详细度。TDLib 自己的默认更啰嗦（每轮 `td_receive` 的超时都打到 stderr）；负数按 0 处理 |","table":"table-0"},"2327":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-29","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                | 默认值 | 它决定什么        |\n| ---------------- | --- | ------------ |\n| `[plugin.<插件名>]` | 无   | 插件自己的配置段（见下） |","table":"table-0"},"2328":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-30","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#命令头与白名单","content":"`[command].prefix` 是**数组**，可以配多个命令头："},"2329":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-31","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#命令头与白名单","content":"不写时按账号类型取默认值：**bot 认 `/`**（`/start`、`/help`…），**user 认 `.`**（`.help`）。\n配了就是**整套替换**——bot 不会额外保留 `/`，要用就把它写进数组；\n而 user 账户下 `/xxx` **始终**不交给插件（Telegram 客户端占用 `/`），即使写进数组。\n放行的非 `/` 命令头会被宿主归一化成 `/xxx`，插件拿到的仍然是 `/cmd`。\n写错的那一项会告警并跳过；一个能用的都没有时回退到账号默认值。"},"2330":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-32","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#命令头与白名单","content":"**user 账户默认白名单模式**：只有账号自己发出的消息，或在 `[command].whitelist` 里的\n用户 id，才能触发它的命令；别人发的命令一律不触发。"},"2331":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-33","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#命令头与白名单","content":"这个模式可以在配置里关掉："},"2332":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-34","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#命令头与白名单","content":"`whitelist_only = false` 之后，user 账户不再按 `whitelist` 过滤（自己发的仍然按“自己触发”\n处理，回复走编辑）。**不建议关闭**：任何人发来的命令都会进插件，user 账户尤其容易被滥用。\nbot 账户不受这个开关影响；`whitelist` 非空时 bot 仍只响应表里的用户。"},"2333":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-35","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#命令头与白名单","content":"**主人 / 全局管理员始终放行**：在 `[roles].owners` / `.admins` 里的人不受\n`[command].whitelist` 或 `whitelist_only` 影响——即使不在白名单里、即使白名单模式开着，\n他们发命令也能进插件。bot 账户额外排除自己的出站消息，这一条对主人也成立。"},"2334":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-36","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#命令头与白名单","content":"插件回复命令统一走 `Command::reply` / `Command::reply_then`（其它语言走\n`fuyubot.host.command` service）：宿主决定发新消息还是编辑原命令消息——bot 账户 / user 账户里\n白名单用户触发 → `sendMessage` + `reply_to`；user 账户**自己**触发 → 编辑原命令消息。"},"2335":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-37","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#角色主人与管理员","content":"**用 bot 账户时必须配主人。** bot **没有隐式主人**——Telegram 没有「这个 bot 是谁建的」\n这种接口，宿主无从推断，所以 `[roles].owners` 为空时 `owner` / `admin` 级命令**谁都触发不了**，\n而且不会报错（内置的 `/plugins` 就是 `owner` 级）。宿主会在启动 / 登录后打一行告警提醒，\n看到就把 id 补上。"},"2336":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-38","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#角色主人与管理员","content":"`[command].whitelist` 决定**能不能触发**；`[roles]` 决定**触发后能做什么**。两者分开："},"2337":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-39","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#角色主人与管理员","content":"**bot 账户**：`owners` 为空 = 没有主人，必须手写 id（问 @userinfobot 查）；"},"2338":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-40","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#角色主人与管理员","content":"**user 账户**：`owners` 为空时**自己默认就是主人**，不配也能用 `owner` 级命令；\n一旦写了 `owners` 就完全按列表来——自己不在表里就不再是主人，可以换成别人；"},"2339":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-41","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#角色主人与管理员","content":"主人 / 管理员**绕过** `whitelist` 与 `whitelist_only`，始终能触发；"},"2340":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-42","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#角色主人与管理员","content":"群里的 Telegram 管理员是**会话角色**，由宿主现查，不会因为写进这里就变成全局管理员。"},"2341":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-43","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#角色主人与管理员","content":"> 改 `owners` 时先把自己 id 写进去：一旦列表非空，user 账户自己就不再自动是主人；\n> 忘记写自己会丢失 `owner` 级命令，普通命令不受影响。"},"2342":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-44","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#角色主人与管理员","content":"命令的 `role` / `scopes` 元数据见命令表与 /help。"},"2343":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-45","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#tdlib-对象缓存","content":"宿主会缓存 chat / user / 群 / 社区 / 成员，`Simplify` 默认缓存优先："},"2344":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-46","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#tdlib-对象缓存","content":"LRU 淘汰；chat list 是独立索引，不占这 100 条配额；"},"2345":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-47","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#tdlib-对象缓存","content":"`chat_member` 带 30 秒 TTL；"},"2346":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-48","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#tdlib-对象缓存","content":"离线且缓存未命中时直接返回，不再等 TDLib 超时；"},"2347":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-49","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#tdlib-对象缓存","content":"关掉 `enabled` 只是不读写缓存，不会改变命令 / 权限语义。"},"2348":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-50","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#tdlib-对象缓存","content":"详见 TDLib 对象缓存。"},"2349":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-51","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"每个插件在 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 下可以有自己的配置，键值任意、可嵌套。插件名是点分的\n（`define_plugin!` / 脚手架里登记的那个名字，如 `fuyubot.manage`），所以在 TOML 里自然写成\n嵌套表——`[plugin.fuyubot.manage]` 就代表插件 `fuyubot.manage` 那段："},"2350":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-52","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#三层包默认--运行时落盘--你写的","content":"插件读到的配置是三层叠出来的，**后面的只填前面的缺失键**："},"2351":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-53","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#三层包默认--运行时落盘--你写的","content":"| 层   | 在哪                                                        | 谁写        |\n| --- | --------------------------------------------------------- | --------- |\n| 包默认 | 插件包里的 `config.default.toml`（`plugin.json` 的 `config` 指向它） | 插件作者，随包升级 |","table":"table-1"},"2352":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-54","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#三层包默认--运行时落盘--你写的","content":"| 层     | 在哪                               | 谁写              |\n| ----- | -------------------------------- | --------------- |\n| 运行时落盘 | `<项目根>/plugin-config/<插件名>.toml` | 插件 `set_config` |","table":"table-1"},"2353":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-55","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#三层包默认--运行时落盘--你写的","content":"| 层    | 在哪                              | 谁写    |\n| ---- | ------------------------------- | ----- |\n| 用户配置 | `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<名>]` | **你** |","table":"table-1"},"2354":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-56","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#三层包默认--运行时落盘--你写的","content":"也就是说：**你在 `fuyubot.toml` 里写了的键，优先级最高**，插件改不动它（`set_config`\n会直接返回错误，而不是「这次改成功、下次启动又被你盖回去」）。想让插件自己管某个键，\n就别在 `fuyubot.toml` 里写它。"},"2355":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-57","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"插件在**运行时**读它、写它，走的是 ABI 接口（不是 `plugin_start` 的那个 `config_json`）："},"2356":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-58","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"**读**：`get_config(section, key)` —— `section` 就是**配置文件里的段名**：\n`plugin.fuyubot.music`、`[plugin.fuyubot.music]`、裸插件名 `fuyubot.music` 都认，\n顶层写 `[bot]` / `[telegram]` 也行；**空串 = 读自己那段**（与写同一个默认）。\n`key` 空串读整段，`key` 是点路径（`nested.k`）。"},"2357":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-59","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"**写**：`set_config(key, value_json)` —— **只能写自己名下的段**（没有 section 参数，宿主按执行者身份判定，插件无法伪造）。成功 = 写内存 + 落盘到 `plugin-config/<插件名>.toml`；宿主这次启动没有配置文件、或这个键被用户配置钉住时**直接报错**。"},"2358":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-60","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"**写别人的段**：`set_config_section(section, key, value_json)` —— 段名写法同上，\n显式点名目标插件，给协作插件同步设置用。**只接受 `plugin.*`**（顶层归你，写了会被拒），\n其余规则完全一样（用户钉住的键照样拒绝、只落目标那个文件），宿主会记一行「谁改了谁的配置」。"},"2359":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-61","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"`fuyubot.toml` **运行时永远不会被插件改写**：你手写的注释、顺序、`api_hash` 都不会被卷走。"},"2360":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-62","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"各语言的写法：Rust 插件、C / C++ 插件，\n函数签名在插件 ABI。**脚本插件的薄 SDK 目前还没有读写配置的接口**——\n脚本要参数只能写在脚本目录里（跟着目录一起装），配置段暂时读不到。"},"2361":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-63","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"`plugin-config/<插件名>.toml` 是**插件自己的记忆**：文件内容就是那一段配置本身（不带\n`[plugin.x]` 头），插件名里的特殊字符按 `%XX` 编码。删掉这个文件 = 让插件忘掉它自己存过的东西\n（包默认和 `fuyubot.toml` 不受影响）。写入是先写 `.toml.tmp` 再 `rename`，掉电不会留半截文件。"},"2362":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-64","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"**从旧版本升级**：以前插件把状态直接写进 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<名>]`。升级后那些键算\n「用户配置」，优先级最高——插件再写它们会被拒绝。把想交还给插件管的键从 `fuyubot.toml`\n删掉即可（值会转到 `plugin-config/` 那一层继续用）。"},"2363":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-65","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"模板（`fuyubot init` 生成的就是它）："},"2364":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-66","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"**凭据**：`api_id` / `api_hash` 每次冷启动都要随 `setTdlibParameters` 发出；`fuyubot run` 问过之后会把 `api_hash` **明文写回** `[telegram]`。不想落盘就用 `TG_API_ID` / `TG_API_HASH`。Bot Token、手机号、验证码、两步验证密码仍然只走环境变量或交互输入。session 由 TDLib 落在 `data_dir`。"},"2365":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-67","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"**相对路径相对配置文件所在目录**（也就是项目根）：`plugins`、`data`、日志目录都按它解析。\n插件也吃这一条：`fuyubot run` 在加载插件之前会把**进程工作目录切到项目根**，所以插件配置里的相对路径（如 `cache` / `Cache`）和插件起的子进程，都落在 `fuyubot.toml` 旁边，而不是「你在哪个目录敲的命令」。"},"2366":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-68","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"**自动 init 只认默认文件名**：缺 `fuyubot.toml` 时 `run` 会生成一份；但用 `--config 别的名字` 时不会凭空造，直接报错。"},"2367":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-69","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"`status` / `stop` **不替你造配置**：找不到 `fuyubot.toml` 就报「先 `fuyubot init` 建一个」——面对的是已经存在的实例，凭空建一个只会更迷惑。"},"2368":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-70","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"`--plugin-dir` 覆盖 `[plugins].dir`，`--config` 换配置文件本身。"},"2369":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-71","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"想知道**某一行到底生效成了什么**（含默认值）：`fuyubot config` 直接打出来，见 `fuyubot` 命令参考。"},"2370":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-72","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"字段读出来后，运行参数（凭据来源、加载顺序）见 运行与实例管理；`account_type` 之外没有别的自定义登录入口。"},"2371":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-73","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"配置在 `run` 启动时读一次。改完要重启实例："},"2372":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-74","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"`--replay` 不占单实例锁，所以它可以和跑着的实例并存、跑完就退，适合改插件期间反复试。"},"2373":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-75","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"改完先别急着重启：`fuyubot config --config demo\\fuyubot.toml` 会打印生效值，`account_type` 之类写错时当场就能看出来（那一行是 `⚠️` 开头，而 `run` 要走到登录才报）。"},"2374":{"id":"/docs/usage/env","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"page","content":"环境变量","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env"},"2375":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"每个变量的读取者与作用"},"2376":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"构建期 vs 运行期"},"2377":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"凭据"},"2378":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env#只在自动-init-那一次生效","content":"只在自动 init 那一次生效"},"2379":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                | 谁读                                    | 作用                                 |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `TDLIB_TD_API_TL` | `fuyubot-tdlib-sys/build.rs`（**构建期**） | 显式指定 `td_api.tl`，优先级最高（完全离线构建就这么干） |","table":"table-0"},"2380":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                             | 谁读                     | 作用                                                                         |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE` | 两个 `build.rs`（**构建期**） | 缓存根：`td_api.tl` 与 vendored 动态库都放这儿。**必须绝对路径**（build.rs 的 CWD 是各自的 crate 根） |","table":"table-0"},"2381":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                            | 谁读                  | 作用                                                                        |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_RELEASES_REPO` | `build.rs`（**构建期**） | 覆盖 `[package.metadata.fuyubot] releases-repo`（默认 `CatMoeCircle/Fuyu-Bot`） |","table":"table-0"},"2382":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                  | 谁读           | 作用                                 |\n| ------------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH` | 加载器（**运行期**） | tdjson 的目录或文件，查找优先级 1；嫌四级排查麻烦就直接设它 |","table":"table-0"},"2383":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量          | 谁读                      | 作用                                                             |\n| ----------- | ----------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `TG_API_ID` | `fuyubot run` / `login` | TDLib api_id（**不是**秘密）。参与凭据解析（`--api-id` 之后、配置之前），也顺手带进自动生成的配置 |","table":"table-0"},"2384":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量            | 谁读                             | 作用                                  |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------ | ----------------------------------- |\n| `TG_API_HASH` | `fuyubot run` / `login` / 集成测试 | api_hash，**凭据**。它优先于配置里已保存的值，且不会被写回 |","table":"table-0"},"2385":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量             | 谁读                             | 作用                                    |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------- |\n| `TG_BOT_TOKEN` | `fuyubot run` / `login` / 集成测试 | bot 账号的 token；有值就不问 Bot Token，后台运行也能登 |","table":"table-0"},"2386":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量             | 谁读                               | 作用                                  |\n| -------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_NAME` | `fuyubot run` / `login` 的自动 init | 自动生成配置时的 `[bot].name`（默认 `fuyubot`） |","table":"table-0"},"2387":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                     | 谁读          | 作用                                            |\n| ---------------------- | ----------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_REGISTRY_URL` | TUI 商店（运行期） | 临时覆盖 `[plugins].registry_url`（商店索引地址）；优先级高于配置 |","table":"table-0"},"2388":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"**`FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE` 只在构建期读。** 运行期用的是构建时烤进二进制的路径（`cargo:rustc-env` 写进去的 `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_DIR`——那是构建产物，不是让你设的变量）。运行时动态库最终由加载器的四级优先级决定，**不读** `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE`。"},"2389":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"缓存根是一串候选，顺序即优先级："},"2390":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"前两档写不进去时会退到项目本地那档；**全都写不进去**才退到 `$OUT_DIR`——那个目录每次重跑构建脚本都会被清空，于是下次构建会重新下载（构建脚本会明确警告）。仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已经把项目本地那档指好了。"},"2391":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"**Bot Token、手机号、验证码、两步验证密码一律不落盘**：不得写进仓库任何文件、`fuyubot.toml`、测试夹具或日志，只允许**环境变量**与**交互式输入**两个来源。`api_id` / `api_hash` 是例外——它们每次冷启动都要发给 TDLib，`run` 问过之后会明文写回 `fuyubot.toml`（见 配置文件），所以那份文件要当密钥看待。"},"2392":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"`api_id` **不是**凭据，写进配置没问题（`[telegram].api_id`）。"},"2393":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"`api_hash` 三个来源，按序：`TG_API_HASH` → 配置里已保存的（`[telegram].api_hash`）→ 交互提问。问出来的会被写回配置，之后就不用再输。"},"2394":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"后台运行没有 stdin：没有 session、也没 `TG_BOT_TOKEN` 时会直接失败；首次连 `api_id` / `api_hash` 也问不了，先在前台 `run` 一次（或设好上表那两个环境变量）。"},"2395":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#只在自动-init-那一次生效","content":"`FUYUBOT_NAME` 只在 `run` / `login` **自动生成配置**时被读（缺 `fuyubot.toml`，或 `--config` 指向默认文件名而它不存在）。配置已存在就不参与——否则每次跑都会覆盖你手写的名字。"},"2396":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-21","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#只在自动-init-那一次生效","content":"`TG_API_ID` 不一样：它除了带进自动生成的配置，还是**每次** `run` / `login` 解析 `api_id` 的一档\n（`--api-id` → `TG_API_ID` → 配置 → 交互提问）。它只覆盖 `api_id`，不会动 `[bot].name`。"},"2397":{"id":"/docs/usage","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"page","content":"下载与安装","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage"},"2398":{"id":"/docs/usage-0","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage","content":"下载对应平台的包，解压就能跑"},"2399":{"id":"/docs/usage-1","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"下载哪个包"},"2400":{"id":"/docs/usage-2","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#android用官方-app","content":"Android：用官方 App"},"2401":{"id":"/docs/usage-3","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"解压、验证"},"2402":{"id":"/docs/usage-4","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#起一个-bot-项目","content":"起一个 bot 项目"},"2403":{"id":"/docs/usage-5","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#先把主人配上","content":"先把主人配上"},"2404":{"id":"/docs/usage-6","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#跑起来推荐tui","content":"跑起来（推荐：TUI）"},"2405":{"id":"/docs/usage-7","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#不接账号先验一遍","content":"不接账号先验一遍"},"2406":{"id":"/docs/usage-8","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#目录布局","content":"目录布局"},"2407":{"id":"/docs/usage-9","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"下一步"},"2408":{"id":"/docs/usage-10","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage","content":"不用装 Rust、不用编译：到 Releases 下对应平台的 zip，\n解压后里面就是可执行文件，**TDLib 动态库已经和它放在同一个目录**（运行时按「可执行文件所在目录」\n自动找到，不用配环境变量、不用单独装 TDLib），内置插件在同级的 `plugins/<id>/`（插件包：\n`plugin.json` + `bin/` 里的动态库）。"},"2409":{"id":"/docs/usage-11","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"资产名是 **`fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip`**（例：`fuyubot-v0.1.0-windows-x86_64.zip`）：\n`<版本>` 就是 Release 版本号，带在名字里方便一眼看出下的是哪个；`<OS>` = windows / linux / macos，\n`<平台>` = x86_64 / aarch64（cargo 口径，和 TDLib 自己的资产同序）。"},"2410":{"id":"/docs/usage-12","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统                 | 资产                                | 包里有什么                                                    |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Windows 10/11（x64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-windows-x86_64.zip` | `fuyubot.exe` + `tdjson.dll` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"2411":{"id":"/docs/usage-13","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统                | 资产                                 | 包里有什么                                                    |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Windows 11（ARM64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-windows-aarch64.zip` | `fuyubot.exe` + `tdjson.dll` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"2412":{"id":"/docs/usage-14","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统            | 资产                              | 包里有什么                                                  |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Linux（x86_64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-linux-x86_64.zip` | `fuyubot` + `libtdjson.so` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"2413":{"id":"/docs/usage-15","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统           | 资产                               | 包里有什么                                                  |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Linux（ARM64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-linux-aarch64.zip` | `fuyubot` + `libtdjson.so` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"2414":{"id":"/docs/usage-16","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统                   | 资产                               | 包里有什么                                                     |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| macOS（Apple Silicon） | `fuyubot-<版本>-macos-aarch64.zip` | `fuyubot` + `libtdjson.dylib` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"2415":{"id":"/docs/usage-17","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"**解压出来就是本体**：zip 里没有额外的一层目录，建议先建一个空目录再往里解压。"},"2416":{"id":"/docs/usage-18","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"**内置插件是目录包**：`plugins/fuyubot.start/`、`plugins/fuyubot.help/`、`plugins/fuyubot.manage/`\n里各有一份 `plugin.json` 和 `bin/`；`init` / `run` 会按这个布局装进项目（老项目的平铺 dll\n会自动迁成包，不会重复加载）。"},"2417":{"id":"/docs/usage-19","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"归档一律 `.zip`（Windows 资源管理器双击就能解，Linux / macOS 用 `unzip`）。"},"2418":{"id":"/docs/usage-20","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"**上面没有的平台**（Intel Mac 等）暂时没有包，自己编：见 从源码构建。"},"2419":{"id":"/docs/usage-21","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"想让机器人支持 Python / JS / TS 脚本，要**另装脚本插件**：到\nFuyuBot-Script Releases 下\n`fuyubot-script-<OS>-<平台>.zip`，解压后把 `plugins/fuyubot.script/` 放进插件目录。"},"2420":{"id":"/docs/usage-22","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#android用官方-app","content":"Android 上**推荐直接用图形客户端** FuyuBot-for-Android\n（fuyuTD，Kotlin + Compose，内核与本仓同源），到 Release 下对应 ABI 的\n`fuyubot-<版本>-arm64-v8a.apk` / `fuyubot-<版本>-x86_64.apk` 安装即可。"},"2421":{"id":"/docs/usage-23","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#android用官方-app","content":"它负责初始化目录、登录、启停和日志查看，不需要在 Termux 里手敲 CLI，也不用自己配 TDLib。\n桌面 / 服务器继续用下面的 zip 包。"},"2422":{"id":"/docs/usage-24","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#android用官方-app","content":"脚本插件**只装它本身还不够**：Python 脚本要 uv，\nJS / TS 脚本要 bun（≥ 1.3.1）。这两个运行时不在发行包里、\n也不会被自动下载——缺了哪门，那门语言的脚本就起不来（机器人本体照常跑）。"},"2423":{"id":"/docs/usage-25","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"先建一个空目录再解压（zip 里没有套层目录，直接解到当前目录会把文件摊开）："},"2424":{"id":"/docs/usage-26","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"Linux / macOS："},"2425":{"id":"/docs/usage-27","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"macOS 从网上下载的二进制会被 Gatekeeper 拦住，解一次隔离属性："},"2426":{"id":"/docs/usage-28","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"`--version` 能打印版本号，说明这个可执行文件本身没坏；真正加载 TDLib 是在 `run` 的时候\n（日志里会有一行 `TDLib 1.8.70 命中「可执行文件所在目录」`——版本号是构建时声明的那个）。加载失败按\n常见问题 排查。"},"2427":{"id":"/docs/usage-29","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#起一个-bot-项目","content":"`api_id` 到 my.telegram.org 申请，**它不是秘密**，可以直接写进配置；`api_hash` 是凭据，\n但每次启动都要发给 TDLib，所以 `run` 首次问过之后会把明文写回 `fuyubot.toml`（也可以事先设环境变量 `TG_API_HASH`\n让它一次都不问）——那份文件要当密钥看待，别提交进版本库（见 配置文件）。"},"2428":{"id":"/docs/usage-30","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#先把主人配上","content":"**用 bot 账户时这一步不能省。** `[roles].owners` 为空就等于**没有主人**：`owner` / `admin`\n级命令谁都触发不了（内置的 `/plugins` 就是 `owner` 级），而且不报错——宿主会在启动 /\n登录后打一行告警提醒。user 账户不受影响，**自己默认就是主人**。"},"2429":{"id":"/docs/usage-31","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#先把主人配上","content":"**bot 账户**：必须显式写 `owners`，bot 没有隐式主人；"},"2430":{"id":"/docs/usage-32","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#先把主人配上","content":"**user 账户**：`owners` 为空时自己默认是主人；写了 `owners` 就按列表来，自己不在表里就不再是主人（可以换成别人）；"},"2431":{"id":"/docs/usage-33","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#先把主人配上","content":"主人 / 全局管理员**不受** `[command].whitelist` / `whitelist_only` 影响；"},"2432":{"id":"/docs/usage-34","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#先把主人配上","content":"群里的 Telegram 管理员是**会话角色**，不会因为写进 `[roles]` 就变成全局管理员。"},"2433":{"id":"/docs/usage-35","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#先把主人配上","content":"改完重启实例生效，细节见配置文件 · 角色。"},"2434":{"id":"/docs/usage-36","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来推荐tui","content":"也可以先 `cd demo`，再直接运行 `..\\\\fuyubot.exe`（不带子命令 = 同一个面板，全默认参数）。"},"2435":{"id":"/docs/usage-37","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来推荐tui","content":"**首次登录**：按 `s` 会自动检查登录；缺 `api_id` / `api_hash` 先弹两步输入，\n随后弹 bot token / 手机号 / 验证码输入框。不用先跑 `fuyubot login`。"},"2436":{"id":"/docs/usage-38","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来推荐tui","content":"**日常启停**：`s` 启动、`x` 再按 `y` 停止；`L` 只登录、不启动。"},"2437":{"id":"/docs/usage-39","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来推荐tui","content":"**日志 / 配置 / 商店**：左侧导航，商店在插件下面。"},"2438":{"id":"/docs/usage-40","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来推荐tui","content":"面板本身不占实例锁；启动后可以退出面板，实例继续在后台跑。"},"2439":{"id":"/docs/usage-41","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来推荐tui","content":"> **服务器 / CI / 无终端**再用手敲的 `run`（或 `run --background`）：\n>\n> ```powershell\n> .\\\\fuyubot.exe run --config demo\\\\fuyubot.toml\n> ```\n>\n> 无终端下没有 stdin，登录要提前用 `fuyubot login` 或环境变量准备好。"},"2440":{"id":"/docs/usage-42","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来推荐tui","content":"真账号的最后一环**没有端到端验过**：`run` 会问凭据、驱动授权状态机、`getMe` 打印账户，然后才开分发；\n真库上的登录与 session 复用是在 `fuyubot-tdlib` 的 `-- --ignored` 自检里验的，但「收真更新 → 插件回一条」\n还没有真账号证据。想先确认插件行为，用下面的 `--replay` 或 `--no-login`。"},"2441":{"id":"/docs/usage-43","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来推荐tui","content":"**没有插件也能起**（「插件 0 个」），插件是后装的：拿到编好的 `.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib` 之后"},"2442":{"id":"/docs/usage-44","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来推荐tui","content":"插件怎么编见 插件总览。"},"2443":{"id":"/docs/usage-45","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#不接账号先验一遍","content":"回放是**离线**的：把一批更新 JSON 灌进整条管线，请求只留档、不发到 Telegram。先写一条最小的回放文件："},"2444":{"id":"/docs/usage-46","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#不接账号先验一遍","content":"退出码 0 表示回放成功。细节（`--replay-wait`、脚本插件要等静默窗口）见 离线回放。"},"2445":{"id":"/docs/usage-47","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#目录布局","content":"`fuyubot init` 建出来的项目："},"2446":{"id":"/docs/usage-48","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"配置文件\" href=\"/docs/usage/config/\" />"},"2447":{"id":"/docs/usage-49","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"运行与实例管理\" href=\"/docs/usage/run/\" />"},"2448":{"id":"/docs/usage-50","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"离线回放\" href=\"/docs/usage/replay/\" />"},"2449":{"id":"/docs/usage-51","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"CLI 参考\" href=\"/docs/cli/\" />"},"2450":{"id":"/docs/usage-52","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"常见问题\" href=\"/docs/usage/troubleshooting/\" />"},"2451":{"id":"/docs/usage-53","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"从源码构建\" href=\"/docs/usage/build/\" />"},"2452":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"page","content":"离线回放","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay"},"2453":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay","content":"不接账号验证插件"},"2454":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"输出里看什么"},"2455":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"慢插件与脚本插件：`--replay-wait`"},"2456":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#插件目录别指-targetdebug","content":"插件目录别指 `target\\debug`"},"2457":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"与实例的关系"},"2458":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay","content":"`fuyubot run --replay` 把一批更新的 JSON 灌进整条管线后退出：**不接 TDLib、不用账号**，用来在任何机器上验插件。"},"2459":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay","content":"**每条 update 打一行**，`listeners` 是收到它的订阅数。退出码 0 表示回放成功，非零表示插件加载或回放本身失败。"},"2460":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"| 段落                                 | 含义                                   |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `回放 <@type> → UpdateOutcome { … }` | 管线跑完一条更新的结果。`warnings` 非空说明有阶段或回调抱怨过 |","table":"table-0"},"2461":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"| 段落          | 含义                                                     |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `插件打出来的日志：` | 插件 `log` 的原样回显（`Info mybot: init` / `start()` 是插件生命周期） |","table":"table-0"},"2462":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"| 段落          | 含义                                    |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `插件发出去的请求：` | 插件请求的**留档**。回放不连 Telegram，所以请求不会真的发出去 |","table":"table-0"},"2463":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"回放是离线路径，所以插件发请求只留档、也不会等响应——要验「响应回到插件」用真 TDLib，并准备好账号。"},"2464":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"回放完不是立刻退出，而是等一个**安静窗口**再看结果。窗口的默认值按插件形态自动选："},"2465":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"| 插件形态                                                        | 默认窗口    |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------- | ------- |\n| 有脚本（`plugins/scripts/` 下有目录，或插件包里 `kind` 是 `python` / `js`） | 2000 ms |","table":"table-1"},"2466":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"| 插件形态                     | 默认窗口   |\n| ------------------------ | ------ |\n| 纯原生（Rust / C / C++ / Go） | 150 ms |","table":"table-1"},"2467":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"脚本插件跑在子进程里：事件要经管道过去、反应再经管道回来，还可能捎带网络请求，\n窗口太短会把它们的日志与请求整批漏掉。插件要发慢速网络请求就把它调大："},"2468":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#插件目录别指-targetdebug","content":"`--plugin-dir` 要指向「只放你要验的插件」的目录。指 `target\\debug` 会把整仓的示例产物一起加载，\n任何一个起不来都会让输出混进一堆「跳过 xxx」。"},"2469":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#插件目录别指-targetdebug","content":"正确做法是先装到一个干净目录再回放："},"2470":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"`--replay` **不占单实例锁、不发布状态**：同一个目录可以一边跑着实例、一边回放。它也**不会自动 init**（回放不该因为你试了一次就在当前目录留下 `fuyubot.toml`），没有配置就按默认值跑，也不碰 `.fuyubot/` 里的实例状态。"},"2471":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"回放**不接 TDLib**（无论有没有 `tdjson`）：这是硬约定，否则回放就要账号和网络。"},"2472":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"要看运行中的实例、后台跑、优雅停止，见 运行与实例管理。"},"2473":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"回放里插件加载失败，多半是 ABI 版本或路径的问题，见 常见问题。"},"2474":{"id":"/docs/usage/run","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"page","content":"运行与实例管理","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run"},"2475":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run","content":"前台/后台运行、status、stop 与单实例锁"},"2476":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"一个目录一个实例"},"2477":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#无终端前台运行","content":"无终端：前台运行"},"2478":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#后台运行","content":"后台运行"},"2479":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"操作面板（`--tui`）"},"2480":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#看状态","content":"看状态"},"2481":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#停掉","content":"停掉"},"2482":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"常见情形"},"2483":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run","content":"> **桌面用户推荐先看操作面板**：直接运行 `fuyubot`（不带子命令）或\n> `run --tui`，登录、启停、日志、配置、商店都在一个界面里。本页的 `run` 主要给\n> 服务器 / CI / 无终端场景。"},"2484":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"实例状态与运行期控制放在 `<项目根>/.fuyubot/` 下，**每件事各占一个文件**："},"2485":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"| 文件              | 作用                                                                 |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `.fuyubot/lock` | **只用来独占**（`try_lock`，进程死即释放）。里面不存内容——Windows 的文件锁是强制的，别的进程读不到被锁的字节 |","table":"table-0"},"2486":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"| 文件                | 作用                                                                                         |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `.fuyubot/status` | `key=value`：pid / started / version / log_level / plugins / name。**启动完成之后**才发布（拿上锁只说明进程活着） |","table":"table-0"},"2487":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"| 文件              | 作用                                      |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `.fuyubot/stop` | 停止请求，内容是 PID。`fuyubot stop` 先写它，让实例自己收摊 |","table":"table-0"},"2488":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"| 文件                   | 作用                                                                  |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `.fuyubot/log-level` | **可选的运行期控制**：面板在日志页按 `l` 写它，实例每 500ms 读一次并切换插件日志级别；新实例拿锁时清掉，不会带到下一轮 |","table":"table-0"},"2489":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"第二次 `run`（前台后台都算）会被拒，报错里带上在跑的那个 PID。"},"2490":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"陈旧的 `lock` **不用手工清理**：拿锁时会顺手删掉上一个实例的 `status` / `stop` / `log-level`。"},"2491":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"`--replay` **不占锁、不发布状态**：离线开发路径不该和跑着的实例互斥。"},"2492":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#无终端前台运行","content":"顺序是固定的：自动 init → 拿单实例锁 → attach TDLib → 问/读凭据 → **加载全部插件** → 发 `setTdlibParameters` 并登录 → `getMe` 打印账户 → 发布状态 → 最后才开分发。插件先于登录加载，是为了不漏掉登录窗口里的更新。"},"2493":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#无终端前台运行","content":"| 参数              | 作用                     |\n| --------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `--config <路径>` | 配置文件，默认 `fuyubot.toml` |","table":"table-1"},"2494":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#无终端前台运行","content":"| 参数                  | 作用         |\n| ------------------- | ---------- |\n| `--plugin-dir <目录>` | 覆盖配置里的插件目录 |","table":"table-1"},"2495":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#无终端前台运行","content":"| 参数              | 作用                                                                                   |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `--api-id <ID>` | 覆盖配置里的 `api_id`（**不是**秘密）。优先级：`--api-id` → `TG_API_ID` → 配置 → 交互提问；`api_hash` 没有对应参数 |","table":"table-1"},"2496":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-21","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#无终端前台运行","content":"| 参数           | 作用                                           |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `--no-login` | 只起框架、不走登录流程（CI / 容器；已有 session 仍会被 TDLib 打开） |","table":"table-1"},"2497":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-22","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#无终端前台运行","content":"| 参数           | 作用             |\n| ------------ | -------------- |\n| `--no-tdlib` | 不接 TDLib，只加载插件 |","table":"table-1"},"2498":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-23","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#无终端前台运行","content":"| 参数             | 作用    |\n| -------------- | ----- |\n| `--background` | 放到后台跑 |","table":"table-1"},"2499":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-24","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#无终端前台运行","content":"| 参数               | 作用                                             |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `--tui`（短写 `-t`） | 打开终端操作面板（见下节）；与 `--background` / `--replay` 互斥 |","table":"table-1"},"2500":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-25","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#无终端前台运行","content":"| 参数                                       | 作用     |\n| ---------------------------------------- | ------ |\n| `--replay <JSON>` / `--replay-wait <MS>` | 见 离线回放 |","table":"table-1"},"2501":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-26","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#无终端前台运行","content":"凭据来源（按序）：`TG_API_ID` / `TG_API_HASH` → 配置里已保存的 `[telegram].api_id` / `.api_hash` → 交互式提问。**交互问出来的会被写回配置文件**，下次冷启动不用再输（这两个值每次都要随 `setTdlibParameters` 发出去，session 有效也一样）。Bot Token 仍只认 `TG_BOT_TOKEN` 或交互输入、不落盘，详见 环境变量。"},"2502":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-27","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#后台运行","content":"它派生一个没有终端的自己，stdout/stderr 写进 `<目录>logs\\fuyubot.log`（每次新启动先清空旧日志）；父进程等子进程**真起来**（`.fuyubot/status` 发布）才返回。"},"2503":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-28","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#后台运行","content":"后台跑**没有 stdin**。要交互式登录的场合（还没有 session、也没给 `TG_BOT_TOKEN`）会直接失败，并把日志尾巴打出来指路——先用前台 `run` 或 `fuyubot login` 登一次，session 会落在 `data/`。首次连 `api_id` / `api_hash` 也问不了：先在前台跑一次让它写回配置，或设好 `TG_API_ID` / `TG_API_HASH`。"},"2504":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-29","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#后台运行","content":"想单独把登录走完而不起框架，用 `fuyubot login`；要退出登录（清掉本地会话）用 `fuyubot logout`。"},"2505":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-30","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"两个入口是同一个面板：**不带子命令**时全走默认值（配置文件默认 `fuyubot.toml`），\n需要自定配置 / 参数才用 `run --tui`。面板需要真终端，非 TTY 下会报错而不是画出半屏。"},"2506":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-31","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"首次缺 `api_id` / `api_hash` 时，按 `s`（启动）或 `L`（只登录）会先弹两步输入框；\n填完明文写回 `[telegram]`，再继续登录 / 启动。已经在配置或环境变量里的不会重复问。"},"2507":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-32","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"打开的是**操作面板**，不是前台 bot：顶部版本栏（`[fuyubot - v…]`；实例运行中才显示状态，\n没跑时只显示刷新时间）、左侧导航、中央工作区、底部两行（当前可用操作 / 资源占用）。\n顶部和底部不铺背景色，当前焦点靠窗口边框高亮 + 底栏的 `[导航]` / `[工作区]` 标记。"},"2508":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-33","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"底部资源行：`CPU · 内存 · 运行时长 · 插件数 · 日志级别 · PID`，采的是**运行中实例的 PID**\n（`sysinfo`）。实例没跑时 CPU / 内存 / 运行 / PID 显示 `—`、插件数为 0，日志级别显示\n面板下次启动会用哪一档；第一个采样点的 CPU 是 `0.0%`，下一秒才有真实值。"},"2509":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-34","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键                  | 作用                  |\n| ------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `Tab` / `Shift+Tab` | 切换焦点：导航 ↔ 工作区（边框高亮） |","table":"table-2"},"2510":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-35","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键              | 作用                                   |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `Enter` / `Esc` | 导航 → 工作区 / 工作区 → 导航（在导航上按 `Esc` 才退出） |","table":"table-2"},"2511":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-36","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键                  | 作用                                  |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `↑` / `↓`、`j` / `k` | 导航焦点：切页；工作区焦点：滚动日志 / 选择配置项 / 移动日志选择 |","table":"table-2"},"2512":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-37","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键        | 作用                       |\n| --------- | ------------------------ |\n| `←` / `→` | 切换顶部标签页（窄屏横向导航；工作区焦点也生效） |","table":"table-2"},"2513":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-38","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键        | 作用             |\n| --------- | -------------- |\n| `h` / `l` | 导航焦点：上一页 / 下一页 |","table":"table-2"},"2514":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-39","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键      | 作用                              |\n| ------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `1`–`6` | 直接跳到概览 / 日志 / 配置 / 插件 / 商店 / 帮助 |","table":"table-2"},"2515":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-40","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键      | 作用                                         |\n| ------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `Enter` | 日志页：进入日志选择模式；配置页：编辑选中的配置项（`e` 同）；插件页：开关选中项 |","table":"table-2"},"2516":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-41","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键      | 作用                                                                        |\n| ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Space` | 插件页 + 工作区焦点：启用 / 禁用选中项（目录挪进 `plugins/.disabled/`，旧形态 dll 加 `.disable` 后缀） |","table":"table-2"},"2517":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-42","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                                   |\n| --- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `y` | 日志选择模式：复制选中行（TDLib Update 复制完整 JSON） |","table":"table-2"},"2518":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-43","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                                                                                            |\n| --- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `s` | 启动 bot：先自动检查登录，缺登录会弹登录框，成功后自动继续（派生 `run --background`，带上面板拿到的 `--api-id` / `--log-level` 等参数） |","table":"table-2"},"2519":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-44","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键      | 作用                           |\n| ------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `L`（大写） | 显式登录：只走登录、不启动实例；通常直接按 `s` 即可 |","table":"table-2"},"2520":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-45","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键        | 作用                                                 |\n| --------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `x` → `y` | 停止 bot（`y` 是确认；`.fuyubot/stop` 走插件的 `plugin_stop`） |","table":"table-2"},"2521":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-46","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                    |\n| --- | --------------------- |\n| `r` | 立刻刷新状态 / 插件 / 日志 / 配置 |","table":"table-2"},"2522":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-47","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                              |\n| --- | ------------------------------- |\n| `l` | 日志页 + 工作区焦点：调整运行中实例的日志级别（下一圈生效） |","table":"table-2"},"2523":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-48","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                       |\n| --- | ------------------------ |\n| `F` | 日志页 + 工作区焦点：按级别 / 来源过滤日志 |","table":"table-2"},"2524":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-49","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                        |\n| --- | ------------------------- |\n| `c` | 日志页 + 工作区焦点：清空当前日志文件（要确认） |","table":"table-2"},"2525":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-50","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                 |\n| --- | ------------------ |\n| `f` | 日志页 + 工作区焦点：跟随末尾开关 |","table":"table-2"},"2526":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-51","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键                             | 作用                                |\n| ------------------------------ | --------------------------------- |\n| `PgUp` / `PgDn`、`Home` / `End` | 工作区焦点：日志 / 帮助翻页、首尾；配置页、插件页选择翻页、首尾 |","table":"table-2"},"2527":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-52","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键           | 作用               |\n| ------------ | ---------------- |\n| `q`、`Ctrl+C` | 退出面板（不会停掉已启动的实例） |","table":"table-2"},"2528":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-53","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"插件页的开关分两种形态："},"2529":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-54","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"**目录**（原生插件包、`plugins/scripts/<名字>/` 下的脚本目录）：整个挪进 `plugins/.disabled/`，\n再按一次挪回原来的位置；"},"2530":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-55","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"**旧形态平铺 dll**：改名 `foo.dll` ↔ `foo.dll.disable`。"},"2531":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-56","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"改完**重启实例**才生效：运行中的实例已经把插件映射进进程了，改名 / 挪目录不会让它当场卸载\n（Windows 上库被占用时改名还会直接失败，面板会报错；先 `x` 停止再按 `Space`）。\n加载器只扫启用态的路径，所以没有第二份「禁用清单」要跟插件目录同步。"},"2532":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-57","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"面板**不占实例锁、不加载插件**；平时也不接 TDLib——TDLib 的数据库同一时刻只能一个进程打开。\n唯一例外是 `s` / `L` 的登录探测：它跑完立刻关掉，再派生子进程。\n面板读 `.fuyubot/status`、配置、插件目录与 `logs/fuyubot.log`；启停都派生子进程，\n和手敲命令走同一条路，所以看到的就是真正在跑的那个实例。"},"2533":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-58","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"日志级别是**运行期**的：配置里的 `[plugins].log_level` 决定启动值，日志页按 `l` 选的值只对\n**本次运行**生效（写 `.fuyubot/log-level`，实例下一圈读并切换），重启后回到配置值。\n`fuyubot status`、面板的日志页与概览都会显示当前生效的级别。"},"2534":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-59","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"日志过滤（`F`）：级别是下限（`info+` = error / warn / info，排除 debug / trace），来源分\n**插件 / 宿主 / 管道 / 更新 / TDLib / 其他**。新日志格式按「插件行 / source 词」归类（旧四列\n也兼容）：`TDLib Update` 追踪归**更新**（级别 trace），TDLib C 库的 `[ N][t …]` 原样行归\n**TDLib**；认不出级别的启动提示按 info 对待。应用后底栏显示 `过滤 info+ · 全部` 与\n`x/y 行`，`c` 在弹框里一键重置。日志字段不按固定列补空格，长行按显示宽度折行\n（续行缩进两格）。"},"2535":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-60","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"TDLib Update 行只显示 `@type`（如 `updateNewMessage`），不铺整段 JSON。日志页按 `Enter`\n进入选择模式，`↑↓` 选行，`y` / `Enter` 复制：TDLib Update 复制**完整 JSON**，其它行复制整行；\n`Esc` 退出选择。"},"2536":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-61","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"后台实例每次新启动都会先清空 `logs/fuyubot.log`；日志页按 `c` 可手动清空当前日志\n（确认后清空并回到跟随末尾，运行中的实例继续写新行）。"},"2537":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-62","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"窄终端（手机 / Termux）会自动收缩：宽度 < 60 列时导航移到工作区上方，变成一行\n横向标签，用 `←` / `→`（工作区焦点也生效）或 `h` / `l`（导航焦点）切换；更窄时标签\n退化成单字。底栏窄屏只留 `CPU / 内存 / 级别`，不显示运行时长、插件数量和 PID；\n配置项窄屏改成「完整键 + 值」两行，帮助页可 `↑↓` / `PgUp` / `PgDn` 滚动；日志窄屏只留\n`HH:MM:SS`、插件名最后一段和级别。复制优先 `termux-clipboard-set`（`termux-api`），\n否则 OSC 52。"},"2538":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-63","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"配置页是**可编辑表格**：段 / 键 / 生效值 / 来源，`↑↓` 选中、`Enter` / `e` 编辑。\n文本、整数和枚举（`account_type` / `log_level`）先校验再写回；写回只替换那一段值，\n保留注释、顺序和 CRLF。值跨行写（多行数组 / 内联表）也能改：整段折叠成一行，值里的\n注释原样搬到新值下面，不会把后面的段弄坏。运行中保存的配置**重启后生效**；`api_hash`、\nBot Token / 手机号 / 密码和 `[plugin.*]` 段只读。配置读不出来时页面显示错误原文，\n改好按 `r` 重读。"},"2539":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-64","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#看状态","content":"`status` 只读 `.fuyubot/`，**不加载插件、不接 TDLib**。三种结果：运行中 / 陈旧（没人在跑，附上次的 pid 与启动时间）/ 没有运行中的实例。还有一种是「有实例在跑、但状态还没发布」，也就是卡在启动里。"},"2540":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-65","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#看状态","content":"登录成功之后还会多一行「账户」（`名字 @用户名（id=…） [bot]`）：`getMe` 拿到就写进 status，\n之后 TDLib 用 `updateUser` 改名字 / 用户名时实例跟着刷新并重发——面板的概览页读的是同一份。"},"2541":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-66","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#停掉","content":"`stop` 的机制：写 `.fuyubot/stop` → 实例每 500 ms 看一次 → 停接收循环 → 卸载插件（跑 `plugin_stop`）→ 停内核 → 放锁；**8 秒不理会才硬杀兜底**。硬杀跑不到插件的 `plugin_stop`，所以别一上来就 `taskkill`。"},"2542":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-67","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#停掉","content":"**Ctrl-C 仍是硬杀**：捕获它要开 tokio 的 `signal` feature（会带进 `mio` + `signal-hook-registry` + `errno`，依赖白名单没放行）。要优雅退出就用 `fuyubot stop`，别按 Ctrl-C。"},"2543":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-68","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象                        | 处理                               |\n| ------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| 重复 `run` 报「已经有实例在跑」，带 PID | 先 `status`，再 `stop`；不要手工删 `lock` |","table":"table-3"},"2544":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-69","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象           | 处理                        |\n| ------------ | ------------------------- |\n| `status` 说陈旧 | 正常，陈旧状态不用清理，下次 `run` 自己接管 |","table":"table-3"},"2545":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-70","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象                      | 处理                         |\n| ----------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| 后台启动后立刻 `status` 报「启动中」 | 状态是在插件加载 + 登录之后才发布的，等一会儿再看 |","table":"table-3"},"2546":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-71","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象       | 处理                            |\n| -------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 进程活着但没更新 | 没登录就收不到任何更新；先用 `--replay` 验插件 |","table":"table-3"},"2547":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"常见问题","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting"},"2548":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","content":"tdjson 找不到、%TEMP%、乱码、插件加载失败"},"2549":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"找不到 tdjson"},"2550":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#lnk1104-cannot-open-file-templnkguidtmp","content":"`LNK1104: cannot open file '...\\Temp\\lnk{GUID}.tmp'`"},"2551":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#中文乱码--行号错位","content":"中文乱码 / 行号错位"},"2552":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"插件加载失败"},"2553":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#回放以非零码中止","content":"回放以非零码中止"},"2554":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#收不到更新--进程停不下来","content":"收不到更新 / 进程停不下来"},"2555":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"**构建成功不代表运行找得到**：`fuyubot-tdlib` 在编译期不依赖 tdjson 存在。缺库时 `run` 不会崩，而是打一行然后继续跑（插件照样加载，只是收不到更新）："},"2556":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"四级查找顺序（不要重排）："},"2557":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                   |\n| --- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 1   | `TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH` 指向的**文件**或**目录** |","table":"table-0"},"2558":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                 |\n| --- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 2   | vendored（构建期烤进去的目录）→ **可执行文件所在目录** |","table":"table-0"},"2559":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                      |\n| --- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | Linux 带版本号的系统库（`libtdjson.so.1.8.70` …） |","table":"table-0"},"2560":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                          |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | 裸库名（`tdjson.dll` / `libtdjson.so`，走 `PATH`） |","table":"table-0"},"2561":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"报错里的 `[1]` … `[4]` 就是这四档的逐条结果，按顺序看就知道断在哪。嫌排查麻烦就直接指定："},"2562":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"加载动态库时会**先查库自己所在的目录**（Windows 上是 `LOAD_WITH_ALTERED_SEARCH_PATH`）。否则 tdjson 的兄弟依赖（libssl / zlib 之类）找不到，报的却是 `ERROR_MOD_NOT_FOUND`（126）——错误信息说「库不在」，实际缺的是它的依赖。所以 tdjson 和它的兄弟 DLL 要放在一起。"},"2563":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"`cargo install` 装出来的二进制是唯一例外：安装目录不受构建脚本管，tdjson 得自己放到它旁边或设 `TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH`。"},"2564":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#lnk1104-cannot-open-file-templnkguidtmp","content":"这是 **MSVC 链接器写不了 `%TEMP%`**（受限环境 / 沙箱里常见），跟你的代码无关。把临时目录指到可写的位置："},"2565":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#lnk1104-cannot-open-file-templnkguidtmp","content":"同一坑的另一面：**测试不许依赖 `%TEMP%`**。仓库约定临时目录一律放 `target/test-tmp/<crate>/<名字>`——MSYS（git bash）会把 `TEMP` 改成 `/tmp`（在 Windows 上解析成当前盘根），受限环境里真实 `%TEMP%` 也可能写不了。换个 shell 就红的测试几乎总是这个原因。"},"2566":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#中文乱码--行号错位","content":"本机 PowerShell 的默认代码页是 cp936：`Get-Content` 会把 UTF-8 当 **GBK** 解码，中文注释直接毁掉，还会**吞换行**导致行号错位（按行号删代码会删错）。看文件内容用编辑器或 `read` 工具，别用 shell 的文本通道读写源码。"},"2567":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#中文乱码--行号错位","content":"脚本插件那条链路的 stdio 两侧已经钉成 UTF-8——Windows 上 Python 默认按系统代码页读管道，不钉就会把中文变乱码。这是 SDK 的职责，插件作者不用管。"},"2568":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"`run` 遇到加载不了的插件会打一行然后**继续**："},"2569":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"`--plugin-dir` 下的东西会被逐个尝试，所以「少加载了一个」不会让整个进程失败——去看这行。"},"2570":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象                | 原因 / 怎么查                                                                     |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `ABI 版本是 N，宿主是 M` | 插件与宿主的 ABI 不匹配：用与宿主 ABI 版本对应的 `fuyubot-abi`（当前 `0.1.3` = ABI v6）重新编译，别拿旧产物硬跑 |","table":"table-1"},"2571":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象                        | 原因 / 怎么查                                                     |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 缺 `plugin_init` / 根本不是动态库 | `dumpbin /exports`（Windows）或 `nm -D`（Linux/macOS）**静态**看导出符号 |","table":"table-1"},"2572":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象       | 原因 / 怎么查                                                                   |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 脚本插件没被加载 | 目录不在 `plugins/scripts/` 下，或缺 `[tool.fuyubot]` / `\"fuyubot\"` 身份段；见脚本插件 › 排查 |","table":"table-1"},"2573":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象              | 原因 / 怎么查                                        |\n| --------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `.dll` 加载报找不到依赖 | 插件把兄弟 DLL 放自己旁边是支持的（加载器先查库所在目录），别把它挪走，也别只拷主 dll |","table":"table-1"},"2574":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"脚本插件不和 dll 同目录：它住在 `plugins/scripts/<目录>/`，由 `fuyubot.script` 插件托管。\n上面那条「文件加载失败」只适用于原生插件。"},"2575":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#回放以非零码中止","content":"多半是插件目录里有你不想要的东西：`--plugin-dir` 指向 `target/debug` 会把整仓示例产物一起加载，任何一个起不来都会让回放中止或输出混进「跳过 xxx」。把要验的插件装进一个干净目录即可。见 离线回放。"},"2576":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url"